msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "As both men worked her from each side, Sarah could see the captain laying down in the corner, watching her."
msgstr "Mientras ambos hombres la trabajaban desde cada lado, Sarah pudo ver al capitán acostado en la esquina, observándola."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "As broad as he was tall, muscles like the trunk of an oak tree."
