msgctxt "speaker:Nickolas"
msgid "Getting out of here? We're in the middle of the Hyral mountains. Better if we'd have just drowned."
msgstr "¿Salir de aquí? Estamos en medio de las montañas Hyral. Sería mucho mejor si nos hubiéramos ahogado."

msgctxt "speaker:Hugh"
msgid "Getting that stuff into the city is hard enough, takes plenty of bribes and what not."
msgstr "Traer esa mierda a la ciudad es difícil por sí solo, requiere sobornos y todo tipo de cosas."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Getting up from the throne, Sarah followed Lady Carolyn down the hallways leading towards the council quarters where each of the council members held their office."
msgstr "Levantándose del trono, Sarah siguió a Lady Carolyn por los pasillos que conducían a los cuarteles donde cada miembro del consejo tenía su despacho."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Getting up on her knees, she balanced herself atop his cock."
msgstr "Subiéndose a rodillas, se equilibró sobre su polla."

msgctxt "speaker-name"
msgid "Gideon"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Gideon began to chuckle."
msgstr "Gideon comenzó a reír."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Gideon clapsed his hands together."
msgstr "Gideon aplaudió con alivio y triunfo."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Gideon drank his beer, quiet in the glow of the campfire."
msgstr "Gideon bebió su cerveza, callado bajo el resplandor de la fogata."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Gideon faked a stab to his heart."
msgstr "Gideon fingió un golpe al corazón."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Gideon is the first to speak."
msgstr "Gideon es el primero en hablar."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Gideon kicked the sand."
msgstr "Gideon pateó la arena."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Gideon laughed and threw up his hands."
msgstr "Gideon rió y levantó las manos."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Gideon laughed mirthlessly."
msgstr "Gideon rió sin alegría."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Gideon laughed to himself."
msgstr "Gideon se rio a solas."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Gideon laughed."
msgstr "Gideon rió."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Gideon leaned back, drinking from his cup."
msgstr "Gideon se recostó, bebiendo de su copa."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Gideon leaned forward, suddenly animated, and began to stare into the fire, deep in thought."
msgstr "Gideon se inclinó hacia adelante, de repente animado, y comenzó a mirar al fuego, profundamente absorto en sus pensamientos."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Gideon leaned forward."
msgstr "Gideon se inclinó hacia adelante."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Gideon looked at her."
msgstr "Gideon la miró."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Gideon looked back at Sarah."
msgstr "Gideon miró a Sarah."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Gideon looked back at her, unmoved."
msgstr "Gideon miró de nuevo hacia ella, sin moverse."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Gideon looked out towards the end of the road and out across the dunes."
msgstr "Gideon miró hacia el final del camino y más allá, sobre las dunas."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Gideon looked past her towards Vaelen."
msgstr "Gideon miró por encima de ella hacia Vaelen."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Gideon looked up at her. Gratitude in his eyes."
msgstr "Gideon miró hacia arriba a ella. Gratitud en sus ojos."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Gideon loudly protested."
msgstr "Gideon protestó en voz alta."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Gideon motioned across the room, where Vaelen was standing, in jovial discussion with a Mythran commander."
msgstr "Gideon señaló hacia el otro lado de la habitación, donde Vaelen estaba en una discusión jovial con un comandante mythran."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Gideon nodded, a grim expression on his face."
msgstr "Gideon asintió, con una expresión sombría en el rostro."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Gideon nodded, saluted, then left."
msgstr "Gideon asintió, saludó y se retiró."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Gideon nodded."
msgstr "Gideon asintió."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Gideon pointed at the map again."
msgstr "Gideon señaló el mapa de nuevo."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Gideon rolled his eyes at her."
msgstr "Gideon le lanzó una mirada de fastidio."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Gideon saluted."
msgstr "Gideon rindió saludo."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Gideon sat down in the glow of the campfire and shrugged."
msgstr "Gideon se sentó en la luz de la hoguera y encogió los hombros."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Gideon scratched his chin."
msgstr "Gideon se rascó la barbilla."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Gideon seemed put at ease by her comment."
msgstr "Gideon pareció tranquilizarse con su comentario."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Gideon shook his head."
msgstr "Gideon negó con la cabeza."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Gideon shrugged."
msgstr "Gideon encogió los hombros."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Gideon sighed, throwing the cup of beer back and refilling it."
msgstr "Gideon suspiró, tirando la copa de cerveza hacia atrás y rellenándola."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Gideon sighed."
msgstr "Gideon suspiró."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Gideon smiled at her."
msgstr "Gideon sonrió a ella."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Gideon smiled back at her."
msgstr "Gideon le devolvió la sonrisa."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Gideon smiled."
msgstr "Gideon sonrió."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Gideon stroked his chin."
msgstr "Gideon acarició su barbilla."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Gideon suddenly looked up."
msgstr "Gideon miró de repente hacia arriba."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Gideon threw up his hands."
msgstr "Gideon levantó las manos."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Gideon told me you've been holed up in your tent ever since we got here."
msgstr "Gideon me dijo que te has quedado encerrada en tu tienda desde que llegamos."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Gideon turned to face her, his eyes now roaming her body without any attempt to hide it."
msgstr "Gideon se giró para mirarla, y sus ojos ahora recorrían su cuerpo sin ningún intento de ocultarlo."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Gideon walked up to the table."
msgstr "Gideon se acercó a la mesa."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Gideon was one of the other commanders in the mercenary company."
msgstr "Gideon era uno de los otros comandantes en la compañía mercenaria."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Gideon was rare in that he actually seemed to consider her the equal that she was."
msgstr "Gideon era inusual en que realmente pareciera considerarla la igual que ella."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Gideon was smiling."
msgstr "Gideon sonreía."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Gideon waved his arms."
msgstr "Gideon agitó los brazos."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Gideon's face is lowered down towards the earth."
msgstr "La cara de Gideon se inclina hacia la tierra."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Gideon's face suddenly sunk."
msgstr "El rostro de Gideon se hundió bruscamente."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Gideon's voice trailed off as though he had failed to convince even himself."
msgstr "La voz de Gideon se desvaneció como si no hubiera logrado convencerse ni siquiera a sí mismo."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Gideon, get up!"
msgstr "¡Gideon, levántate!"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Gideon."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Gideon...you know Vaelen, you know how he gets...but something is wrong with him."
msgstr "Gideon... ¿sabes que Vaelen es así, lo que le pasa... pero algo anda mal con él."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Giggling, the two women are slowly rocked asleep by the motions of the boat, entangled in a deep embrace."
msgstr "Riendo, las dos mujeres se van quedando dormidas lentamente con los movimientos del barco, envueltas en un profundo abrazo."

msgctxt "speaker-name"
msgid "Gilead"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Gilead and his Legions meant certain victory."
msgstr "Gilead y sus legiones aseguraban la victoria."

msgctxt "speaker:Carolyn"
msgid "Gilead believes in a more soft approach."
msgstr "Gilead cree en un enfoque más suave."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Gilead clapped his hands together, and a servant came rushing."
msgstr "Gilead aplaudió las manos y un sirviente acudió corriendo."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Gilead clasped his hands together."
msgstr "Gilead entrelazó las manos."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Gilead did not offer her a seat, so Sarah remained standing."
msgstr "Gilead no le ofreció un asiento, por lo que Sarah permaneció de pie."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Gilead frowned."
msgstr "Gilead frunció el ceño."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Gilead gestured towards the room."
msgstr "Gilead señaló hacia la habitación."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Gilead grinned, amused."
msgstr "Gilead sonrió, divertido."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Gilead grinned."
msgstr "Gilead sonrió."

msgctxt "speaker:Carolyn"
msgid "Gilead has asked for a meeting, in Rahayal. Do him the courtesy of accepting, and I promise you will find him convincing."
msgstr "Gilead ha pedido una reunión, en Rahayal. Hazle el favor de aceptarla, y te prometo que lo encontrarás convincente."

msgctxt "speaker:Carolyn"
msgid "Gilead has invited us to to discuss this matter."
msgstr "Gilead nos ha invitado a discutir este asunto."

msgctxt "speaker:Carolyn"
msgid "Gilead has pledged two legions to support your claim."
msgstr "Gilead ha comprometido dos legiones para respaldar tu reclamo."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Gilead held up his cup."
msgstr "Gilead levantó su copa."

msgctxt "speaker:Carolyn"
msgid "Gilead is a Noctori, you know this much, yes?"
msgstr "¿Gilead es un Noctori, lo sabes, verdad?"

msgctxt "speaker:Carolyn"
msgid "Gilead is a man whose hour draws short. He seeks to become relevant again."
msgstr "Gilead es un hombre cuyo reloj se agota. Busca volver a ser relevante."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Gilead knocked his knuckles against the table."
msgstr "Gilead golpeó los nudillos contra la mesa."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Gilead laughed."
msgstr "Gilead rió."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Gilead leaned back again."
msgstr "Gilead se recostó otra vez."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Gilead leaned back into his throne."
msgstr "Gilead se recostó en su trono."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Gilead leaned back, pausing for a moment."
msgstr "Gilead se recostó, haciendo una pausa por un momento."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Gilead leaned forward."
msgstr "Gilead se inclinó hacia adelante."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Gilead looked off into the distance, recalling memories."
msgstr "Gilead miró hacia el horizonte, recordando recuerdos."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Gilead motioned directly at her to come nearer."
msgstr "Gilead señaló directamente a ella para que se acercara."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Gilead nodded again."
msgstr "Gilead asintió de nuevo."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Gilead nodded."
msgstr "Gilead asintió."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Gilead observes her for a moment."
msgstr "Gilead la observa por un momento."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Gilead pressed open a door and they entered into a different room."
msgstr "Gilead empujó la puerta y entraron en una habitación distinta."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Gilead raised one eyebrow."
msgstr "Gilead levantó una ceja."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Gilead sat back in his throne and waved his hand."
msgstr "Gilead se recostó en su trono y movió la mano."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Gilead sat up."
msgstr "Gilead se sentó."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Gilead seemed pleased, almost as if he had to restrain himself."
msgstr "Gilead parecía complacido, como si tuviera que contenerse."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Gilead seemed unfazed by her sudden panic."
msgstr "Gilead parecía indiferente ante su pánico repentino."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Gilead shrugged."
msgstr "Gilead encogió los hombros."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Gilead sipped from his wine, before placing the cup back on the table."
msgstr "Gilead tomó un sorbo de su vino, antes de colocar la copa nuevamente sobre la mesa."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Gilead smiled and nodded."
msgstr "Gilead sonrió y asintió."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Gilead smiled as he looked from Sarah to Carolyn."
msgstr "Gilead sonrió mientras miraba de Sarah a Carolyn."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Gilead smiled, revealing a row of sharp teeth."
msgstr "Gilead sonrió, revelando una hilera de dientes afilados."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Gilead smiled."
msgstr "Gilead sonrió."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Gilead threw up his hands."
msgstr "Gilead levantó las manos."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Gilead took a few steps back from her, still eyeing her."
msgstr "Gilead dio unos pasos atrás de ella, aún mirándola."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Gilead turned to her."
msgstr "Gilead se volvió hacia ella."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Gilead was sharp in his response."
msgstr "Gilead fue tajante en su respuesta."

msgctxt "speaker:Carolyn"
msgid "Gilead will want to offer you his legions, but he'll try to extract a price from you."
msgstr "Gilead querrá ofrecerte sus legiones, pero intentará exigirte un precio a cambio."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Gilead's Legions, as promised, arrived in the docks to mingle among her people."
msgstr "Las legiones de Gilead, como se prometió, llegaron al muelle para mezclarse con su gente."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Gilead's estate."
msgstr "La hacienda de Gilead."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Gilead's smile grew into a grin."
msgstr "La sonrisa de Gilead se transformó en una risa."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Gilead, meanwhile, had send no message."
msgstr "Gilead, por otro lado, no había enviado ningún mensaje."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Gilead, the man or creature or whatever he was by now, sat with a wicked smile."
msgstr "Gilead, el hombre o la criatura o lo que fuera que era en ese momento, se sentó con una sonrisa perversa."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Gilead..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Gilead..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Gilead?"
msgstr "¿Gilead?"

msgctxt "speaker:Carolyn"
msgid "Gilead? Ooh, he'll show up in a moment."
msgstr "¿Gilead? Oh, aparecerá en un momento."

msgctxt "menu"
msgid "Girl"
msgstr "Chica"

msgctxt "speaker-name"
msgid "Girl"
msgstr "Chica"

msgctxt "speaker:Guard Captain"
msgid "Girl, the game is up."
msgstr "Niña, el juego ha terminado."

msgctxt "speaker:Gilead"
msgid "Girl..."
msgstr "Niña..."

msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "Girls that know how to behave get to go in the bed. You ask too many questions."
msgstr "Las chicas que saben comportarse se van a la cama, pero tú preguntas demasiadas cosas."

msgctxt "speaker:Guard Captain"
msgid "Girly here is pretending like she don't know shit about shit, so the first one to speak gets the prize."
msgstr "Aquí la Girly está fingiendo que no sabe ni una mierda de nada, así que el primero en hablar se lleva el premio."

msgctxt "speaker:Guard"
msgid "Girly is offerin to pay her debts to society the old fashioned way."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "speaker:Guard"
msgid "Girly, that's about the first clever thing that came outa that mouth of yours."
msgstr "Girly, eso es lo primero inteligente que sale de esa boca."

msgctxt "menu"
msgid "Give Belmont a loan"
msgstr "Dar un préstamo a Belmont"

msgctxt "menu"
msgid "Give Vaelen the real stone."
msgstr "Entrega la piedra verdadera a Vaelen."

msgctxt "speaker:Guard"
msgid "Give any more lip and I'll give you a real bruisin."
msgstr "Si sigues dando la lata, te voy a dar una buena paliza."

msgctxt "menu"
msgid "Give captain Belmonst a piece of your mind"
msgstr "Dale al capitán Belmonst tu opinión sincera"

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Give her my condolences."
msgstr "Dale mis condolencias."

msgctxt "menu"
msgid "Give her nothing"
msgstr "No le des nada"

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Give him a minute. Let him be alone. He needs to rest."
msgstr "Dale un minuto. Déjalo solo. Necesita descansar."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Give him what he wants, Sarah reminded herself. She only made it worse for herself when she resisted his torments."
msgstr "Dale lo que quiera, Sarah se dijo resignada. Solo empeoraba su situación cuando resistía sus torturas."

msgctxt "menu"
msgid "Give him what he wants."
msgstr "Dale lo que quiere."

msgctxt "menu"
msgid "Give into Raza's demand"
msgstr "Cedir a la exigencia de Raza"

msgctxt "menu"
msgid "Give into the spirit"
msgstr "Cedle al espíritu"

msgctxt "speaker:Kate"
msgid "Give me a place to stay, up in a small room above the tavern."
msgstr "Dame un lugar para quedarme, arriba en una pequeña habitación sobre la taberna."

msgctxt "speaker:Other man"
msgid "Give me a turn..."
msgstr "Dale un giro..."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Give me answers or I will leave, Razaphel. You promised me truth, I won't stand your riddles again."
msgstr "Dame respuestas o me iré, Razafael. Me prometiste la verdad; no soportaré más tus enigmas."

msgctxt "speaker:Kate"
msgid "Give me some food, some coin, enough to survive."
msgstr "Dame algo de comida, alguna moneda, lo suficiente para sobrevivir."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Give me some space."
msgstr "Dame algo de espacio."

msgctxt "speaker:Duke Antonio"
msgid "Give me what I want, it will be little more than a memory in a few days time."
msgstr "Dame lo que quiero; será poco más que un recuerdo en unos pocos días."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Give me your vote, and I will be made leader of this Union."
msgstr "Dame tu voto y seré nombrada líder de esta Unión."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Give that back!"
msgstr "¡Dámela de nuevo!"

msgctxt "speaker:Vaelen"
msgid "Give the girl to Sarah."
msgstr "Dale la puta a Sarah."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Give the order."
msgstr "Dale la orden."

msgctxt "speaker:Lily"
msgid "Give the word, and I will grind it into the earth beneath my boot."
msgstr "¡Dame la orden y la moleré en tierra bajo mi bota!"

msgctxt "speaker:Hassar"
msgid "Give your slave to Kamal for a few nights. Let him put a baby in the girl."
msgstr "Entrega a tu esclava a Kamal por unas cuantas noches. Haz que se quede embarazada de él."

msgctxt "menu"
msgid "Give yourself over to Razaphel"
msgstr "Entégate a Razaphel"

msgctxt "menu"
msgid "Give yourself over to the soldiers"
msgstr "Entrega tu cuerpo a los soldados"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Given her current condition, she had little time to speculate on peculiar voices."
msgstr "Dada su condición actual, no tenía mucho tiempo para especular sobre voces extrañas."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Given its vast size, it was home to unique talents from across the Union."
msgstr "Dada su vasta magnitud, albergaba talentos únicos de todo la Unión."

msgctxt "speaker:Judge"
msgid "Given that this is defendants first criminal account, we shall strike one year from the total sentence, for a total of five years in prison."
msgstr "Dado que este es el primer relato criminal del acusado, restaremos un año de la condena total, quedando así cinco años de prisión."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Given the bed's quality, it wasn't long before Sarah found the rest she had been looking for."
msgstr "Dada la calidad de la cama, no tardó en encontrar el descanso que buscaba."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Given the country's small size, the army was more than capable of defending itself from any regional rivals."
msgstr "Dado el pequeño tamaño del país, el ejército era más que capaz de defenderse de cualquier rival regional."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Given the current circumstances, it is difficult for me to afford the voyage back home."
msgstr "Dadas las circunstancias actuales, es difícil para mí costear el viaje de regreso al hogar."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Given the labour that had gone into this work, the battle must have been important. And still it meant nothing to her."
msgstr "Dada la labor que había requerido esta obra, la batalla debió ser importante. Y aún así, para ella no significaba nada."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Given the speed and skill, Sarah doubted this was Eula's first time undressing a woman."
msgstr "Dada la velocidad y el dominio, Sarah dudaba de que fuera la primera vez que Eula se quitaba la ropa a una mujer."

msgctxt "speaker:Kravel"
msgid "Given the...festivities I had assumed we could have postponed most council business for a few days."
msgstr "Dado que... las celebraciones podíamos haber pospuesto la mayoría de los asuntos del consejo por unos días."

msgctxt "speaker:Varga"
msgid "Given what I've just heard, I believe that we ought to excercise caution."
msgstr "Dado lo que acabo de oír, creo que deberíamos proceder con precaución."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Given what she had put up in exchange for his training, Sarah believed she owed it to herself to follow them exactly."
msgstr "Dada lo que ella había ofrecido a cambio de su entrenamiento, Sarah creía que le debía a sí misma seguirlos al pie de la letra."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Giving in made life easier."
msgstr "Ceder hacía la vida mucho más fácil."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Glad for it to be over."
msgstr "Feliz de que haya terminado."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Glad in knowing that she had their support, regardless of their demand."
msgstr "¡Qué alivio saber que tenían su apoyo, aunque exigieran lo que quisieran!"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Glad she had not taken him up on his offer."
msgstr "¡Qué alivio no haber aceptado su oferta!"

msgctxt "speaker:Dio"
msgid "Glad to make your acquaintance, Sarah. My brother has spoken much of you."
msgstr "Encantado de conocerte, Sarah. Mi hermano ha hablado mucho de ti."

msgctxt "speaker:Marion"
msgid "Glad to see you managed to find your way here as well, Varga."
msgstr "¡Qué alegría ver que también lograste llegar hasta aquí, Varga!"

msgctxt "speaker:Jaeid"
msgid "Gladly that I suffer a thousand deaths in glory, than live one lifetime in shame."
msgstr "¡Oh, con cuánto gusto sufriría mil muertes en gloria antes que vivir una vida en vergüenza!"

msgctxt "speaker:Guard"
msgid "Gladly, my lady!"
msgstr "¡Con mucho gusto, mi señora!"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Glimmering in the air, like the thinnest strand of a hair, something lingered between the spirit and the beast."
msgstr "Brillando en el aire, como el hilo más fino de un cabello, algo permanecía entre el espíritu y la bestia."

msgctxt "speaker:Razaphel"
msgid "Go ahead and explore it. I suspect you'll find it most useful."
msgstr "Explóralo sin dudarlo. Sospecho que lo encontrarás sumamente útil."

msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "Go ahead and fetch that, will ya?"
msgstr "Ve y tráelo, ¿vale?"

msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "Go ahead and help yourself."
msgstr "¡Adelante, hazte a la mía."

msgctxt "speaker:Matthew"
msgid "Go ahead and sit on the edge of the table for me."
msgstr "Siéntate en el borde de la mesa por mí."

msgctxt "speaker:Metis"
msgid "Go ahead and study up on that. We'll continue in the next lesson, see how far we can push you."
