msgstr "No me gusta perseguir mi dinero."

msgctxt "speaker:Sigmund"
msgid "I don't like to share, but I should not have reacted as harshly as I did."
msgstr "No me gusta compartir, pero no debí reaccionar con tanta dureza."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
