msgctxt "speaker:Gideon"
msgid "I don't mind giving a show, and we wouldn't be the only ones."
msgstr "No me importa dar un espectáculo, y no seríamos los únicos."

msgctxt "speaker:Samayra"
msgid "I don't mind the extra work."
msgstr "No me importa el trabajo extra."

msgctxt "speaker:Captain Belmont"
