msgstr "No creo que lo haya pensado mucho."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I don't think he's looking to buy her life."
msgstr "No creo que busque comprarle la vida."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I don't think it will be a matter of hours. More weeks or months."
msgstr "No creo que sea cuestión de horas. Más bien semanas o meses."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I don't think it works that way."
msgstr "No creo que funcione así."

msgctxt "speaker:Lily"
msgid "I don't think it's my place, lady Sarah..."
msgstr "No creo que sea de mi incumbencia, señora Sarah..."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I don't think it's that bad. I have plenty of allies."
msgstr "No creo que sea tan grave. Tengo muchos aliados."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I don't think my armor is much suited for a forest like this."
msgstr "No creo que mi armadura sea muy adecuada para un bosque como este."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I don't think my father would have considered killing your King and Queen to be called for."
msgstr "No creo que mi padre considerara apropiado matar a tu rey y reina."

msgctxt "speaker:Jasmine"
msgid "I don't think she's bored."
msgstr "No creo que esté aburrida."

msgctxt "speaker:Kate"
msgid "I don't think so..."
msgstr "No creo que sea así..."

msgctxt "speaker:Marshal Edmond"
