msgstr "No creo que sea necesario."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I don't think that you would take to such a life well."
msgstr "No creo que te adaptes bien a una vida así."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I don't think that's a very good idea. He's...a bit odd."
msgstr "No creo que sea una muy buena idea. Es... un poco raro."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
