msgstr "No creo que te veas tan mayor."

msgctxt "speaker:Female Soldier"
msgid "I don't think you really care."
msgstr "No creo que te importe realmente."

msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "I don't think you'd make much of a wife."
msgstr "No creo que hagas una buena esposa."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I don't think you're a joke, Nick, but you need to be careful. There isn't anyone else out here other than us. Nobody will help you if the captain turns on you."
msgstr "No creo que seas una broma, Nick, pero necesitas tener cuidado. No hay nadie más por aquí aparte de nosotros. Nadie te ayudará si el capitán se vuelve contra ti."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I don't think you're all out of chances for tonight though."
msgstr "Pero no creo que estés sin opciones para esta noche."

msgctxt "speaker:Gideon"
msgid "I don't think you're wrong about that...but he's still the boss."
msgstr "No creo que tengas razón ahí... pero él sigue siendo el jefe."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
