msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I don’t know what you think you’re doing, but you’re disgusting."
msgstr "No sé qué crees que estás haciendo, pero eres repugnante."

msgctxt "speaker:Varga"
msgid "I doubt he ever thinks much of anyone else other than his noble friends."
msgstr "Dudo que piense mucho de nadie más que de sus amigos nobles."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I doubt they're going to survive for very long."
