msgstr "I... ¿quién es ese?"

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I...who told you that?"
msgstr "¿Quién te lo dijo?"

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I...who will it be?"
msgstr "¿Quién será?"

msgctxt "speaker:Marius"
msgid "I...will sleep out in the barn tonight...I...need some space..."
msgstr "Dormiré en el establo esta noche... necesito un poco de espacio..."

msgctxt "speaker:Samayra"
msgid "I...wow, it's-, I can't!"
msgstr "¡...Vaya, es-, no puedo!"

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I...yes I like...old cock."
msgstr "Sí... me gusta la polla vieja."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I...yes, I know him."
msgstr "Sí... lo conozco."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I...yes..."
msgstr "Sí..."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I...yes...I will..."
msgstr "Sí... sí... lo haré..."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I...yes...Master. I only wished to know what Mark, Master...I..."
msgstr "Sí... Maestro. Solo deseaba saber qué, Mark, Maestro... yo..."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I...yes...Master..."
msgstr "Sí... señor..."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I...yes...sir."
msgstr "Sí... sí, señor."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I...you cannot be serious..."
msgstr "I...no puede estar en serio..."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I...you startled me."
msgstr "Yo... me asustaste."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I...you're sick, Samayra..."
msgstr "I... estás enferma, Samayra..."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I...your honour...I didn't have time to-"
msgstr "Su Señoría... no tuve tiempo de-"

msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "Idiot..."
msgstr "Idiota..."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Idiots. If they think they're going to get credit for going in first, despite my instructions, they'll have another thing coming."
msgstr "Idiotas. Si creen que van a recibir crédito por entrar primero, a pesar de mis instrucciones, se van a encontrar con otra cosa."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Idly, Sarah began to eat and drink while she observed the room."
msgstr "Sarah comenzó a comer y beber distraídamente mientras observaba la habitación."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If Atilla ever had any power to resist her, it swiftly faded as he watched her undress."
msgstr "Si Atilla alguna vez tuvo el poder de resistirse a ella, se desvaneció rápidamente mientras la observaba desnudarse."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If Bagrad was a shadow of its former self, then on Nauyziri was a spectral shade."
msgstr "Si Bagrad era una sombra de su antiguo yo, entonces en Nauyziri había un fantasma."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If Belmont caught him...she didn't want to imagine what would happen."
msgstr "Si Belmont lo atrapa... no quería imaginarse qué pasaría."

msgctxt "speaker:Gilead"
msgid "If I am correct, and this has been that worm Caliban's doing, then we must delay my proposal for now."
msgstr "Si tengo razón y esto ha sido obra de ese gusano Calibán, entonces debemos posponer mi propuesta por ahora."

msgctxt "speaker:Raza"
msgid "If I bring you, you convince them to protect me. We both safe. Deal?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "speaker:Vaelen"
msgid "If I broke down at every death, I would never have been able to get to where I am today."
msgstr "Si me hubiera rendido ante cada muerte, nunca habría llegado a donde estoy hoy."

msgctxt "speaker:Varga"
msgid "If I can be so bold...I think I understand your worry, and perhaps, I even shared it. That perhaps Thomas' nature made him unsuited for war, but he was everything one could hope."
msgstr "Si puedo ser tan atrevido... creo que entiendo tu preocupación y, quizás, incluso la comparto. Que tal vez la naturaleza de Thomas lo hacía poco apto para la guerra, pero era todo lo que uno podía desear."

msgctxt "speaker:Garret"
msgid "If I can offer you any advice..."
msgstr "Si puedo ofrecerte algún consejo..."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "If I can, I want to travel with you. But if you won't take me, I'll walk myself."
msgstr "Si puedo, quiero viajar contigo. Pero si no me llevas, caminaré sola."

msgctxt "speaker:Lily"
msgid "If I cannot have you forever, then let's not waste tonight."
msgstr "Si no puedo tenerle para siempre, entonces no desperdicemos esta noche."

msgctxt "speaker:Garret"
msgid "If I close my eyes it's like...I can still feel it inside of me."
msgstr "Si cierro los ojos, es como si... aún lo sintiera dentro de mí."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "If I did I would certainly not have made you so annoying. So full of riddles."
msgstr "Si lo hubiera hecho, no te habría hecho tan molesta. Tan llena de enigmas."

msgctxt "speaker:Marius"
msgid "If I didn't marry you...there would be rumors all through the town in no time at all."
msgstr "Si no te hubiera casado contigo... en un abrir y cerrar de ojos habría corrido el rumor por toda la ciudad."

msgctxt "speaker:Samayra"
msgid "If I didn't want to be here, then I wouldn't be."
msgstr "Si no quisiera estar aquí, no estaría."

msgctxt "speaker:Sigmund"
msgid "If I die and go to the afterlife, the gods can say Sigmund Falraad was a fucking idiot, but at least he always did the right thing."
msgstr "Si muero y voy al más allá, los dioses podrán decir que Sigmund Falraad fue un puto idiota, pero al menos siempre hizo lo correcto."

msgctxt "speaker:Samayra"
msgid "If I die..."
msgstr "Si muero..."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "If I do this, I do it to liberate my people from being ruled by foreigners from the desert to our East."
msgstr "Si hago esto, lo hago para liberar a mi pueblo de ser gobernado por extranjeros del desierto que están al este de nosotros."

msgctxt "speaker:Ephraim"
msgid "If I ever get my own farm I'll be sure to send you a letter."
msgstr "Si alguna vez tengo mi propia granja, te enviaré una carta."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "If I ever meet one, I'll let you know, okay?"
msgstr "Si alguna vez encuentro a uno de ellos, te lo diré, ¿de acuerdo?"

msgctxt "speaker:Razaphel"
msgid "If I explain it to you, I can only do so as one explains the world to a child."
msgstr "Si te lo explico, solo puedo hacerlo como quien explica el mundo a un niño."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "If I fight, I do so to free my people from slavery at the hands of the Tribesmen."
msgstr "Si me veo obligada a luchar, lo haré para liberar a mi pueblo de la esclavitud que estos tribus impusieron sobre nosotros."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "If I find out any of you set him up to this, I swear you're going to pay for it."
msgstr "Si descubro que alguno de ustedes lo metió en esto, juro que pagarán con su vida."

msgctxt "speaker:Razaphel"
msgid "If I frightened you, child, forgive me."
msgstr "Si te asusté, niña, perdóname."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "If I get my hands on Marion, he'll regret ever being born."
msgstr "Si consigo mis manos con Marion, se arrepentirá de haber nacido."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "If I go and...break his trust...he'll throw me back out onto the street."
msgstr "Si voy y... rompo su confianza... me echará de nuevo a la calle."

msgctxt "speaker:Samayra"
msgid "If I go swimmming, do you promise to stop talking about all that?"
msgstr "¿Si voy a nadar, prometes dejar de hablar de todo eso?"

msgctxt "speaker:Carolyn"
msgid "If I had called on you, many wonder what business I had with a random mercenary."
msgstr "Si te hubiera llamado, muchos se preguntan qué motivo tenía para visitar a un mercenario al azar."

msgctxt "speaker:Atilla"
msgid "If I hurt you, I apologize..."
msgstr "Si te hice daño, lo siento..."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "If I just let you slink out of this alley and go about your business."
msgstr "Si simplemente te dejo que te deslices por este callejón y sigas con tus asuntos."

msgctxt "speaker:Damian"
msgid "If I let you in, tell me this ain't the kind of trouble that blows back on me."
msgstr "Si te dejo entrar, dime que esto no es el tipo de problemas que me volverán contra mí."

msgctxt "speaker:Brigand"
msgid "If I let you sleep here for free, soon everybody will want to sleep here, and before long the city guards will come knocking."
msgstr "Si te dejo dormir aquí gratis, pronto todos querrán dormir aquí, y antes de que lo sepas los guardias de la ciudad vendrán a golpear."

msgctxt "speaker:Maeiv"
msgid "If I lose, I'll go down trying."
msgstr "Si pierdo, caeré luchando."

msgctxt "speaker:Gilead"
msgid "If I move against him, I must do so in less...direct means."
msgstr "Si me muevo contra él, debo hacerlo con medios menos... directos."

msgctxt "speaker:Gideon"
msgid "If I press down on my men any harder, they're going to turn on me."
msgstr "Si presiono más a mis hombres, se volverán contra mí."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "If I stay here much longer I might actually go insane. Meet me later in the gardens, near the northern ramparts."
msgstr "Si me quedo aquí mucho más tiempo, podría volverse loca de verdad. Encuéntrame después en los jardines, cerca de las murallas del norte."

msgctxt "speaker:Kate"
msgid "If I stay, I might regret it. If I leave, I might regret. Either which way..."
msgstr "Si me quedo, podría arrepentirme. Si me voy, también podría arrepentirme. De cualquier manera..."

msgctxt "speaker:Razaphel"
msgid "If I told you the answer, it would be meaningless."
msgstr "Si te dijera la respuesta, sería inútil."

msgctxt "speaker:Garret"
msgid "If I tried to kill myself again, who knew what fresh curse my sister my speak out over me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "speaker:Sigmund"
msgid "If I tried to teach you, the only thing I'd do is give you false confidence, which is almost as dangerous as knowing nothing at all."
msgstr "Si intentara enseñarte, lo único que haría es darte una falsa confianza, algo casi tan peligroso como no saber nada en absoluto."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "If I wanted to get off, I think I'd need something bigger than what he has to offer. Maybe your pinky."
msgstr "Si quisiera salirme con la mía, creo que necesitaría algo más grande de lo que él tiene para ofrecer. Quizás tu meñique."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "If I wanted to read the fucking report, I'd be reading it."
msgstr "Si quisiera leer el maldito informe, ya lo estaría leyendo."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "If I were a man, we would not be have this conversation."
msgstr "Si fuera hombre, no estaríamos teniendo esta conversación."

msgctxt "speaker:Captain Belmont"
msgid "If I win, you’ll have to admit I was right."
msgstr "Si gano, tendrás que admitir que tenía razón."

msgctxt "speaker:Tribesman"
msgid "If I withdraw...I must be shown to do so in strength."
msgstr "Si me retiro... debo hacerlo demostrando fuerza."

msgctxt "speaker:Captain Belmont"
msgid "If I'd known you looked like this, I'd shacked up with you a lot sooner."
msgstr "Si hubiera sabido que te veías así, me habría metido contigo mucho antes."

msgctxt "speaker:Kate"
msgid "If I'm going to be a knight, I'll have to practice slaying Wyrms and saving maidens."
msgstr "Si voy a ser una paladina, tendré que practicar matando dragones y salvando damiselas."

msgctxt "speaker:Lily"
msgid "If I'm going to become a cuthroat, I don't think I'd start with one this pretty."
msgstr "Si me voy a convertir en una zorra de cuchillo, no creo que empiece con alguien tan guapa."

msgctxt "speaker:Kate"
msgid "If I'm going to give up my life for anyone, it's going to be for the handful of people that are worth it. Maybe they can make this world a slightly better place."
msgstr "Si tengo que entregar mi vida por alguien, será por un puñado de personas que valgan la pena. Quizás puedan hacer de este mundo un lugar algo mejor."

msgctxt "speaker:Kate"
msgid "If I'm gonna be your Knight, I won't just be your little servant."
msgstr "Si voy a ser tu caballero, no voy a ser solo tu sirviente."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "If I'm queen...I'll make the rules."
msgstr "Si soy reina... haré las reglas."

msgctxt "speaker:Jasmine"
msgid "If Jaeid claimed you one day and set you free the next day, they would know you had never earned your freedom."
msgstr "Si Jaeid te reclamara algún día y te liberara al día siguiente, sabrían que nunca habías ganado tu libertad."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If Lady Carolyn stood in the favor of one of them, she was more connected than she had perhaps suggested."
msgstr "Si la Dama Carolyn se hallaba del lado de uno de ellos, estaba más conectada de lo que quizás había sugerido."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If Lady Carolyn wanted to manipulate the numbers ever so slightly, Sarah had no doubt that she'd be able to get away with it."
msgstr "Si Lady Carolyn deseaba manipular los números apenas un poco, Sarah no tenía duda de que lograría salirse con la suya."

msgctxt "speaker:Samayra"
msgid "If Metis left...I guess I don't have a teacher anymore."
msgstr "Si Metis se va... supongo que ya no tengo profesora."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If Oliver would refuse to come, or could not be forced to, they were meant to slay him."
msgstr "Si Oliver se negaba a venir, o no podía ser obligado a ello, estaban destinados a matarlo."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If Sarah acted out or made a mistake, the Daemon would punish Dalia, and Dalia would likely just resent Sarah for it."
msgstr "Si Sarah se portaba mal o cometía un error, el Daemon castigaría a Dalia, y Dalia probablemente solo resentiría a Sarah por ello."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If Sarah did anything, at best, the guards would drag her away."
msgstr "Si Sarah hacía algo, en el mejor de los casos, los guardias la arrastrarían lejos."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If Sarah imagined she'd get a respite with one man less, she quickly realized how wrong she'd been."
msgstr "Si Sarah imaginó que obtendría un respiro con un hombre menos, pronto se dio cuenta de lo equivocada que estaba."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If Sigmund cared, he wouldn't let her walk the road alone. Even if that meant bringing her along himself."
msgstr "Si Sigmund importara algo, no la dejaría caminar sola por el camino. Incluso si eso significaba llevarla consigo."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "If Thomas is brought back safely, I'll do everything in my power to keep him safe forever."
msgstr "Si traen a Thomas de vuelta a salvo, haré todo lo que esté en mi poder para mantenerlo seguro para siempre."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If a city was burned, one expected countless dead."
msgstr "Si una ciudad fuera incendiada, uno esperaba incontables muertos."

msgctxt "speaker:Alfred"
msgid "If a cup goes missing, or even a single piece of cuttlery, it will be noted."
msgstr "Si falta una copa o incluso un solo utensilio, se anotará."

msgctxt "speaker:Dalia"
msgid "If a pack of Hellhounds had gotten to you first..."
msgstr "Si un rebaño de perros del infierno te hubiera alcanzado primero..."

msgctxt "speaker:Alfred"
msgid "If a thing goes missin, you'll be in trouble. And in this town, we don't do no complicated city justice."
msgstr "Si falta algo, estarás en problemas. Y en este pueblo no aplicamos la justicia complicada de las ciudades."

msgctxt "speaker:Jasmine"
msgid "If a woman is just given or goes freely...well it clashes with how they view the world."
msgstr "Si una mujer es simplemente entregada o se entrega libremente... bueno, eso choca con cómo ven el mundo."

msgctxt "speaker:Marshal Edmond"
msgid "If all of our peoples were as frail as them, we'd have been conquered by the Mythrans centuries ago."
msgstr "Si todos nuestros pueblos fueran tan frágiles como ellos, habríamos sido conquistados por los Mythrans hace siglos."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If all the other houses heard, she didn't care."
msgstr "Si todas las demás casas lo supieran, no le importaría."

msgctxt "speaker:Cassius"
msgid "If all the rulers of the world were like you, I'd never find work again."
msgstr "Si todos los gobernantes del mundo fueran como tú, nunca volvería a encontrar trabajo."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "If all this turns out to be a trap, your presence would change nothing."
msgstr "Si todo esto resulta ser una trampa, tu presencia no cambiaría nada."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "If all you wanted to do was survive, you would have stayed in Rosanna and never left."
msgstr "Si todo lo que querías era sobrevivir, te habrías quedado en Rosanna y nunca habrías salido."

msgctxt "speaker:Albert"
msgid "If any harm had come to you, Gods, I would have never forgiven myself if I didn't try to save you."
msgstr "Si a ti te hubiera pasado algo, dioses, jamás me habría perdonado si no hubiera intentado salvarte."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If any man had looked at her like that, she would have told him off."
msgstr "Si algún hombre la hubiera mirado así, se lo habría echado en cara."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If any of them had any reservations, they didn't show them."
msgstr "Si alguno de ellos tenía alguna reserva, no la mostró."

msgctxt "speaker:Maeiv"
msgid "If any of you wish to withdraw, simply say so and we can be done with the matter."
msgstr "Si alguno de ustedes desea retirarse, simplemente dígalo y podremos terminar con el asunto."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If anyone had the resources to fight back against these beasts, it would be them."
msgstr "Si alguien tenía los recursos para luchar contra estas bestias, serían ellos."

msgctxt "speaker:Xanthippe"
msgid "If anyone has an idea as to where the vault might be, it's her. And if the Shah tries to hold out on his end of the deal, we might need to use her."
msgstr "Si alguien tiene una idea de dónde podría estar el cofre, es ella. Y si el Sha intenta incumplir su parte del acuerdo, quizás tengamos que recurrir a ella."

msgctxt "speaker:Lily"
msgid "If anyone sees me then..."
msgstr "Si alguien me ve entonces..."

msgctxt "speaker:Lily"
msgid "If anyone tries to stop me, I'll cut them down..."
msgstr "Si alguien intenta detenerme, los cortaré..."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If anything of meaning was said after, Sarah couldn't recall."
msgstr "Si algo significativo se dijo después, Sarah no lo recordaba."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If anything, Sarah thought, the woman looked more embarassed than shocked to see her."
msgstr "Si acaso, pensó Sarah, la mujer parecía más avergonzada que sorprendida al verla."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If anything, by now, she understood him better than she ever had, wordlessly."
msgstr "Si acaso, ahora lo entendía mejor que nunca, sin decir palabra."

msgctxt "speaker:Metis"
msgid "If anything, how about I make it worth your while."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If anything, it had made her less prepared to face the real world."
msgstr "Si acaso, la había hecho menos preparada para enfrentar el mundo real."

msgctxt "speaker:Mary"
msgid "If anything, it might be good."
msgstr "Si acaso, podría ser bueno."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If anything, it only hardend him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If anything, it pleased her only more."
msgstr "Si acaso, eso la complació aún más."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "If anything, it's likely Lethram has been wealthier than Bagrad for a good many centuries."
msgstr "Si acaso, es probable que Lethram haya sido más rico que Bagrad durante muchos siglos."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If anything, she felt him only more intensely."
msgstr "Por el contrario, lo sentía con mayor intensidad."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If anything, she had imagined him less."
msgstr "Si acaso, lo había imaginado menos."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If anything, the deeper she got into the center of the room, the more intense the event appeared to become."
msgstr "Si acaso, cuanto más se adentraba en el centro de la sala, más intenso parecía volverse el evento."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If anything, the goblin was kind to keep her so well fed."
msgstr "Si acaso, el gobelin tenía la bondad de mantenerla tan bien alimentada."

msgctxt "speaker:Tribesman"
msgid "If anything, the thought of a great final battle excites them more than anything."
msgstr "Si acaso, el pensamiento de una gran batalla final los excita más que cualquier otra cosa."

msgctxt "speaker:Varga"
msgid "If anything, they might actually weaken the army."
msgstr "Si acaso, podrían debilitar al ejército."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If anything, this was likely just another game, played on them by the Master."
msgstr "Si acaso, esto probablemente era solo otro juego, jugado contra ellos por el Maestro."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If before her member had been hard, the erection now seemed almost painful to her."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If before there was a hunger, he now all but devoured her with his eyes."
msgstr "Si antes había hambre, ahora casi la devoraba con la mirada."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If before, his speed was fast, now it was relentless."
msgstr "Si antes su velocidad era rápida, ahora es implacable."

msgctxt "speaker:Kate"
msgid "If doing this means you can forgive me, only a little bit...I'll do it, gladly."
msgstr "Si hacer esto significa que puedes perdonarme, aunque sea un poco... lo haré, con gusto."

msgctxt "speaker:Cassius"
msgid "If even half of it was true, then I can't blame them for being happy to be rid of the Tribesmen."
msgstr "Si incluso la mitad de eso era cierto, no puedo culparlos por estar contentos de deshacerse de los hombres de las tribus."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If ever there seemed to be a simple, harmless creature, this must surely have been it."
msgstr "Si alguna vez pareció haber una criatura simple e inocente, esta debió ser sin duda alguna."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If ever there was an object, filled in equal parts with her sorrow and her mirth."
msgstr "Si alguna vez hubo algo, lleno en partes iguales de su pesar y de su júbilo."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If ever there was evidence that they lived in an unfair world, Belmont's considerable natural blessings were proof of it."
msgstr "Si alguna vez hubo prueba de que vivían en un mundo injusto, las considerables bendiciones naturales de Belmont lo demostraban."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If ever there was in her a life a singular moment in which she longed to be trapped, this was it."
msgstr "Si alguna vez hubo en ella un instante singular del que anhelara ser presa, este fue."

msgctxt "speaker:Kate"
msgid "If he ain't asking for it now, he'll ask for it later."
msgstr "Si ahora no lo está pidiendo, más tarde lo pedirá."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "If he catches you..."
msgstr "Si te atrapa..."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "If he does, he'll...Nick he might kill you over it."
msgstr "Si lo hace... Nick podría matarte por eso."

msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "If he doesn't want the guards to find you, trust me, they never will."
msgstr "Si no quiere que los guardias te encuentren, créeme: nunca lo harán."

msgctxt "speaker:Dalia"
msgid "If he gave you an order...I suggest you do as he asks."
msgstr "Si te dio una orden... te sugiero que le obedezcas."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "If he gives up the vault before we deliver on our end, he's afraid we'll leave. But if we deliver before he does, whose to say he'll be true to his word?"
msgstr "Si él entrega el cofre antes de que cumplamos con nuestra parte, teme que nos marchemos. Pero si cumplimos antes de él, ¿quién puede asegurar que mantendrá su palabra?"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If he had actually never wanted her to ask about Daemonology, he could have simply never mentioned it. Instead he had."
msgstr "Si realmente no hubiera querido que ella preguntara sobre la Daemonología, podría haber simplemente no mencionado el tema. En su lugar, lo hizo."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If he had asked it of her, she would have walked away from her throne. From everything."
msgstr "Si lo hubiera preguntado a ella, se habría alejado de su trono. De todo."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "If he had wanted me dead, he could have killed me a hundred times over already!"
msgstr "¡Si él hubiera querido que muriera, ya me habría matado cien veces!"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If he had, he still gave no hint of it."
msgstr "Si lo hubiera hecho, aún no daba ninguna señal de ello."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If he learned that his own father had his way with her..."
msgstr "Si aprende que su propio padre la ha violado..."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "If he looks at me and is pleased or if he's dissapointed."
msgstr "Si me mira y queda satisfecho o si se decepciona."

msgctxt "speaker:Marion"
msgid "If he refuses a Royal summons, then we will have grounds to have him killed on that alone."
msgstr "Si se niega a una citación real, entonces tendremos motivos para ordenar su ejecución por sí solo."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If he slapped her, it was because she had made a mistake. It was her own fault, she concluded."
msgstr "Si le dio un bofetón, fue porque ella había cometido un error. Fue su propia culpa, concluyó."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "If he wakes up in the middle of the night, I'll fuck him, or suck him off, or make him finish with my hands if I have to!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If he wanted to, get could kill her, and what would anyone even think of it? There was nobody left to object in her name."
msgstr "Si lo deseaba, podría matarla, y ¿qué pensaría nadie de ello? No quedaba nadie para objetar en su nombre."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If he was drunk enough, he might tell her."
msgstr "Si estaba lo suficientemente borracho, podría decírselo."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If he was more than two millenia old...why would he think twice of killing an inconvenient girl that he knew for only a fraction of his life..."
msgstr "Si tenía más de dos milenios... ¿por qué pensaría dos veces en matar a una chica inconveniente que solo conocía desde hace una fracción de su vida?"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If he was still alive, though she doubted anything could kill him."
msgstr "Si seguía vivo, aunque dudaba que nada pudiera matarlo."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If he was telling the truth, her magic was useless here."
msgstr "Si él decía la verdad, su magia era inútil aquí."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If he was to be believed, this Gilead person was a member of the Eternal Court."
msgstr "Si se le puede creer, esta persona de Gilead era miembro del Tribunal Eterno."

msgctxt "speaker:Captain"
msgid "If he's even still alive, he didn't make it back to this ship."
msgstr "Si siquiera sigue con vida, no logró volver a esta nave."

msgctxt "speaker:Gideon"
msgid "If he's going to order the army to march into the desert regardless...best we can do is limit the pain."
msgstr "Si va a ordenar al ejército que marche hacia el desierto sin importar nada... lo mejor que podemos hacer es limitar el dolor."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "If he's so bad...why are we staying with him?"
msgstr "Si es tan malo... ¿por qué nos quedamos con él?"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If her master wanted her to bring pleasure to this other goblin, she would do that too."
msgstr "Si su amo quería que le brindara placer a otro goblin, ella también lo haría."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If her odds were poor before, she feared to contemplate them now."
msgstr "Si sus probabilidades ya eran bajas antes, ahora temía contemplarlas."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If her people ever found out..."
msgstr "Si su gente lo averiguara alguna vez..."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If her sweat and exhaustion bothered him, he made no show of it."
msgstr "Si el sudor y la fatiga le molestaban, no lo mostraba."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If his green skin did not give it away, Sarah would have known from other facts. His arms, thick like logs, his chest, ripped with muscles, how he towered over other men by at least a head."
msgstr "Si su piel verde no lo delataba, Sarah habría sabido por otros hechos. Sus brazos, gruesos como troncos; su pecho, surcado de músculos; cómo se alzaba sobre los demás hombres al menos una cabeza."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "If his grip on Rosanna is fading, why not wait and let the people rise up?"
msgstr "Si su agarre sobre Rosanna se desvanece, ¿por qué no esperar y dejar que el pueblo se levante?"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If his voice had not given away the truth of him, his body surely would."
msgstr "Si su voz no hubiera delatado la verdad de él, su cuerpo lo habría hecho sin duda."

msgctxt "speaker:Garret"
msgid "If it can help keep this part of myself under control...it is for the best."
msgstr "Si eso ayuda a mantener esta parte de mí bajo control... es lo mejor."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If it cared, the goblin showed no hint of it."
msgstr "Si le importara, el goblinkin no mostraría ni la más mínima señal de ello."

msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "If it ever gets out that I lost to a first time player, I'll never live down the humiliation."
msgstr "Si llega a saber que perdí contra un jugador por primera vez, nunca podré vivir con la humillación."

msgctxt "speaker:Razaphel"
msgid "If it felt bad to you, I would feel it Sarah. It would spoil the meal."
msgstr "Si te hubiera hecho sentir mal, yo también lo sentiría, Sarah. Eso arruinaría el placer."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If it gave her cause to concern, it never lasted long."
msgstr "Si eso le dio motivo para preocuparse, nunca duró mucho."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If it had any certain shape, it was soley in the white, pale mask that moved about the body."
msgstr "Si tenía alguna forma definida, era únicamente en la pálida máscara blanca que se movía por el cuerpo."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If it had been a cock, it might have done actual damage, but the spirit's shape was fundamentally different."
msgstr "Si hubiera sido una polla, podría haber causado daños reales, pero la forma del espíritu era fundamentalmente distinta."

msgctxt "speaker:Gideon"
msgid "If it had been any other man, I might have thought he'd be holed up there with one of the girls from Bagrad, but who knows what his appetites are."
msgstr "Si se hubiera tratado de cualquier otro hombre, podría haber pensado que estaba escondido allí con una de las chicas de Bagrad, pero ¿quién sabe cuáles son sus apetitos."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If it had been her own brother that had been taken, she would have marched into the desert without question."
msgstr "Si hubiera sido su propio hermano el secuestrado, habría marchado al desierto sin dudarlo."

msgctxt "speaker:Gideon"
msgid "If it had been me, I'd make sure the whole world knew."
msgstr "Si hubiera sido yo, me aseguraría de que todo el mundo lo supiera."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "If it hadn't been for you and the others...I don't wanna think about what would have happened."
msgstr "Si no fuera por ti y los demás... no quiero pensar en lo que habría pasado."

msgctxt "speaker:Samayra"
msgid "If it helps...I want to help you..."
msgstr "Si ayuda... quiero ayudarte..."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "If it upset you, I'll apologize."
msgstr "Si te molestó, lo siento."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If it was fear that Sarah hoped to instill, she had sown it far and wide."
msgstr "Si lo que Sarah esperaba sembrar era el miedo, había esparcido su semilla por doquier."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If it was true that she had earned a day of rest, then she had to admit she was eager to use it."
msgstr "Si era cierto que había ganado un día de descanso, entonces tenía que admitir que estaba ansiosa por disfrutarlo."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If it was true what Hecate said, that this man was ancient, it stood to reason that he had many lifetimes to perfect his art."
msgstr "Si es verdad lo que dijo Hécate, de que este hombre era antiguo, tiene sentido que haya tenido muchas vidas para perfeccionar su arte."

msgctxt "speaker:Captain Belmont"
msgid "If it was up to me that pecker would be roped up for mutiny, but I don't need more trouble than I got."
msgstr "Si estuviera en mis manos, ese pollón sería amarrado por traición; pero no necesito más problemas de los que ya tengo."

msgctxt "speaker:Sakar"
msgid "If it wasn't for our stop in Lethram I'd have gone insane by now."
msgstr "Si no fuera por nuestra parada en Lethram, ya habría perdido la cordura."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If it wasn't the real thing, Sarah hadn't a clue how it might differ. It felt exactly as she might imagined it would."
msgstr "Si no fuera la realidad, Sarah no tendría idea de cómo podría diferir. Se sentía exactamente como ella imaginaba que sería."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If it were anyone else, she might have been more embarassed to be seen like this, but with him..."
msgstr "Si hubiera sido cualquier otro, podría haberse sentido más avergonzada de ser vista así, pero con él..."

msgctxt "speaker:Naydeen"
msgid "If it's in the city, you'll likely get it the same day. Other items can take a while, but Hassar has always come through on any request."
msgstr "Si está en la ciudad, probablemente lo tendrás el mismo día. Los otros artículos pueden tardar un poco, pero Hassar siempre ha cumplido con cualquier pedido."

msgctxt "speaker:Sigmund"
msgid "If it's just a small crystal, the stuff isn't that dangerous, but if you're hauling a cart full of the stuff like we are, then the crystals an set off a chain-reaction."
msgstr "Si es solo un pequeño cristal, la sustancia no es tan peligrosa, pero si están transportando un carro lleno de ella como lo estamos haciendo, entonces los cristales pueden desencadenar una reacción en cadena."

msgctxt "speaker:Carolyn"
msgid "If it's just your army, without any support from the Mythran Legions?"
msgstr "¿Si es solo tu ejército, sin ningún apoyo de las Legiones Mythran?"

msgctxt "speaker:Man"
msgid "If it's poisoned, at least we'll die together."
msgstr "Si está envenenado, al menos moriremos juntos."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "If it's so dangerous...why do you take it? Why not just take a ship like everybody else."
msgstr "Si es tan peligroso... ¿por qué lo tomas? ¿Por qué no tomar un barco como todos los demás."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If its telekinetic powers had been strong, its physical strength was no less."
msgstr "Si sus poderes telequinéticos hubieran sido fuertes, su fuerza física no era menor."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "If just a single one gets a lucky shot off, you're done for."
msgstr "Si a una sola le da un golpe de suerte, estás frita."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "If my position were different, I would call upon the guards and make way for home this instant."
msgstr "Si mi posición fuera diferente, llamaría a los guardias y haría camino hacia casa en este instante."

msgctxt "speaker:Alfred"
msgid "If my son learned of it, I don't think I'd be able to live with the shame of it."
msgstr "Si mi hijo supiera de ello, no creo que pudiera vivir con la vergüenza de eso."

msgctxt "speaker:Lily"
msgid "If none of these houses want me as a squire, then I know where I stand..."
msgstr "Si ninguna de estas casas quiere tenerme como escudero, entonces sé dónde estoy..."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "If not Lethram, then where?"
msgstr "¿No es Lethram, entonces dónde?"

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "If not for Vaelen, I don't want to think of were I would have ended up."
msgstr "Si no fuera por Vaelen, no quiero pensar en dónde habría terminado."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If not for his calm and serious personality, he could have passed for a crazed man raving on the streets. By the end, perhaps he had been as much."
msgstr "Si no fuera por su personalidad calmada y seria, podría haber pasado por un hombre loco delirando en las calles. Al final, quizás ya lo había sido."

msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "If not for me, saving you, that guards woulda caught you and you'd be swingin from a rope or worse by now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If not for the fact that he held her in place, Sarah was sure that she would have collapsed."
msgstr "Si no fuera por el hecho de que lo mantenía en su lugar, Sarah estaba segura de que habría colapsado."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If not for the fact that the guard had announced the time, Sarah doubted she would have known the time at all."
msgstr "Si no fuera por el hecho de que el guardia había anunciado la hora, Sarah dudaba de conocerla en absoluto."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "If not for the fortune of Fate, you would have raped me here all these years ago, and thought nothing of it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If not for the pain in her muscles and the sores on her feet, she could have imagined that they had barely moved at all."
msgstr "Si no fuera por el dolor en sus músculos y las llagas en los pies, podría haber imaginado que apenas se habían movido."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If not for the spiritual side of it, then at the very least for the connection it gave her back to her own mother."
msgstr "Si no fuera por el aspecto espiritual de todo, entonces, como mínimo, por la conexión que le devolvió con su propia madre."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If not for the trouble with the broken wheel, it was a perfectly lovely day."
msgstr "Si no fuera por el problema de la rueda rota, habría sido un día perfectamente agradable."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If not for these men, she'd have walked right into it."
msgstr "Si no fuera por estos hombres, habría entrado directamente en ello."

msgctxt "speaker:Vaelen"
msgid "If not for you, I would be the only one from the Brothers of Providence. I'd like to have more friendly faces in the room. Just in case."
msgstr "Si no fuera por ti, sería el único de los Hermanos de la Providencia. Me gustaría tener más rostros amigables en la habitación, solo por si acaso."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "If not him, at least his daughter, she didn't do anything wrong."
msgstr "Si no era él, al menos su hija; ella no había hecho nada malo."

msgctxt "speaker:Sigmund"
msgid "If not that, maybe see if you can get a position as a secretary somewhere. You can read and write, that's valuable."
msgstr "Si no es eso, quizás puedas conseguir un puesto de secretaria en algún lugar. Sabes leer y escribir, eso tiene valor."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If not the money and the security, she'd always have that, she thought comically to herself."
msgstr "Si no tenía el dinero y la seguridad, siempre los tendría, pensó con una sonrisa cómicamente resignada."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If not today, then when? And if some other day, then why not today?"
msgstr "¿Si no hoy, ¿cuándo? Y si algún otro día, ¿por qué no hoy?"

msgctxt "speaker:Duke Antonio"
msgid "If not, then why are you still here? Wasting both our time?"
msgstr "Si no es así, ¿por qué sigues aquí? ¿Gastando nuestro tiempo?"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If nothing else, it would prove a powerful weapon in her hands."
msgstr "Si nada más, serviría como un arma poderosa en sus manos."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If nothing happened, all present would take it as a sign of divine favor."
msgstr "Si nada sucediera, todos los presentes lo tomarían como un signo de la bendición divina."

msgctxt "speaker:Carolyn"
msgid "If one knew in advance if it was to be repaid or not, then there would be no need for a banker to begin with."
msgstr "Si se supiera de antemano si sería reembolsado o no, entonces no habría necesidad de un banquero en primer lugar."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "If only because these two would be the end of you without me."
msgstr "Solo porque estos dos serían tu fin sin mí."

msgctxt "speaker:Duke Antonio"
msgid "If only for my own good."
msgstr "Solo por mi propio bien."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If only for now."
msgstr "Si solo por ahora."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If only for this night, the two women offered up their bodies and all parts of it, to the spirit, who seized on them with unending appetite."
msgstr "Si solo fuera por esta noche, las dos mujeres ofrecieron sus cuerpos y todas sus partes al espíritu, quien se abalanzó sobre ellas con un apetito inagotable."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If only for tonight."
msgstr "Si solo fuera por esta noche."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If only she could bring them to listen. If only she could speak the right words."
msgstr "Si solo pudiera lograr que escucharan. Si solo pudiera pronunciar las palabras correctas."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If only she could trust her, Sarah continued to think to herself."
msgstr "Si solo pudiera confiar en ella, pensó Sarah para sí misma."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If only she could will it so."
msgstr "Si solo pudiera forzarlo a que suceda."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If only that vile poison finished passing through her system."
msgstr "Si solo ese veneno maldito pudiera terminar de salir de su sistema."

msgctxt "speaker:Gilead"
msgid "If only you knew how little you know."
msgstr "Si supieras lo poco que sabes."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "If possible, I'd like to arrange a meeting with my husband, not my general."
msgstr "Si es posible, me gustaría organizar una reunión con mi esposo, no con mi general."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If resistance had ever been an option, the men did not seize on it now any more than for any of the countless proceeding insults."
msgstr "Si la resistencia hubiera sido alguna vez una opción, los hombres no se aferraron a ella ahora más que a cualquiera de las innumerables injurias anteriores."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If she acknowledged her at all, it was so brief that even Sarah couldn't tell."
msgstr "Si la reconocía, era tan efímero que ni siquiera Sarah podía percibirlo."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If she can keep them safe by giving herself up...wouldn't that be worth it?"
msgstr "Si ella puede mantenerlos a salvo entregándose... ¿no valdría la pena?"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If she caused trouble...she'd be thrown out the same day."
msgstr "Si causaba problemas... la echarían el mismo día."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If she could have, she would have dragged the thing out of her cell and shut the door."
msgstr "Si pudiera haberlo hecho, habría arrastrado la cosa fuera de su celda y cerrado la puerta."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If she could hold the creatures back here, it would buy the people the time they needed."
msgstr "Si pudiera contener a las criaturas aquí, ganaría al pueblo el tiempo que necesitaban."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If she could not get a clear head, she'd opt for a a clouded one instead."
msgstr "Si no podía conseguir un juicio claro, optaría por uno nublado."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If she could win his favor, he might even offer her back her freedom."
msgstr "Si pudiera ganarse su favor, quizás incluso le devolviera la libertad."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If she couldn't feel close to a man like this, would she ever be able to feel that closeness again?"
msgstr "Si no podía sentirse cerca de un hombre así, ¿podría volver a experimentar esa cercanía alguna vez?"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If she couldn't feel close to a woman like this, would she ever be able to feel that closeness again?"
msgstr "¿Si ella no podía sentirse cerca de una mujer así, ¿podría volver a sentir esa cercanía alguna vez?"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If she decided he was good enough for her, who were any of them to think otherwise."
msgstr "Si ella decidía que él era lo bastante bueno para ella, ¿quién más podría pensar lo contrario?"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If she did, he gave no hint of it, sitting only stoically on the stool."
msgstr "Si lo hacía, él no dio ninguna señal de ello, permaneciendo sentado en el taburete con una expresión tan fría como la piedra."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If she escaped from the cage, it wouldn't be long before they'd notice and begin to search for her."
msgstr "Si ella escapó de la jaula, no tardarían en darse cuenta y comenzarían a buscarla."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If she ever thought she saw any emotion on the spirit's cold white face-mask, it was for the first and only time, a profound sadness."
msgstr "Si alguna vez creyó que había visto emoción en la máscara fría y blanca del espíritu, fue la primera y única vez: una profunda tristeza."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If she ever wanted any hope of reclaiming Rosanna, she would need these men. These monsters."
msgstr "Si alguna vez deseaba tener la menor esperanza de recuperar a Rosanna, necesitaría a estos hombres. A estos monstruos."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If she ever wanted to have any hope of escaping, she would have to learn the ways of the city."
msgstr "Si alguna vez deseaba tener la menor esperanza de escapar, tendría que aprender las costumbres de la ciudad."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If she failed or merely performed adequate, he would unleash his rage on her."
msgstr "Si fallaba o simplemente cumplía con lo necesario, él desataría su ira sobre ella."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If she faltered now, she would lose everything."
msgstr "Si ahora vacilaba, perdería todo."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If she gave him attitude, or held back, he would withold it from her."
msgstr "Si le daba actitudes o se negaba a cooperar, él lo usaría contra ella."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If she got strong enough, she could pass the exam and officially join."
msgstr "Si lograba ser lo bastante fuerte, podría aprobar el examen y unirse oficialmente."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If she had a care left for decency or privacy, she might have protested."
msgstr "Si le quedaba algún cuidado por la decencia o la privacidad, podría haber protestado."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If she had any worries, they didn't reveal themselves in her face or her body."
msgstr "Si tenía preocupaciones, no se manifestaban en su rostro ni en su cuerpo."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If she had been here during the Fall...would she have been among them? Or would she have died?"
msgstr "¿Si hubiera estado aquí durante la Caída... habría sido una de ellas? ¿O habría muerto?"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If she had been here longer...perhaps years longer...had she perhaps gone mad?"
msgstr "¿Habrá permanecido aquí más tiempo... años más... ¿habrá acaso perdido la cordura?"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If she had been raised to do anything, it was to entertain and draw the eyes of the people. This, she knew well."
msgstr "Si hubiera sido criada para hacer algo, fue para entretener y atraer las miradas de la gente. Eso sabía ella bien."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If she had ever imagined she knew love, she would forever remember it was a faint imitation compared to what she now saw in his eyes."
msgstr "Si alguna vez hubiera imaginado que conocía el amor, recordaría para siempre que era una pálida imitación comparado con lo que ahora veía en sus ojos."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If she had gone first, she might not have had a chance, but now, she could imagine an opening."
msgstr "Si ella hubiera ido primero, quizás no habría tenido oportunidad, pero ahora podía vislumbrar una apertura."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If she had hoped to make an entrance, she realized she made none at all."
msgstr "Si hubiera esperado hacer una entrada, se dio cuenta de que no hizo ninguna."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If she had hoped to talk it back down, she found her own words only encouraging it."
msgstr "Si hubiera esperado hablarle hasta calmarlo, se dio cuenta de que sus propias palabras solo lo alentaban."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If she had listened to him and gone to the citadel, she no doubt would know more."
msgstr "Si ella hubiera escuchado a él y se hubiera dirigido a la catedral, sin duda conocería más."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If she had not been hungry, the smell alone would have made her so."
msgstr "Si no hubiera estado hambrienta, el olor por sí solo la habría hecho comer."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If she had only known in her foolish days, the sorrow of his parting."
msgstr "Si hubiera sabido en sus días de locura el dolor de su partida."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If she had space to use her magic, she had the advantage."
msgstr "Si hubiera tenido espacio para usar su magia, tendría la ventaja."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If she had to describe a man that she would be less attracted to, she could not imagine how."
msgstr "Si tuviera que describir un hombre al que le fuera menos atractiva, no podría imaginar cómo."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If she had to describe it, it was as though she existed more acutely."
msgstr "Si tuviera que describirlo, sería como si existiera con mayor agudeza."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If she had worn a thing like this in Rosanna...unthinkable."
msgstr "Si hubiera llevado algo así en Rosanna...impensable."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If she had worn anything like this in Rosanna, and be caught...it would have been a scandal for the rest of her life."
msgstr "Si hubiera llevado algo así en Rosanna y me hubieran pillado... habría sido un escándalo para el resto de su vida."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If she hadn't known any better, she might have almost imagined it was an entirely different girl standing there."
msgstr "Si no hubiera sabido mejor, casi podría haber imaginado que era una chica totalmente diferente la que estaba allí."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If she hadn't known better, she could have mistaken the sound for mice."
msgstr "Si no hubiera sabido mejor, podría haber confundido el sonido con ratones."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If she hoped to regain her throne one day, how could she sit on it, knowing she let ordinary people suffer?"
msgstr "Si alguna vez esperaba recuperar su trono, ¿cómo podría sentarse en él sabiendo que había dejado sufrir a personas comunes?"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If she killed him, she'd likely have to kill a dozen more."
msgstr "Si lo mataba, probablemente tendría que matar a una docena más."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If she knew her place, he was kind to her...and Sarah had begun to learn."
msgstr "Si sabía su lugar, él era bueno con ella... y Sarah había comenzado a aprender."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If she let Kate get away with it...what would that signal to the others?"
msgstr "Si dejaba que Kate se saliera con la suya... ¿qué señalaría eso para los demás?"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If she let her go with no punishment, who knew if the story would spread, and next time one person with a rock would turn out to be a dozen."
msgstr "Si la dejaba ir sin castigo, ¿quién sabía si la historia se propagaría y la próxima vez una persona con una piedra resultara ser una docena?"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If she ran now, she could make it."
msgstr "Si huía ahora, podría llegar."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If she ran, the elements of the desert would kill her if Hassar’s soldiers wouldn’t. If she stayed in the camp, they would drag her back to him, now that he held her papers."
msgstr "Si huía, los elementos del desierto la matarían si los soldados de Hassar no lo hacían. Si se quedaba en el campamento, la arrastrarían de vuelta hacia él, ahora que poseía sus papeles."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If she refused the Daemon now...it would be Dalia that would suffer."
msgstr "Si se negaba al Daemon ahora... Dalia sería la que sufriría."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If she resisted, or slowed down, Sarah was sure he'd easily rip a fist full of her hair, straight from her scalp."
msgstr "Si ella se resistía o se detenía, Sarah estaba segura de que él arrancaría un puñado de su cabello, directamente desde su cuero cabelludo."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If she served him, he would commit himself to her."
msgstr "Si le servía, se dedicaría a ella."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If she stayed here, sooner or later he would put children in her."
msgstr "Si se quedaba aquí, antes o después le metería un hijo a ella."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If she stopped now, it would truly all have been for nothing."
msgstr "Si se detenía ahora, todo habría sido en vano."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If she struggled, Sarah could see the remnants of a great city."
msgstr "Si luchaba, Sarah podía ver los restos de una gran ciudad."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If she tried to run now, the odds were just as good that she would get lost, or end up nowhere at all."
msgstr "Si intentaba huir ahora, las probabilidades eran tan buenas de que se perdiera o terminara en ningún lugar."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If she tried to run, it would only look worse."
msgstr "Si intentaba huir, solo parecería peor."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If she tried to warn the soldiers, they'd do it in secret. If she spoke out publicly, they resented her."
msgstr "Si intentaba advertir a los soldados, lo harían en secreto. Si hablaba públicamente, la odiaban."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If she wanted any chance to invoke the Empire's support in fighting the Voidlings, she would need to gain an audience with them."
msgstr "Si quería tener alguna posibilidad de invocar el apoyo del Imperio en la lucha contra los Voidlings, tendría que conseguir una audiencia con ellos."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If she wanted him to uphold his part, she would have to uphold hers."
msgstr "Si quería que él cumpliera su parte, ella tendría que cumplir la suya."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If she wanted peace, she'd have to break away from the crowd."
msgstr "Si deseaba la paz, tendría que separarse de la multitud."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If she wanted to be ready for her new life, should would need a man like this."
msgstr "Si quería estar preparada para su nueva vida, necesitaría un hombre como este."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If she wanted to have any hope of saving her men, she needed to take to the field."
msgstr "Si quería tener alguna esperanza de salvar a sus hombres, debía salir al campo."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If she was awake or alive, she gave little hint of it."
msgstr "Si estaba despierta o viva, daba muy poca señal de ello."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If she was going to die, Sarah concluded, she wanted to live in this moment."
msgstr "Si iba a morir, concluyó Sarah, quería vivir este momento."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If she was going to do this, best she'd just get it over with."
msgstr "Si iba a hacer esto, lo mejor era acabar con ello cuanto antes."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If she was going to get out of it, she would have to be smart."
msgstr "Si iba a salir de esto, tendría que ser inteligente."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If she was so powerful, Sarah wondered why she often seemed to feel as if she lived at the mercy of her schedule."
msgstr "Si tenía tanto poder, Sarah se preguntó por qué a menudo parecía sentir que vivía a merced de su horario."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If she was to be pledged to one man and one man only, she would do so without reservation."
msgstr "Si iba a ser prometida a un solo hombre y a nadie más, lo haría sin reservas."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If she was to retake Rosanna one day, she needed to be in a position of strength. What did it matter whether it was entirely earned or not?"
msgstr "Si algún día tenía que recuperar a Rosanna, necesitaba estar en una posición de fuerza. ¿Qué importaba si había sido totalmente ganada o no?"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If she was to use it, it would need to be cleaned out as well, and wasn't it only right if she did so herself?"
msgstr "Si iba a usarlo, también tendría que limpiarlo, y ¿no sería justo si ella lo hacía?"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If she went after him, he would no doubt relieve her, but even in this condition, Sarah had fragment of pride."
msgstr "Si se lanzaba tras él, sin duda lo aliviaría, pero incluso en este estado, Sarah tenía algo de orgullo."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If she were queen, she'd have some leeway to shape her own fate, but there were still limits to what her society would tolerate."
msgstr "Si fuera reina, tendría cierto margen para forjar su propio destino, pero aún existían límites a lo que su sociedad toleraría."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If so, then Varga had mastered her body as surely as he had mastered any other skill he had ever put himself towards."
msgstr "Si es así, entonces Varga había dominado su cuerpo con la misma certeza con la que había dominado cualquier otra habilidad a la que se hubiera dedicado."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If someone found them, who cared, she thought."
msgstr "Si alguien los encontraba, ¿quién lo importaba, pensó ella."

msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "If that mage thing never works out girly, you might have the makings of a decent whore in you."
msgstr "Si ese asunto de mago no funciona, niña, quizás tengas el talento para ser una puta decente."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "If that makes me sound crazy-"
msgstr "Si eso me hace sonar loca,"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If that meant putting up with this, she would."
msgstr "Si eso significaba aguantar esto, lo haría."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If that was it, Sarah thought, she only stood to win."
msgstr "Si eso era todo, pensó Sarah, solo ganaba."

msgctxt "speaker:Marius"
msgid "If that's fine with you, of course, sir."
msgstr "Si eso te va bien, por supuesto."

msgctxt "speaker:Xanthippe"
msgid "If that's the case, we will abandon every position in the palace, let them overrun it. Every position, except one."
msgstr "Si es así, abandonaremos cada posición en el palacio y dejaremos que nos la tomen. Cada posición, excepto una."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "If that's true, that means he's more than two millenia old..."
msgstr "Si eso es cierto, significa que tiene más de dos milenios..."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If that's what it would cost, she'd pay it."
msgstr "Si ese era el precio, lo pagaría."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "If that's what you wanted in exchange for saving me...I would let you."
msgstr "Si eso es lo que querías a cambio de salvarme... te dejaría."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If the Fates had not wanted her to sleep with him, perhaps they should not have blessed such a man with such a cock."
msgstr "Si el destino no hubiera querido que durmiera con él, quizás no habría bendecido a un hombre tan terrible con una polla tan grande."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "If the Guard gets us, we're fucked...at least in there we got a chance, right?"
msgstr "Si los Guardias nos pillan, estamos jodidos... al menos ahí tenemos una oportunidad, ¿verdad?"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If the Khan wanted privacy, he could have it. He did as he pleased and it wasn't her place to question him."
msgstr "Si el Khan deseaba privacidad, podía tenerla. Hizo lo que quiso y no le correspondía a ella cuestionarlo."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If the Mythran army had not been here, as Vaelen had said, with its many supplies, Sarah feared that even the miracle of the lake would not save them."
msgstr "Si el ejército de los Mythran no estuviera aquí, como Vaelen dijo, con sus abundantes suministros, Sarah temía que incluso el milagro del lago no los salvaría."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If the Mythrans attacked, they would work as one. They needed to be able to do the same."
msgstr "Si los mythran atacaran, actuarían como uno solo. Necesitaban ser capaces de hacer lo mismo."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If the Tribesmen had spotted her army and prepared an attack, they would be unable to even retreat, blocked in by the sea."
msgstr "Si los tribales hubieran detectado su ejército y preparado un ataque, no podrían ni siquiera retirarse, bloqueados por el mar."

msgctxt "speaker:Xanthippe"
msgid "If the beating is bad enough, they'll fall back, at least for a few days."
msgstr "Si el golpe es lo suficientemente fuerte, se retirarán, al menos por unos días."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If the brunt of the horde managed to reach these people..."
msgstr "Si la mayor parte de la horda lograra alcanzar a estas personas..."

msgctxt "speaker:Thomas"
msgid "If the capital falls, the war is lost. We cannot allow this to happen."
msgstr "Si cae la capital, hemos perdido la guerra. No podemos permitir que esto ocurra."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If the captain wanted her to strip and service him, she simply did so."
msgstr "Si el capitán quería que se desnudara y le sirviera, lo hizo sin dudarlo."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If the cold grass had felt healing, the water across her skin felt like being born anew."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "speaker:Maeiv"
msgid "If the commoners are unhappy, they will play on their feelings of alienation."
msgstr "Si el pueblo está insatisfecho, jugarán con sus sentimientos de alienación."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If the creature had been here recently, they would surely find evidence of it."
msgstr "Si la criatura hubiera estado aquí recientemente, sin duda encontrarían pruebas de ello."

msgctxt "speaker:Carolyn"
msgid "If the girl walks away, she will tell stories of what happened here today."
msgstr "Si la chica se aleja, contará las historias de lo que sucedió aquí hoy."

msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "If the guards happen to notice me, I just run off through the crowd, it's perfect."
msgstr "Si los guardias me ven, simplemente me escapo entre la multitud; es perfecto."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "If the main army doesn't press on fast enough, we end up trapped without support inside the palace. All for...what exactly."
msgstr "Si el ejército principal no avanza lo suficientemente rápido, terminaremos atrapados sin apoyo dentro del palacio. Todo por... ¿qué exactamente?"

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "If the man is guilty of what you say, he will be punished."
msgstr "Si el hombre es culpable de lo que dices, será castigado."

msgctxt "speaker:Carolyn"
msgid "If the merchants fear for their safety and their wares, they will stop trading there entirely."
msgstr "Si los comerciantes temen por su seguridad y por sus mercancías, dejarán de comerciar allí por completo."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If the monster hadn't gotten her, then the soldiers would have. Too frail to live..."
msgstr "Si la bestia no la hubiera alcanzado, los soldados lo habrían hecho. Demasiado frágil para sobrevivir..."

msgctxt "speaker:Maeiv"
msgid "If the nobility is unhappy, they will play on their vanity and greed."
msgstr "Si la nobleza está descontenta, jugarán con su vanidad y su codicia."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If the others disagreed, there would be no single ruler for the Union."
msgstr "Si los demás no estuvieran de acuerdo, no habría un único gobernante para la Unión."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If the people watched their homes and farmland burn, even if she was not to blame, they would sooner or later ask themselves what the royal family was doing for them."
msgstr "Si el pueblo veía arder sus casas y sus tierras de cultivo, aunque ella no fuera culpable, pronto o tarde se preguntaría qué hacía la familia real por ellos."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If the prince had screamed, Sarah didn't hear it."
msgstr "Si el príncipe hubiera gritado, Sarah no lo habría oído."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "If the road is cut-off, we'll be stuck."
msgstr "Si el camino está cortado, estaremos atrapados."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If the spirit smiled back, its unmoving face-mask revealed nothing of it."
msgstr "Si el espíritu devolvía la sonrisa, su máscara inmóvil no revelaba nada de ello."

msgctxt "speaker:Carolyn"
msgid "If the stress of ruling ever gets too much for you...let me know and we can plan another session."
msgstr "Si el estrés de gobernar se vuelve demasiado para ti... avísame y podemos planear otra sesión."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "If the threat proves fake, the people will resent us."
msgstr "Si la amenaza resulta falsa, el pueblo nos odiará."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If the villagers had a problem with it, none spoke up."
msgstr "Si los aldeanos tenían algún problema con ello, ninguno lo mencionó."

msgctxt "speaker:Captain"
msgid "If the winds turn bad though, we might need to ration food."
msgstr "Si los vientos se vuelven adversos, quizás tengamos que racionar la comida."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If their behavior hadn't been enough to let Sarah know they were drunk, the smell would have settled it."
msgstr "Si su comportamiento no había sido suficiente para que Sarah supiera que estaban borrachos, el olor lo habría confirmado."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If their inconvenient partnering was a problem, it didn't seem to raise much of any. The mood in the bar remained amicable."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If their information had been wrong, and there was a unit of archers on the wall, it would turn into a bloodbath."
msgstr "Si su información había sido incorrecta y hubiera un grupo de arqueros en la muralla, todo se convertiría en una masacre."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If their position was weak, Kamal gave no hint of it."
msgstr "Si su posición era débil, Kamal no dio ninguna señal de ello."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "If their war is destined to fail, why would they wage it?"
msgstr "Si su guerra está destinada a fracasar, ¿por qué la librarían?"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If there could be such a place, this must be it, Sarah concluded."
msgstr "Si pudiera existir un lugar así, este debe ser el correcto, concluyó ella."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "If there isn't any water, I've surely lost my marbles..."
msgstr "Si no hay agua, seguro que he perdido la cabeza..."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If there was any demureness, neither had time to express it."
msgstr "Si había alguna timidez, ninguna tuvo tiempo de expresarla."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If there was cold in the garden in that moment, neither woman noticed any of it."
msgstr "Si había frío en el jardín en ese momento, ninguna de las dos mujeres lo notó."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If there was ever a way back, it was now closed forever."
msgstr "Si alguna vez hubo un camino de regreso, ahora estaba cerrado para siempre."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If there were Orcs or Goblins out there, there were no signs of them."
msgstr "Si había orcos o gobelinos por ahí, no había señales de ellos."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If there were orcs and goblins out there, they didn't show themselves."
msgstr "Si hubiera orcos y goblins por ahí, no se habrían mostrado."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If these men called over the guards...it would all be over for her."
msgstr "Si esos hombres avisaban a los guardias... todo acabaría para ella."

msgctxt "speaker:Xanthippe"
msgid "If they allow it, you will be included into our order as a mage of the first tower."
msgstr "Si lo permiten, serás incluida en nuestra orden como maga de la primera torre."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If they arrived during her attack...disaster."
msgstr "Si llegaran durante su ataque...desastre."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "If they break through the gates...the slaughter would be beyond...anything."
msgstr "Si logran atravesar las puertas... el masacre sería más allá de... cualquier cosa."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If they caught her, she'd have no choice but to fight them. If she waited, she was sure they'd move on."
msgstr "Si la atrapaban, no tendría más remedio que luchar contra ellos. Si esperaba, estaba segura de que se marcharían."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If they didn't like it, they didn't seem to show any signs of it."
msgstr "Si no les gustaba, no parecían mostrar ningún signo de ello."

msgctxt "speaker:Tribesman"
msgid "If they don't rebel in the city, they will challenge me to a duel when we ride back for the desert."
msgstr "Si no se rebelan en la ciudad, me retarán a duelo cuando regresemos al desierto."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "If they ever heard you speak ill of them, I don't think they'd ever recover. You really are their favorite person."
msgstr "Si alguna vez te oyeran hablar mal de ellos, no creo que se recuperaran nunca. Eres realmente su persona favorita."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If they ever leave, Sarah thought."
msgstr "Si se marcharan, pensó Sarah."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If they failed to unify their army, what would have been the point?"
msgstr "¿Cuál sería el punto si no lograban unificar a su ejército?"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If they fell short, or the Mythran's didn't have extra supplies..."
msgstr "Si no les alcanzaba, o si los mythran no tenían suministros de repuesto..."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If they found them, they'd be dead."
msgstr "Si los encontraban, estarían muertos."

msgctxt "speaker:Sigmund"
msgid "If they had been serious, maybe."
msgstr "Si hubieran sido serios, tal vez."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If they had lived simple lives, no foreign Khan would have sought to come for them."
msgstr "Si hubieran llevado vidas sencillas, ningún extranjero Khan habría buscado a sus parientes."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If they hadn't known who she was before, the soldier had just given it away."
msgstr "Si no hubieran sabido quién era antes, el soldado acababa de delatarla."

msgctxt "speaker:Jaeid"
msgid "If they hang me because of you, Sarah, it may just be worth it."
msgstr "Si me ahorran por ti, Sarah, tal vez valga la pena."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If they held course...they could make it. They could survive."
msgstr "Si mantenían el rumbo... podrían llegar. Podrían sobrevivir."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If they held the line, they would be sitting targets. She had to do something."
msgstr "Si mantenían la línea, serían objetivos fáciles. Tenía que hacer algo."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If they knew she begged him for every inch?"
msgstr "¿Si supieran que le rogaba por cada centímetro?"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If they lost this war...everything the man threatend would come to pass."
msgstr "Si perdían esta guerra... todo lo que el hombre amenazaba se cumpliría."

msgctxt "speaker:Gideon"
msgid "If they shut the gates, we could be looking at a long siege."
msgstr "Si cierran las puertas, podríamos estar mirando un largo sitio."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If they stayed together, she would live for him and he would live for her. She would have to abandon all her dreams."
msgstr "Si permanecían juntos, ella viviría por él y él viviría por ella. Tendría que abandonar todos sus sueños."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "If they went in by themselves, we should move up as well."
msgstr "Si entraran solos, deberíamos avanzar también."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If they were lucky, they caught child and could raise a noble bastard."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If they were preparing something, wouldn't they know?"
msgstr "Si estaban preparando algo, ¿no lo sabrían?"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If they were sounding them, that meant danger."
msgstr "Si los estaban buscando, eso significaba peligro."

msgctxt "speaker:Male Soldier"
msgid "If this is all you're after, how about you come and get it?"
msgstr "Si eso es todo lo que buscas, ¿por qué no vienes a por ello?"

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "If this is some kind of trap..."
msgstr "Si esto es una trampa..."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If this is what it takes, Sarah thought, she would offer it up for knowledge."
msgstr "Si esto es lo que se requiere, pensó Sarah, ofrecería todo por el conocimiento."

msgctxt "speaker:Xanthippe"
msgid "If this is what you wish, tell us now and we will leave by your command."
msgstr "Si este es tu deseo, dilo ahora y nos retiraremos a tu orden."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If this war was worth fighting, and Sarah believed that it was, then it was because she and her family offered something better."
msgstr "Si esta guerra valía la pena de luchar, y Sarah creía que sí, entonces fue porque ella y su familia ofrecieron algo mejor."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If this was going to happen, she'd rather nobody else would see."
msgstr "Si esto iba a ocurrir, prefería que nadie más lo viera."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If this was how a husband fucked his wife, she knew she could get used to it."
msgstr "Si este era el modo en que un marido follaba a su esposa, sabía que podría acostumbrarse a ello."

msgctxt "speaker:Carolyn"
msgid "If this was not a time of war, perhaps you could give into your soft nature, but for now I council that you remain strong."
msgstr "Si no fuera una época de guerra, quizás podrías ceder a tu naturaleza suave, pero por ahora te aconsejo que permanezcas fuerte."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If this was so unholy, for a human to couple with goblins, then why did it feel so utterly divine?"
msgstr "Si esto era tan impío, para un humano que se aparease con goblins, ¿por qué sentía que era tan absolutamente divino?"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If this was true, then she had not just lost their support. She had also lost their connections, their wealth and their armies."
msgstr "Si esto era cierto, entonces no había perdido solo su apoyo. También había perdido sus conexiones, su riqueza y sus ejércitos."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If this was what it took..."
msgstr "Si esto era lo que se necesitaba..."

msgctxt "speaker:Carolyn"
msgid "If together, we can restore our homeland, all of this will have been worth it a hundred times over."
msgstr "Si juntos podemos restaurar nuestra tierra natal, todo esto habrá valido cien veces la pena."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "If we all were to attack you from land, we might still not manage to break through the mountains."
msgstr "Si todos nos atacáramos desde la tierra, quizás aún no lográramos romper el paso de las montañas."

msgctxt "speaker:Tribesman"
msgid "If we are to die, let us make it a memorable death."
msgstr "Si vamos a morir, hagamos que sea una muerte memorable."

msgctxt "speaker:Marshal Edmond"
msgid "If we are to rewrite the laws, we must do so with an eye on the common folk."
msgstr "Si tenemos que reescribir las leyes, debemos hacerlo teniendo en cuenta al pueblo común."

msgctxt "speaker:Gideon"
msgid "If we ask the men to abandon their loot..."
msgstr "Si pedimos a los hombres que abandonen su botín..."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "If we break...just a little...we're all dead. Only if we stick together, only if we keep this company moving, do we even have a dream of getting out."
msgstr "Si rompemos... solo un poco... todos morimos. Solo si nos mantenemos juntos, solo si seguimos avanzando con esta compañía, tenemos siquiera la esperanza de salir."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "If we capture it early, it secures our road to the capital. If we fail and end up in a long siege..."
msgstr "Si la capturamos pronto, aseguramos nuestro camino hacia la capital. Si fallamos y terminamos en un largo asedio..."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "If we cross that desert and there is nothing on the other side..."
msgstr "Si cruzamos ese desierto y no hay nada al otro lado..."

msgctxt "speaker:Gabriel"
msgid "If we die, nobody will know of it. We cannot risk it. One day will make no difference in the outcome of a war."
msgstr "Si morimos, nadie lo sabrá. No podemos arriesgarlo. Un día no hará diferencia en el resultado de una guerra."

msgctxt "speaker:Gideon"
msgid "If we fail, we lose many precious days, are low on supplies, and we attack the capital from an inferior direction."
msgstr "Si fallamos, perdemos muchos días preciosos, estamos con escasez de suministros y atacamos la capital desde una dirección inferior."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "If we fall apart as he have in our past, they shall seek to put us against on another."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "speaker:Marshal Edmond"
msgid "If we fight divided, we will be crushed one-by-one."
msgstr "Si luchamos divididos, seremos aplastados uno a uno."

msgctxt "speaker:Sigmund"
msgid "If we leave now we can get to Gallow's creek before end of day."
msgstr "Si partimos ahora, llegaremos al arroyo de Gallow antes del anochecer."

msgctxt "speaker:Thomas"
msgid "If we let him live in exile, it won't be long until he's back."
msgstr "Si lo dejamos vivir en el exilio, no pasará mucho tiempo hasta que regrese."

msgctxt "speaker:Xanthippe"
msgid "If we let the Mythran army and its mercenaries into the city, who knows where any of it ends up."
msgstr "Si dejamos entrar al ejército de los Mythran y a sus mercenarios en la ciudad, ¿quién sabe hasta dónde puede llegar todo eso?"

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "If we manage to break through and take it, we can fortify the way in and out."
msgstr "Si logramos romper la defensa y tomarlo, podemos fortificar el paso de entrada y salida."

msgctxt "speaker:Ephraim"
msgid "If we move as fast as you say we do, we might catch them by surprise."
msgstr "Si avanzamos tan rápido como dices, podríamos sorprenderlos."

msgctxt "speaker:Tribesman"
msgid "If we perform this...in the eyes of my people, you will not be an enemy anymore."
msgstr "Si realizamos esto... ante los ojos de mi pueblo, ya no serás un enemigo."

msgctxt "speaker:Varga"
msgid "If we send them out now, they'll serve as little more than bodies to absorb arrows."
msgstr "Si los enviamos ahora, servirán apenas como carne para absorber las flechas."

msgctxt "speaker:Atilla"
msgid "If we stay together, we will be lost to one another. Don't deny that truth."
msgstr "Si permanecemos juntos, nos perderemos el uno al otro. No niegues esa verdad."

msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "If we stick together, each our luck is gonna turn for the better, I just know it."
msgstr "Si nos mantenemos juntos, la suerte de cada uno mejorará, lo sé."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If we stop, we die."
msgstr "Si paramos, morimos."

msgctxt "speaker:Gideon"
msgid "If we succeed, we have the element of surprise."
msgstr "Si logramos nuestro objetivo, tendremos la ventaja de la sorpresa."

msgctxt "speaker:Maeiv"
msgid "If we succeed, we shall be the rulers that re-establish the Union, after centuries of fragmentation."
msgstr "Si lo logramos, seremos los gobernantes que restablezcan la Unión, tras siglos de fragmentación."

msgctxt "speaker:Gideon"
msgid "If we take it, we secure food for your army and a road straight to the capital."
msgstr "Si la tomamos, aseguramos comida para tu ejército y un camino directo hacia la capital."

msgctxt "speaker:Captain"
msgid "If we try to cross the sea to the Union Kingdoms, we run out of food before we get half way."
msgstr "Si intentamos cruzar el mar hacia los Reinos de la Unión, nos quedaremos sin comida antes de llegar a mitad del camino."

msgctxt "speaker:Marion"
msgid "If we waste resources here, that means sacrificing them somewhere else."
msgstr "Si desperdiciamos recursos aquí, eso significa sacrificarlos en otro lugar."

msgctxt "speaker:Varga"
msgid "If we win the war before then, we can use the royal treasury to import food, but if the war is still going on by then..."
msgstr "Si ganamos la guerra antes de eso, podremos usar el tesoro real para importar alimentos, pero si la guerra aún está en curso en ese momento..."

msgctxt "speaker:Atilla"
msgid "If we win this battle today...if we survive..."
msgstr "Si ganamos esta batalla hoy... si sobrevivimos..."

msgctxt "speaker:Kravel"
msgid "If we wish to have any chance of bringing him back alive, we will have to act with extreme caution."
msgstr "Si deseamos tener la menor posibilidad de traerlo de vuelta con vida, tendremos que actuar con extrema precaución."

msgctxt "speaker:Maeiv"
msgid "If we wish to make ourselves immune to such dangers within, we must draft a Union wide decree, determining the political rights of all subjects."
msgstr "Si deseamos hacernos inmunes a tales peligros en el interior, debemos redactar un decreto de toda la Unión que determine los derechos políticos de todos los súbditos."

msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "If we're gonna keep doing this, I don't wanna get you pregnant."
msgstr "Si vamos a seguir haciendo esto, no quiero que te quedes embarazada."

msgctxt "speaker:Sigmund"
msgid "If you absolutely don't want to go back to the city, me and my men can take you there."
msgstr "Si no quieres volver a la ciudad en absoluto, mis hombres y yo podemos llevarte allí."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If you are not a slave, Sarah thought, then why are you here."
msgstr "Si no eres esclava, pensó Sarah, ¿por qué estás aquí."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "If you are suggesting-"
msgstr "Si estás sugiriendo—"

msgctxt "speaker:Gilead"
msgid "If you are to have any hope of stopping these creatures, you would need our aid."
msgstr "Si deseas tener alguna esperanza de detener a esas criaturas, necesitarás nuestra ayuda."

msgctxt "speaker:Carolyn"
msgid "If you attend that Union Council like this, they'll eat you alive."
msgstr "Si asistes al Consejo de la Unión así, te comerán viva."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "If you beat me, then I suggest you give a good try, Marion."
msgstr "Si me follas, te sugiero que lo intentes de verdad, Marion."

msgctxt "speaker:Xanthippe"
msgid "If you befriend her, she just might."
msgstr "Si la haces amiga, tal vez lo consiga."

msgctxt "speaker:Lily"
msgid "If you believe it, I'll believe it too."
msgstr "Si tú lo crees, yo también lo creeré."

msgctxt "speaker:Captain Belmont"
msgid "If you can even call what he's got a cock."
msgstr "Si puedes llamarle polla a lo que tiene."

msgctxt "speaker:Captain Belmont"
msgid "If you can get the idiot to swear to those rules, I'll let him live. But you'll have to go and tell him."
msgstr "Si logras que el idiota jure seguir esas reglas, le dejaré la vida. Pero tendrás que ir a decírselo."

msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "If you can stand the rats, it ain't all bad."
msgstr "Si puedes aguantar a las ratas, no está tan mal."

msgctxt "speaker:Captain Belmont"
msgid "If you can suck me off without getting wet…you can have all the gold."
msgstr "Si puedes chuparme la polla sin mojarte... tendrás todo el oro."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "If you can tell me so little of your Master, tell me then what is your purpose here. Why is the road littered in the bodies of these men?"
msgstr "Si puedes decirme tan poco de tu Maestro, dime entonces cuál es tu propósito aquí. ¿Por qué está el camino sembrado de los cuerpos de estos hombres?"

msgctxt "speaker:Sigmund"
msgid "If you can't find anywhere else to work, ask him for a job. You mention my name, tell him its a favor, he'll put you to work."
msgstr "Si no puedes encontrar otro lugar donde trabajar, pídele a él un empleo. Menciona mi nombre y dile que es un favor; te pondrá a trabajar."

msgctxt "speaker:Daemon"
msgid "If you cannot do the former, perhaps you should improve at the latter."
msgstr "Si no puedes hacer lo primero, quizás debas mejorar en lo segundo."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "If you cannot see that now, you will see it soon enough when hordes of those beasts descend on this city."
msgstr "Si no puedes verlo ahora, lo verás pronto cuando hordas de esas bestias desciendan sobre esta ciudad."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If you could see me now, Atilla, Sarah dreamed."
msgstr "Si pudieras verme ahora, Atilla, soñó Sarah."

msgctxt "speaker:Carolyn"
msgid "If you could see yourself like I see you now..."
msgstr "Si pudieras verte como te veo ahora..."

msgctxt "speaker:Kamal"
msgid "If you deem me worthy, ooh Great Khan, I shall accept!"
msgstr "Si me consideras digno, oh Gran Kan, ¡aceptaré!"

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "If you don't give a fuck about what I have to say, fine, but listen to me when I tell you that the men are growing restless."
msgstr "Si no te importa lo que tengo que decir, muy bien, pero escúchame cuando te diga que los hombres se están poniendo inquietos."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "If you don't know what it looks like, how will we know when we find it?"
msgstr "Si no sabes cómo se ve, ¿cómo sabremos cuándo lo encontremos?"

msgctxt "speaker:Xanthippe"
msgid "If you don't learn that, you'll burn out. You'll try to fix every injustice in the world, and it won't be long before you find yourself outmatched."
msgstr "Si no aprendes eso, te quemarás. Intentarás arreglar cada injusticia del mundo y no pasará mucho tiempo antes de que te encuentres abrumada."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "If you don't mind, I'd prefer to sleep alone."
msgstr "Si no te importa, preferiría dormir sola."

msgctxt "speaker:Carolyn"
msgid "If you don't regain your throne, you'll be forever at the mercy of others."
msgstr "Si no recuperas tu trono, estarás para siempre a merced de los demás."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "If you don't stand up and start acting like a leader that's worth a damn, they will turn on you."
msgstr "Si no te levantas y empiezas a comportarte como un líder digno de respeto, se volverán contra ti."

msgctxt "speaker:Hecate"
msgid "If you end up lost, there is no guarentee that we'll be able to find each other again."
msgstr "Si terminas perdida, no hay garantía de que podamos volver a encontrarnos."

msgctxt "speaker:Sakar"
msgid "If you ever don't want to tell me anything, just tell me to fuck off and I will."
msgstr "Si en algún momento no quieres decirme nada, solo dime que te vaya al diablo y lo haré."

msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "If you ever met a guy that treated you nice and proper, you'd be bored out of your mind in a week."
msgstr "Si alguna vez conoces a un tipo que te trata bien y con decencia, estarás aburrida de la muerte en una semana."

msgctxt "speaker:Jasmine"
msgid "If you ever want to have any hope of being freed, speaking their language is pretty much a requirement."
msgstr "Si quieres tener alguna esperanza de ser liberada, hablar su idioma es prácticamente un requisito."

msgctxt "speaker:Jasmine"
msgid "If you forget that, you invite only danger."
msgstr "Si olvidas eso, solo invitas el peligro."

msgctxt "speaker:Dalia"
msgid "If you give him what he wants, he'll treat you better."
msgstr "Si le das lo que quiere, te tratará mejor."

msgctxt "speaker:Razaphel"
msgid "If you give it what it wants, it will return the favor. It possess few desires outside of that base instinct, from what I have been able to deduce."
msgstr "Si le das lo que desea, te devolverá el favor. Posee pocos deseos fuera de ese instinto básico, según he podido deducir."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "If you give me your word, I will enter the city with you and settle this peacefully."
msgstr "Si me das tu palabra, entraré en la ciudad contigo y resolveremos esto pacíficamente."

msgctxt "speaker:Hassar"
msgid "If you give this place a chance, you might find that there are more chapters to your life."
msgstr "Si das esta oportunidad a este lugar, quizás descubras que hay más capítulos por escribir en tu vida."

msgctxt "speaker:Carolyn"
msgid "If you go out and kill him, you'll find that he is more trouble to you dead than alive."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "speaker:Matthew"
msgid "If you got any questions...honestly, ask your cellmate. I'm busy enough as it is."
msgstr "Si tienes alguna pregunta... honestamente, pregúntale a tu compañero de celda. Ya tengo bastante que hacer."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "If you had asked me...I mean...really asked me...I would have left all of this behind."
msgstr "Si me hubieras preguntado... digo... realmente preguntado... te habría dejado todo esto atrás."

msgctxt "speaker:Cassius"
msgid "If you had seen us, Sarah, you would have imagined us like demons."
msgstr "Si hubieras visto cómo éramos, Sarah, habrías imaginado que éramos demonios."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "If you harm my brother, I promise you that you will hang for it."
msgstr "Si le haces daño a mi hermano, te lo prometo: colgarás por ello."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "If you have any message, I'll gladly pass it on to him."
msgstr "Si tienes algún mensaje, con gusto se lo pasaré a él."

msgctxt "speaker:Jaeid"
msgid "If you have any questions, you can ask my dad, or me, or my sister Elsa."
msgstr "Si tienes alguna pregunta, puedes preguntárselo a mi padre, o a mí, o a mi hermana Elsa."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "If you have come looking for an executionor, I am not that person."
msgstr "Si has venido buscando a un verdugo, no soy esa persona."

msgctxt "speaker:Kate"
msgid "If you have to punish me, I get it. disobedience."
msgstr "Si tienes que castigarme, lo entiendo. Desobediencia."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "If you help me escape, I'll promise I'll make sure that the humans in the town won't hurt you."
msgstr "Si me ayudas a escapar, te prometo que haré que los humanos del pueblo no te hagan daño."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "If you hurt my brother, it won't end well for you."
msgstr "Si me haces daño a mi hermano, no terminará bien para ti."

msgctxt "speaker:Ephraim"
msgid "If you insist."
msgstr "Si te insistas."

msgctxt "speaker:Jaeid"
msgid "If you insult them, by words or by actions, they will have the excuse they need."
msgstr "Si los insultas, con palabras o con hechos, tendrán la excusa que necesitan."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "If you keep pouring this wine, I might overlook your transgressions."
msgstr "Si sigues vertiendo este vino, tal vez pueda perdonar tus transgresiones."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "If you kill him, it would just be you and me."
msgstr "Si lo matas, solo quedarías tú y yo."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "If you kill my brother, you and your family will live in infamy for centuries."
msgstr "Si matas a mi hermano, tú y tu familia vivirán en infamia durante siglos."

msgctxt "speaker:Xanthippe"
msgid "If you learned magic, you could turn a lowlife like that into ashes with the snap of a finger."
msgstr "Si aprendieras magia, podrías convertir a un miserable como él en cenizas con un simple gesto."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "If you leave him this land, it will only be a matter of years before someone cons him out of it."
msgstr "Si le dejas la tierra a él, solo será cuestión de años antes de que alguien lo engañe para quitársela."

msgctxt "speaker:Metis"
msgid "If you let the mind wander, it can really backfire on you."
msgstr "Si dejas que la mente divague, puede volverse en tu contra."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "If you need some time to process it, I'll-"
msgstr "Si necesitas tiempo para procesarlo, yo-"

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "If you never take the time to let down your guard and take in the beauty that nature has to offer..."
msgstr "Si nunca te tomás el tiempo de bajar la guardia y contemplar la belleza que la naturaleza tiene para ofrecer..."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If you offered him a crown, he'd probably hand it back."
msgstr "Si le ofrecieras una corona, probablemente se la devolvería."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "If you promise me this, then we can forget about this. But if you are ever caught again, there will be hell to pay, do you understand?"
msgstr "Si me prometes esto, entonces podemos olvidarnos de todo. Pero si te atrapan otra vez, habrá que pagar con el infierno, ¿me entiendes?"

msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "If you promise not to call the guards, I'll promise I'll be out of your hair."
msgstr "Si prometes no llamar a los guardias, te prometo que estaré fuera de tu camino."

msgctxt "speaker:Daemon"
msgid "If you promise to swallow all that I'll give you, you can come live with me again."
msgstr "Si prometes tragarte todo lo que te daré, podrás volver a vivir conmigo de nuevo."

msgctxt "speaker:Samayra"
msgid "If you protect us, as you promised, I will keep his end of the bargain, even if he won't"
msgstr "Si nos proteges, como prometiste, cumpliré mi parte del trato, aunque él no lo hará."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "If you put me out on a battlefield, I'd be dead in under an hour."
msgstr "Si me sacas al campo de batalla, moriré en menos de una hora."

msgctxt "speaker:Sigmund"
msgid "If you really want to help, you can cook the food when they get a fire started."
msgstr "Si realmente quieres ayudar, puedes cocinar la comida cuando enciendan el fuego."

msgctxt "speaker:Xanthippe"
msgid "If you really want to throw your mind for a trip, understand that some doors can even lead to places unconnected to here."
msgstr "Si realmente quieres lanzar tu mente a un viaje, entiende que algunas puertas pueden llevar incluso a lugares desconectados de aquí."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "If you saved me, it was entirely by accident."
msgstr "Si me salvaste, fue enteramente por accidente."

msgctxt "speaker:Razaphel"
msgid "If you say so..."
msgstr "Si así lo dices..."

msgctxt "speaker:Hecate"
msgid "If you see Xan again, tell him of what we saw."
msgstr "Si vuelves a ver a Xan, dile de lo que vimos."

msgctxt "speaker:Squire"
msgid "If you seek to harm my Master...I cannot sheathe my blade. My vow forbids it."
msgstr "Si buscas dañar a mi Maestro... no puedo envainar mi espada. Mi juramento lo prohíbe."

msgctxt "speaker:Lily"
msgid "If you spare my brothers and sisters, I will bend my knee and serve you as a knight."
msgstr "Si me dejas a mis hermanos y hermanas, me arrodillaré ante ti y te serviré como tu escudero."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "If you stay and you regret it, at least you can cry on my shoulder every day."
msgstr "Si te quedas y luego lo arrepientes, al menos podrás llorar en mi hombro todos los días."

msgctxt "speaker:Alfred"
msgid "If you stay, you must learn to live with it."
msgstr "Si te quedas, tendrás que aprender a vivir con ello."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If you stripped away all the illusions, this was who she was."
msgstr "Si quitabas todas las ilusiones, esta era ella."

msgctxt "speaker:Marion"
msgid "If you support his claim that Oliver attacked his transport, then he can depend on the protection of the Crown."
msgstr "Si apoyas su afirmación de que Oliver atacó su transporte, entonces podrá contar con la protección de la Corona."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "If you take me now, we'll have to be very quiet. Do you want to be very quiet?"
msgstr "Si me tomas ahora, tendremos que ser muy silenciosas. ¿Quieres ser muy silenciosa?"

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "If you think I'm going to get drink with you, you're not just a pig, but you're stupid as well."
msgstr "Si crees que voy a beber contigo, no eres solo un cerdo, sino también un idiota."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "If you think I'm going to touch your disgusting dick, you're even more stupid than I thought you were."
msgstr "Si crees que voy a tocar tu verga repugnante, eres aún más estúpido de lo que pensaba."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "If you think I'm gonna touch your disgusting hands, you're insane."
msgstr "Si crees que voy a tocar tus manos asquerosas, estás loco."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "If you think that I'm going to leave him alone...then you don't really know me at all."
msgstr "Si crees que voy a dejarlo solo... entonces no me conoces en absoluto."

msgctxt "speaker:Atilla"
msgid "If you think you’re going to beat me in pure muscle, you’re wasting your time."
msgstr "Si crees que vas a vencerme con pura fuerza bruta, estás perdiendo el tiempo."

msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "If you thought the guards were bad today, you ain't seen nothing yet."
msgstr "Si creías que los guardias eran malos hoy, no has visto nada aún."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "If you touch my brother, I swear to the gods, I'll bring ruin to you and everyone else in your house."
msgstr "Si me tocas a mi hermano, te juro por los dioses que traeré ruina sobre ti y sobre todos los demás en tu casa."

msgctxt "speaker:Captain Belmont"
msgid "If you tried to jerk him off you'd have to use your fingers instead of your hands."
msgstr "Si intentabas frotarle la polla, tendrías que usar los dedos en lugar de las manos."

msgctxt "speaker:Female Soldier"
msgid "If you wanna make up for using my body, how about I use yours?"
msgstr "Si quieres compensar el uso de mi cuerpo, ¿qué tal si yo uso el tuyo?"

msgctxt "speaker:Captain"
msgid "If you wanna tell me anything, I suggest you get it off your chest now."
msgstr "Si quieres decirme algo, te digo que lo desahogues ahora."

msgctxt "speaker:Duke Antonio"
msgid "If you want I can have the girl brought to your bed tonight?"
msgstr "Si quieres, puedo traer a la muchacha a tu cama esta noche?"

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "If you want I can still go back inside."
msgstr "Si quieres, aún puedo volver adentro."

msgctxt "speaker:Duke Antonio"
msgid "If you want a repeat performance, you only have to ask."
msgstr "Si deseas un nuevo espectáculo, solo tienes que pedirlo."

msgctxt "speaker:Maeiv"
msgid "If you want it...what will you give me for it?"
msgstr "Si lo deseas... ¿qué me darás a cambio?"

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "If you want me to become a mage, you're going to have to let me process this first."
msgstr "Si quieres que me convierta en maga, tendrás que dejarme procesar esto primero."

msgctxt "speaker:Jaeid"
msgid "If you want me to deny my nature, I won't do it. Yes, I thought about you."
msgstr "Si quieres que niegue mi naturaleza, no lo haré. Sí, pensé en ti."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "If you want me to tell you you've got a big dick, congratulations, but I think you know that."
msgstr "Si quieres que te diga que tienes una polla grande, felicitaciones, pero creo que ya lo sabes."

msgctxt "speaker:Duke Antonio"
msgid "If you want my vote, you're going to have to put some work in."
msgstr "Si quieres mi voto, tendrás que poner algo de empeño."

msgctxt "speaker:Mayor"
msgid "If you want to help us...help us!"
msgstr "Si quieren ayudarnos... ¡ayúdenos!"

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "If you want to make it up to me, then make it up to me next time."
msgstr "Si quieres compensarme, entonces compénsame la próxima vez."

msgctxt "speaker:Carolyn"
msgid "If you want to move them, you will need to generate a cause."
msgstr "Si quieres moverlos, necesitarás generar una causa."

msgctxt "speaker:Naydeen"
msgid "If you want, I can teach you. Show you how to please a man."
msgstr "Si quieres, puedo enseñarte. Mostrarte cómo complacer a un hombre."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If you watched for long enough, it could begin to feel like an ocean of green."
msgstr "Si los observas durante lo suficiente, podría empezar a parecer un océano de verde."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "If you went away because you stole some trivial amount of money from a market, I'd never forgive myself."
msgstr "Si te fuiste porque robaste una cantidad trivial de dinero en un mercado, nunca me perdonaría."

msgctxt "speaker:Carolyn"
msgid "If you were to let these people dig as much as they wanted, they'd never stop."
msgstr "Si les dejaras que excaven tanto como quieran, nunca se detendrían."

msgctxt "speaker:Maeiv"
msgid "If you were willing to pledge the output of your nation's blacksmiths to my country, it would go a long way in supporting my army."
msgstr "Si estuvieras dispuesta a comprometer la producción de los herreros de tu nación para mi país, iría muy lejos en el apoyo a mi ejército."

msgctxt "speaker:Hassar"
msgid "If you will have me, I will not hold back from you, but if you need more time I will respect your wishes."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "If you wish for me to bribe you, then you would to well to forget that notion."
msgstr "Si deseas que te soborne, entonces harás bien en olvidar esa idea."

msgctxt "speaker:Razaphel"
msgid "If you wish to learn of this book, truly learn it, you must commit yourself to the work that proceeds it."
msgstr "Si deseas aprender de este libro, verdaderamente aprenderlo, debes comprometerte con la obra que lo precede."

msgctxt "speaker:Marion"
msgid "If you won't learn, then I will make you understand the hard way."
msgstr "Si no quieres aprender, te haré entenderlo de la manera dura."

msgctxt "speaker:Duke Antonio"
msgid "If you won't play along and you won't leave, what do you want from me?"
msgstr "Si no quieres jugar y no te vas, ¿qué quieres de mí?"

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "If you work as a servant, you are paid a fair wage, are you not?"
msgstr "Si trabajas como sirviente, ¿no te pagan un salario justo?"

msgctxt "speaker:Nathan"
msgid "If you work hard, they treat you fairly. Most of the time, anyway."
msgstr "Si trabajas duro, te tratan con justicia. La mayoría de las veces, al menos."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "If you would be willing to teach me, I would be willing to learn."
msgstr "Si estuvieras dispuesta a enseñarme, yo estaría dispuesto a aprender."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "If you would let me sleep here, I would be forever grateful."
msgstr "Si me permitieras dormir aquí, te lo agradecería para siempre."

msgctxt "speaker:Lily"
msgid "If you'd been out there on that battlefield, you would have been dead in a minute."
msgstr "Si hubieras estado ahí, en ese campo de batalla, habrías muerto en un santiamén."

msgctxt "speaker:Marius"
msgid "If you'd like...I could take you there?"
msgstr "Si lo deseas... podría llevarte allí?"

msgctxt "speaker:Samayra"
