msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "In an instant, Sarah saw her opportunity as Oryon glanced away."
msgstr "En un instante, Sarah vio su oportunidad cuando Oryon desvió la mirada."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "In an instant, her hand burned bright, and the lock melted away."
