msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "In between her legs, she suddenly felt him grow larger."
msgstr "Entre sus piernas, sintió de pronto que él crecía."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "In between his screaming, more sounds of breaking and shattering bone."
msgstr "Entre sus gritos, más sonidos de huesos rompiéndose y astillándose."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "In between serious matters, Sarah would catch herself stealing glances at her now husband, and caught him often stealing glances at her."
msgstr "Entre asuntos serios, Sarah se sorprendía mirando a su ahora esposo y lo veía frecuentemente devolverle la mirada."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "In between spoonfuls of the soup and meat, she smiled at the old soldier who had made her performance possible."
msgstr "Entre cucharadas de sopa y carne, sonrió al viejo soldado que había hecho posible su actuación."

msgctxt "speaker:Sophia"
msgid "In between the border of the desert and the empires of the Far East, there runs a long stretch of green pastures."
msgstr "Entre la frontera del desierto y los imperios del Lejano Oriente, se extiende un largo trecho de verdes pastizales."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
