msgstr "Entre las hojas, podían ver el cielo azul y despejado."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "In between the sounds of his skin slapping against her ass with each thrust, Sarah imagined she heard something of pride in him."
msgstr "Entre los sonidos de su piel golpeando su culo con cada embestida, Sarah imaginó que escuchaba algo de orgullo en él."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "In between the two sides was the camp guard, trying to keep the peace."
msgstr "Entre los dos lados estaba el guardia del campamento, intentando mantener la paz."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "In between the work and Alfred's teasing, it wasn't long before Sarah had nearly forgotten that Marius had walked in on them."
msgstr "Entre el trabajo y las mofas de Alfred, no tardó en olvidar que Marius los había pillado."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "In between thrusts, she listened to his grunts, learning to discern grunts of approval and disapproval."
