msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "In between waves of orgastic pleasure, Sarah felt Caleb's cock expanding inside of her, one final time before she felt his semen filling her up."
msgstr "Entre oleadas de placer orgásmico, Sarah sintió la polla de Caleb dilatándose dentro de ella una última vez antes de sentir cómo su semen la llenaba."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "In between, she heard a woman moaning like a whore."
msgstr "Entre medias, escuchó a una mujer gemir como una puta."

msgctxt "speaker:Kate"
msgid "In case we don't survive this. So you know what you mean to me."
msgstr "Por si no sobrevivimos a esto. Para que sepas lo que significas para mí."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "In castle Reinmeer, she had always loved flowers and plants. The royal garden had been especially precious to her."
msgstr "En el castillo Reinmeer, siempre había amado las flores y las plantas. El jardín real había sido especialmente preciado para ella."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "In court, nobles played endless games of hiding their emotions and their intentions."
