msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "In her heart she found the affair horrid, but she forced herself to bear a cold gaze as she looked on."
msgstr "En lo profundo de su corazón consideraba el asunto horroroso, pero se obligó a mantener una mirada fría mientras observaba."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "In her heart, Sarah accepted her punishment."
msgstr "En el corazón, Sarah aceptó su castigo."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "In her heart, she worried."
msgstr "En su corazón, ella temía."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "In her memory, he seemed to loom even larger than in life."
msgstr "En su memoria, él parecía imponente incluso más que en la vida."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "In her mind she often sought him out and made stories out of the life he lived while away from her."
msgstr "En su mente, a menudo buscaba su presencia y tejía historias sobre la vida que llevó mientras estaba lejos de ella."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "In her mind she traced his body further. Past his arms, covered in muscles, down to his metalic abdomen, and his storied scars."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "In her mind she was ecstatic for it."
