msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Moving forward, they took to the field, guarding all the approaches on the hill, moving towards the Tribesmen."
msgstr "Avanzando, se lanzaron al campo, custodiando todos los accesos de la colina y avanzando hacia los tribales."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Moving her body in accord with Carolyn, surrendering herself to her assertive hands, Sarah could feel the pleasure build and build."
