msgid "My brother is healthy."
msgstr "Mi hermano está sano."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "My brother was down there, risking his life, and I was up here just watching."
msgstr "Mi hermano estaba abajo, arriesgando su vida, y yo aquí arriba, simplemente observando."

