msgstr "Mi hermano."

msgctxt "speaker:Ayaka"
msgid "My brothers and father went to lead the head of the caravan, and my sisters and myself were near the back."
msgstr "Mis hermanos y mi padre subieron para liderar al jefe de la caravana, mientras mis hermanas y yo nos quedamos cerca del fondo."

msgctxt "speaker:Ayaka"
msgid "My brothers and my father mounted for war when the hordes came."
msgstr "Mis hermanos y mi padre montaron para la guerra cuando llegaron las hordas."

msgctxt "speaker:Ayaka"
msgid "My brothers never so much as drew their swords."
msgstr "Mis hermanos ni siquiera sacaron sus espadas."

msgctxt "speaker:Gideon"
msgid "My camp still looks like shit. Most of them are too busy celebrating that they survived the desert."
msgstr "Mi campamento todavía parece una mierda. La mayoría están demasiado ocupados celebrando que sobrevivieron al desierto."

msgctxt "speaker:Carolyn"
msgid "My chef here is a delight. I don't think even Castle Reinmeer had one like him."
msgstr "Mi chef aquí es un deleite. No creo que incluso el Castillo Reinmeer tuviera uno como él."

msgctxt "speaker:Atilla"
msgid "My chieftain discussed this, but the other chieftain made an offer. An offer of gold and steel and slaves. He offered up so much, to save his son."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "speaker:Hassar"
msgid "My clan was nothing before I took the reigns, and should the one after me prove a fool, they will be nothing again."
msgstr "Mi clan no era nada antes de tomar las riendas, y si el que me suceda resulta ser un tonto, volverán a ser nada."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "My clothes?"
