msgstr "Mi decisión al respecto es definitiva."

msgctxt "speaker:Marshal Edmond"
msgid "My dinners have been a practicality for so long, I had forgotten what it was like to enjoy myself."
msgstr "Mis cenas han sido una cuestión de necesidad durante tanto tiempo que había olvidado lo que era disfrutar."

msgctxt "speaker:Kate"
msgid "My dreams have always been small, so to see someone like him who dreamed so large..."
msgstr "Mis sueños siempre han sido pequeños, así que ver a alguien como él, que soñaba tan grande..."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "My dreams, where I can see and smell and touch every part of you, as though we were never seperated."
msgstr "Mis sueños, donde puedo ver y oler y tocar cada parte de ti, como si nunca hubiéramos estado separadas."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "My duty is with my country, my heart is another matter."
msgstr "Mi deber está con mi país, pero mi corazón es otra cosa."

msgctxt "speaker:Lily"
msgid "My family betrayed you. Give me a chance, and I will work a lifetime to clean their dishonesty from my family's name!"
msgstr ""

