msgid "My family hails back centuries. Millenia."
msgstr "Mi familia remonta sus raíces a siglos atrás. Milenios."

msgctxt "speaker:Shah Mahda"
msgid "My family has always been loyal allies to your order. We shall receive you and your apprentice with all the hospitalities that are due."
msgstr "Mi familia ha sido siempre leal aliada de vuestra orden. Os recibiremos a ti y a tu aprendiz con toda la acogida que corresponde."

msgctxt "speaker:Marion"
msgid "My family has always been loyal to your father. Consider that loyalty one of many inheritances, passing from him to you both."
msgstr "Mi familia ha sido siempre leal a tu padre. Considera esa lealtad una de muchas herencias, pasando de él a los dos."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "My family has no use for fairweather subjects."
msgstr "Mi familia no tiene uso para súbditos oportunistas."

msgctxt "speaker:Samayra"
