msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Pleasure drove out every other sensation, and in time, even their reason."
msgstr "El placer expulsó toda otra sensación, y con el tiempo, incluso su razón."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Pleasure so fully drowned out every sinew in her body and every fragment of her mind that she could no longer even conceive of holding back."
msgstr "El placer inundó tan completamente cada fibra de su cuerpo y cada fragmento de su mente que ya no podía ni siquiera concebir la posibilidad de contenerse."

