msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Pleasure, but it wasn't enough."
msgstr "Un placer, pero no fue suficiente."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Pleasuring herself to the gift, enjoying without restraint, Sarah felt Lady Carolyn's presence despite her distance."
msgstr "Disfrutando sin reservas del regalo, sintiendo la presencia de Lady Carolyn a pesar de su distancia, Sarah se masturbaba."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Pleasuring him with her mouth and playing with his balls, she did her best to gain what little favor she could from him."
msgstr "Chupándolo y jugando con sus huevos, hizo todo lo que pudo para ganarse los favores que le quedaban."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
