msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Plenty of people had warned her, tried to argue against her decision, warned of the dangers, but she knew she had to go alone."
msgstr "Mucha gente le había advertido, intentado disuadirla de su decisión, hablándole de los peligros, pero ella sabía que tenía que ir sola."

