msgstr "Sarah observó al capitán mientras caminaba por la cabina."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked at the captain in surprise."
msgstr "Sarah miró al capitán con sorpresa."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked at the city for a brief moment."
msgstr "Sarah miró la ciudad por un breve instante."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked at the clothes that Jasmine held in her hands."
msgstr "Sarah miró la ropa que Jasmine sostenía en sus manos."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked at the creature and the two glowing red stones."
msgstr "Sarah miró al ser y a las dos piedras rojas brillantes."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked at the creature's face-mask."
msgstr "Sarah miró la máscara del rostro de la criatura."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked at the damage to the crate and then back to Alaric."
msgstr "Sarah miró el daño en la caja y luego volvió a mirar a Alaric."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked at the dress."
msgstr "Sarah miró el vestido."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked at the emptiness around the campfire and sat down."
msgstr "Sarah miró la vacuidad alrededor del fuego y se sentó."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked at the far side of pool."
msgstr "Sarah miró al otro lado de la piscina."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked at the flowers."
msgstr "Sarah miró las flores."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked at the front wagon, partially keeled over from the splintered wheel."
msgstr "Sarah miró el carro delantero, parcialmente volcado por la rueda astillada."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked at the girl and remembered their brief encounter many years ago."
msgstr "Sarah miró a la muchacha y recordó su breve encuentro hace muchos años."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked at the girl's sharp eyes."
msgstr "Sarah miró los ojos penetrantes de la muchacha."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked at the girl, confused."
msgstr "Sarah miró a la chica, confundida."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked at the girl, she seemed very casual for all she had survived only just so recently."
msgstr "Sarah miró a la chica; parecía muy despreocupada para todo lo que había sobrevivido tan recientemente."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked at the girl, she suddenly noticed her flushed face, her wobbling pose."
msgstr "Sarah miró a la chica y notó de repente su rostro sonrojado, su postura inestable."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked at the girl."
msgstr "Sarah miró a la chica."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked at the girl. She seemed entirely serious."
msgstr "Sarah miró a la chica. Parecía totalmente seria."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked at the ground."
msgstr "Sarah miró al suelo."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked at the ground. Ephraim often asked, even though the answer was always the same. Vaelen did not attend these things anymore."
msgstr "Sarah miraba al suelo. Ephraim preguntaba a menudo, aunque la respuesta siempre era la misma. Vaelen ya no asistía a estas cosas."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked at the knight, still sitting, unmoving."
msgstr "Sarah miró al caballero, que seguía sentado e inmóvil."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked at the knot and understood Belmont was right."
msgstr "Sarah miró el nudo y entendió que Belmont tenía razón."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked at the machine. Shiny. Chrome."
msgstr "Sarah miró la máquina. Brillante. Cromo."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked at the male slave, servile and downturned."
msgstr "Sarah observó al esclavo masculino, servil y con la mirada baja."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked at the man as she considered her answer."
msgstr "Sarah miró al hombre mientras pensaba en su respuesta."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked at the man, his sharp eyes hinted at an intellect."
msgstr "Sarah miró al hombre; sus ojos afilados sugerían una inteligencia."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked at the map again."
msgstr "Sarah miró el mapa de nuevo."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked at the map and the small figurines that represented armies."
msgstr "Sarah miró el mapa y las pequeñas figuras que representaban a los ejércitos."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked at the men carrying out the work, filling up the carts with supplies."
msgstr "Sarah observó a los hombres que realizaban el trabajo, llenando las carretas con suministros."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked at the package in her hand."
msgstr "Sarah miró el paquete en su mano."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked at the painting, taking in all the memories."
msgstr "Sarah miró el cuadro, absorbiendo todos los recuerdos."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked at the piles of books and partially read texts."
msgstr "Sarah observó los montones de libros y textos parcialmente leídos."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked at the plate in front of her, the first meal already served."
msgstr "Sarah miró el plato que tenía frente a ella, la primera comida ya servida."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked at the poor girl. She wasn't sure she'd ever slept on anything less than a royal bed."
msgstr "Sarah miró a la pobre chica. No estaba segura de haber dormido jamás en algo menos que una cama real."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked at the pot."
msgstr "Sarah miró la olla."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked at the scar, still lingering in the air. Alien."
msgstr "Sarah miró la cicatriz, aún flotando en el aire. Extraña."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked at the scene and was..."
msgstr "Sarah miró la escena y estaba..."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked at the sea and the horizon."
msgstr "Sarah miró al mar y al horizonte."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked at the sky herself."
msgstr "Sarah miró al cielo por sí misma."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked at the spirit intently."
msgstr "Sarah miró al espíritu con atención."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked at the spirit."
msgstr "Sarah miró al espíritu."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked at the spirit. It's face-mask revealed nothing of its emotions. Its voice never wavered."
msgstr "Sarah observó al espíritu. Su máscara facial no revelaba nada de sus emociones. Su voz nunca vaciló."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked at the spirit. The strange creature."
msgstr "Sarah miró al espíritu. La criatura extraña."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked at the walls of Calshure again."
msgstr "Sarah miró las paredes de Calshure otra vez."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked at the woman more closely, and it began to make sense."
msgstr "Sarah miró a la mujer con más atención y todo empezó a tener sentido."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked at the woman."
msgstr "Sarah miró a la mujer."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked at their bodies."
msgstr "Sarah miró sus cuerpos."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked at them for a while."
msgstr "Sarah los miró durante un rato."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked at where the door had been. A part of her wanted to try the thing again, but she feared he might return."
msgstr "Sarah miró hacia donde había estado la puerta. Una parte de ella quería intentar eso otra vez, pero temía que él pudiera regresar."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked away as she recalled a memory."
msgstr "Sarah desvió la mirada al recordar un recuerdo."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked away from him. These were things she'd rather not remember."
msgstr "Sarah apartó la mirada de él. Eran cosas que prefería no recordar."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked away from the fire, directly at her Father."
msgstr "Sarah apartó la mirada del fuego y miró directamente a su padre."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked away, embarassed, but nodded."
msgstr "Sarah apartó la mirada, avergonzada, pero asintió."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked away, feeling her face turn red again."
msgstr "Sarah apartó la mirada, sintiendo que su rostro volvía a sonrojarse."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked away, suddenly aware of how vulnerable her own eyes made her."
msgstr "Sarah apartó la mirada, sintiendo de pronto qué vulnerabilidad transmitían sus ojos."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked away, suddenly shy from his compliment."
msgstr "Sarah apartó la mirada, avergonzada de repente por su halago."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked away, to embarrassed to maintain eye contact with him."
msgstr "Sarah desvió la mirada, demasiado avergonzada para mantener el contacto visual con él."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked away."
msgstr "Sarah apartó la mirada."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked back at him and sighed."
msgstr "Sarah lo miró de nuevo y suspiró."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked back at him, fixing her eyes on his, to make sure he knew that she saw him as well. She softly swayed her body and continued to sing, sing directly to him."
msgstr "Sarah volvió a mirarlo, fijándolo con la mirada para que supiera que lo veía también. Balanciaba suavemente el cuerpo y seguía cantando, cantándole directamente a él."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked back at the crowd."
msgstr "Sarah miró atrás hacia la multitud."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked back at the imposing structure."
msgstr "Sarah miró de nuevo hacia la imponente estructura."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked back at the mirror and saw her dress for what it was. A uniform, to play her part."
msgstr "Sarah miró atrás al espejo y vio su vestido por lo que era: un uniforme, para interpretar su papel."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked back down, focussing on her work again."
msgstr "Sarah volvió a bajar la mirada, centrándose de nuevo en su trabajo."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked back into the fire."
msgstr "Sarah miró de nuevo hacia el fuego."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked back into the flames."
msgstr "Sarah volvió a mirar las llamas."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked back over towards captain Belmont, but he was in moments like this, entirely focussed on the task at hand."
msgstr "Sarah miró de nuevo hacia el capitán Belmont, pero en momentos como este, él estaba completamente enfocado en la tarea a mano."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked back towards the direction of the void incursion."
msgstr "Sarah miró hacia la dirección de la incursión del vacío."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked back up at him."
msgstr "Sarah lo miró de nuevo hacia arriba."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked between Varga and Kravel."
msgstr "Sarah miró entre Varga y Kravel."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked between the creature's legs. Its member still glistened with her saliva."
msgstr "Sarah miró entre las piernas de la criatura. Su polla aún brillaba con su saliva."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked closely at Alaric's face."
msgstr "Sarah observó atentamente el rostro de Alaric."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked confused at the man."
msgstr "Sarah miró al hombre con confusión."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked confused at the spirit and considered his words."
msgstr "Sarah miró confundida al espíritu y consideró sus palabras."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked confused from the man, to Samayra, back to the man."
msgstr "Sarah miró confundida al hombre, luego a Samayra y de nuevo al hombre."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked confused, for a moment forgetting what had transpired between them."
msgstr "Sarah se veía confundida, olvidando por un momento lo que había ocurrido entre ellos."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked confused."
msgstr "Sarah se veía confundida."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked deep into Kate's eyes, and Kate into hers."
msgstr "Sarah miró profundamente los ojos de Kate, y Kate los suyos."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked deep into Lily's eyes."
msgstr "Sarah miró profundamente en los ojos de Lily."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked deep into his eyes and could see hints of the pain that Ephraim carried with him."
msgstr "Sarah miró profundamente en sus ojos y pudo ver destellos del dolor que Ephraim llevaba consigo."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked deep into his eyes."
msgstr "Sarah miró profundamente en sus ojos."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked directly at Hecate."
msgstr "Sarah miró directamente a Hecate."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked directly at Sophia, effortlessly floating through the pool."
msgstr "Sarah miró directamente a Sophia, flotando sin esfuerzo por la piscina."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked directly at the spirit."
msgstr "Sarah miró directamente al espíritu."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked down and felt her hands tremble."
msgstr "Sarah miró hacia abajo y sintió cómo sus manos temblaban."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked down and found the woman still on her knees, looking up at her."
msgstr "Sarah miró hacia abajo y encontró a la mujer todavía de rodillas, mirándola."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked down and saw that one particular spray had missed her by only an inch."
msgstr "Sarah miró hacia abajo y vio que un chorro en particular la había rozado por apenas un centímetro."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked down as she felt her face burn."
msgstr "Sarah miró hacia abajo mientras sentía que su cara ardía."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked down at Garret. Broken. Begging for death."
msgstr "Sarah miró a Garrett. Roto. Suplicando la muerte."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked down at her own naked body."
msgstr "Sarah miró hacia abajo en su propio cuerpo desnudo."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked down at him."
msgstr "Sarah lo miró a los pies."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked down at the girl, who suddenly looked so very vulnerable."
msgstr "Sarah miró a la chica, que de repente parecía tan vulnerable."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked down at the letter that Queen Maeiv had send."
msgstr "Sarah miró la carta que la reina Maeiv había enviado."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked down at the letter."
msgstr "Sarah miró hacia abajo, a la carta."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked down at the pile of rags."
msgstr "Sarah miró hacia abajo al montón de trapos."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked down between her legs and saw the fragments that had been tied around her wrists and the piece that had been used to gag her."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked down from above as five of the soldiers laid dead, their corpses burning."
msgstr "Sarah miró hacia abajo desde arriba mientras cinco de los soldados yacían muertos, sus cuerpos ardiendo."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked down the hallway. Empty."
msgstr "Sarah miró por el pasillo. Vacío."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked down to the ground, trying to find the words."
msgstr "Sarah miró hacia abajo al suelo, buscando las palabras."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked down towards his cock."
msgstr "Sarah miró hacia abajo, hacia su polla."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked down, dazed."
msgstr "Sarah miró hacia abajo, aturdida."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked down, seeing the dirty alley streets."
msgstr "Sarah miró hacia abajo y vio las sucias calles del callejón."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked down, tears building in her eyes."
msgstr "Sarah miró hacia abajo, y las lágrimas se acumularon en sus ojos."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked down. She could see a deep groove cut into the wooden floor, drawing a runic circle."
msgstr "Sarah miró hacia abajo. Podía ver una profunda hendidura tallada en el suelo de madera, trazando un círculo rúnico."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked from the corner of her eyes at her host."
msgstr "Sarah observó a su anfitrión desde la esquina de sus ojos."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked from the pile of money, up to Alaric, and back to the money, as if trying to confirm what she was thinking."
msgstr "Sarah miró desde el montón de dinero hasta Alaric y volvió a mirar al dinero, como si intentara confirmar lo que pensaba."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked him in the eyes."
msgstr "Sarah le miró a los ojos."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked him in the eyes. Was she acting too submissively? Or not enough? She tempered herself."
msgstr "Sarah lo miró a los ojos. ¿Estaba actuando demasiado sumisa? ¿O no lo suficiente? Se contuvo."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked in awe for a moment."
msgstr "Sarah lo miró con asombro por un momento."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked in his direction."
msgstr "Sarah miró en su dirección."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked in his face for a way out. A way to keep this from happening."
msgstr "Sarah miró su rostro buscando una salida. Un camino para evitar que esto ocurriera."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked in the direction and saw a group of three women."
msgstr "Sarah miró en esa dirección y vio a un grupo de tres mujeres."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked intently at Vaelen."
msgstr "Sarah observó a Vaelen con atención."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked intently at the contracts."
msgstr "Sarah miró atentamente los contratos."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked into Kate's eyes."
msgstr "Sarah miró a los ojos de Kate."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked into Kate's eyes. Kate didn't make a secret of what she wanted."
msgstr "Sarah miró a Kate en los ojos. Kate no hizo secreto de lo que deseaba."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked into Lily's eyes and saw that same desire reflected back at her."
msgstr "Sarah miró en los ojos de Lily y vio ese mismo deseo reflejado en ellos."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked into Sakar's eyes and knew he was right."
msgstr "Sarah miró a Sakar a los ojos y supo que tenía razón."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked into Xan's eyes, trying to see what might move him."
msgstr "Sarah miró a Xan a los ojos, tratando de ver qué podría moverlo."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked into his eyes, he didn't even seem to waiver."
msgstr "Sarah miró a sus ojos y no parecía dudar siquiera."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked into his eyes, her heavy breaths mingling with his, pressing their foreheads against each other."
msgstr "Sarah miró en sus ojos, su respiración pesada mezclándose con la suya, presionando sus frentes una contra otra."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked into his eyes, they seemed filled with rage."
msgstr "Sarah lo miró a los ojos; parecían llenos de rabia."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked into his eyes."
msgstr "Sarah miró a sus ojos."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked into his eyes. His concern for her seemed genuine, and for whatever else, Sarah found herself calming down."
msgstr "Miró sus ojos. Su preocupación por ella parecía genuina, y, por lo demás, ella se encontró calmándose."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked into his eyes. His warm smile."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked into his eyes. Those same eyes she had seen when he first came to the castle. Old eyes."
msgstr "Sarah miró sus ojos. Los mismos ojos que ella había visto cuando él llegó por primera vez al castillo. Ojos antiguos."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked into the man's eyes. There was something oddly comforting about it."
msgstr "Sarah miró los ojos del hombre. Había algo extrañamente reconfortante en ellos."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked into the mirror and looked at herself."
msgstr "Sarah miró al espejo y se miró a sí misma."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked into the shops of the windows she passed by, being hurried along by Kate."
msgstr "Sarah miró por las ventanas de las tiendas que pasaba, siendo arrastrada por Kate."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked into the woman's eyes."
msgstr "Sarah miró los ojos de la mujer."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked next to her. Nick was still attached to her at the hip, and he dragged himself onto shore by his hands, but his skin had turned a frightening blue."
msgstr "Sarah miró al lado de ella. Nick seguía pegado a su cadera, y se arrastraba hacia la orilla con las manos, pero su piel había adquirido un color azul aterrador."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked off into the distance."
msgstr "Sarah miró hacia el horizonte."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked off to her sides."
msgstr "Sarah miró hacia los lados."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked off to the side and saw a wooden chest, covered with a delicate emblem."
msgstr "Sarah miró hacia un lado y vio una caja de madera cubierta con un delicado emblema."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked on Samayra's body with a hint of envy."
msgstr "Sarah miró el cuerpo de Samayra con un deje de envidia."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked on in awe as Marius reluctantly took a seat at the table."
msgstr "Sarah observó con asombro mientras Marius aceptaba reacios sentarse a la mesa."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked on the spirit, it's shape breaking apart, as if under some great stress."
msgstr "Sarah observó al espíritu, cuya forma se desintegraba como si estuviera sometido a una gran tensión."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked on, and continued to impress her will upon her creation, pushing the orb deeper into Xan's defenses."
msgstr "Sarah observó y siguió imponiendo su voluntad sobre su creación, empujando la esfera más profundo hacia las defensas de Xan."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked on, equally transfixed on him as he had been on her."
msgstr "Sarah lo observó, igualmente hipnotizada por él como él lo había estado por ella."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked out across her army and saw the Tribesman's charge falter."
msgstr "Sarah miró a través de su ejército y vio cómo la carga del Tributo se detuvo."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked out across the bay and saw the last of the unfilled ships pull in."
msgstr "Sarah miró hacia el puerto y vio cómo las últimas naves vacías entraban."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked out across the bodies of the men on the road."
msgstr "Sarah miró a través de los cuerpos de los hombres en el camino."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked out across the empty plaza."
msgstr "Sarah miró hacia la plaza vacía."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked out across the illusioned hall of her youth."
msgstr "Sarah miró hacia el salón ilusionado de su juventud."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked out across the room."
msgstr "Sarah miró hacia el interior de la habitación."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked out ahead as well."
msgstr "Sarah también miró hacia adelante."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked out ahead of her."
msgstr "Sarah miró hacia adelante."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked out ahead over the road."
msgstr "Sarah miró hacia adelante por la carretera."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked out and saw the awed faces among the moving crowd."
msgstr "Sarah miró hacia adelante y vio las caras llenas de asombro entre la multitud en movimiento."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked out each moment in awe at the sheer enormity of it all."
msgstr "Sarah miraba con asombro cada instante ante la inmensidad de todo."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked out from the alley as a woman slipped and fell."
msgstr "Sarah miró desde el callejón cuando una mujer resbaló y cayó."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked out of the window. It looked like a beautiful day."
msgstr "Sarah miró por la ventana. Parecía un día hermoso."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked out over the battlefield below."
msgstr "Sarah observó el campo de batalla desde arriba."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked out over the city."
msgstr "Sarah miró hacia la ciudad."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked out over the edge of the cart, spying through the metal bars that kept her trapped inside."
msgstr "Sarah miró hacia el borde del carro, observando a través de las barras de metal que la mantenían atrapada dentro."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked out over the fields that began just a few yards beyond the fence of the house."
