msgid "Sarah never wanted the crown for herself, but she accepted the role of regent, to rule in his stead until the day he would be better, though both feared such a day would never come."
msgstr "Sarah nunca quiso la corona para sí misma, pero aceptó el papel de regente, para gobernar en su nombre hasta el día en que él estuviera mejor, aunque ambos temían que tal día nunca llegara."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah never wanted to leave this moment."
msgstr "Sarah nunca quiso abandonar este momento."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah no longer only cried with her voice, but could now also feel the tears streaming down her face."
msgstr "Sarah ya no lloraba solo con la voz, sino que ahora también podía sentir las lágrimas corriendo por su rostro."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah no longer turned around to look, but outside, Kate crawled up to her feet as best she could, and stumbled away, tears still streaming."
msgstr "Sarah ya no giraba para mirar, pero afuera, Kate se arrastró hasta estar de pie lo mejor que pudo y se alejó tambaleándose, con las lágrimas aún corriendo por su rostro."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded absently."
msgstr "Sarah asintió distraída."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded again."
msgstr "Sarah asintió de nuevo."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded along as Lady Carolyn spoke."
msgstr "Sarah asintió mientras Lady Carolyn hablaba."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded along as Sigmund continued to explain."
msgstr "Sarah asintió mientras Sigfrido seguía explicando."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded along as he continued to explain."
msgstr "Sarah asintió mientras él seguía explicando."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded along as he explained it to her."
msgstr "Sarah asintió mientras él le explicaba."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded along as he spoke."
msgstr "Sarah asintió mientras él hablaba."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded along as she listened."
msgstr "Sarah asintió mientras escuchaba."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded along."
msgstr "Sarah asintió mientras él hablaba."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded along. She didn't know how to do any of that, but she was eager to learn or at least try."
msgstr "Sarah asintió. No sabía cómo hacer ninguna de esas cosas, pero estaba ansiosa por aprender o al menos intentarlo."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded and began to serve the men their dinner."
msgstr "Sarah asintió y comenzó a servir la cena a los hombres."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded and began to walk away as quickly as she could."
msgstr "Sarah asintió y comenzó a alejarse tan rápido como pudo."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded and began to walk back in the direction of the officer cabin."
msgstr "Sarah asintió y comenzó a caminar de vuelta hacia la cabina del oficial."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded and bowed."
msgstr "Sarah asintió y se inclinó."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded and excitedly retrieved the food."
msgstr "Sarah asintió y con entusiasmo recogió la comida."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded and followed Sigmund's instructions, climbing onto the front of the cart."
msgstr "Sarah asintió y siguió las instrucciones de Sigmund, subiendo al frente del carro."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded and intently listened to his every word. With each new lecture, new worlds began to open to her."
msgstr "Sarah asintió y escuchó atentamente cada palabra suya. Con cada nueva lección, nuevos mundos comenzaron a abrirse ante ella."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded and kept her eyes fixed on him."
msgstr "Sarah asintió y mantuvo la mirada fija en él."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded and left for her room."
msgstr "Sarah asintió y se retiró a su habitación."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded and left."
msgstr "Sarah asintió y se marchó."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded and motioned for the man to continue."
msgstr "Sarah asintió y señaló al hombre para que continuara."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded and placed her hand on his arm."
msgstr "Sarah asintió y colocó su mano en su brazo."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded and resumed her kitchen work."
msgstr "Sarah asintió y retomó su trabajo en la cocina."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded and smiled."
msgstr "Sarah asintió y sonrió."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded and thanked Garret for his help so far."
msgstr "Sarah asintió y agradeció a Garrett por su ayuda hasta el momento."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded and turned to leave."
msgstr "Sarah asintió y se dio la vuelta para irse."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded and walked away."
msgstr "Sarah asintió y se alejó."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded as Kate continued to list all the items they needed to set out."
msgstr "Sarah asintió mientras Kate seguía enumerando todos los artículos que necesitaban para partir."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded as Metis spoke."
msgstr "Sarah asintió mientras Metis hablaba."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded as she began to eat."
msgstr "Sarah asintió mientras comenzaba a comer."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded as she began to feel her body rock back and forth from Belmont's thrusts."
msgstr "Sarah asintió mientras sentía cómo su cuerpo se balanceaba de adelante hacia atrás con los embates de Belmont."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded as she contemplated what Sophia was telling her."
msgstr "Sarah asintió mientras contemplaba lo que Sophia le decía."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded as she eagerly accepted the second piece of bread."
msgstr "Sarah asintió cuando aceptó con avidez el segundo trozo de pan."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded as she felt herself entranced by the bloodied hand, moving, motioning."
msgstr "Sarah asintió mientras se sentía hipnotizada por la mano ensangrentada, que movía y señalaba."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded as she listened intently."
msgstr "Sarah asintió mientras escuchaba atentamente."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded as she listened to him explain."
msgstr "Sarah asintió mientras le escuchaba explicarle."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded as she listened."
msgstr "Sarah asintió mientras escuchaba."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded as she looked at the window, moonlight falling in."
msgstr "Sarah asintió mientras miraba por la ventana, con la luz de la luna cayendo dentro."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded as she read the letter."
msgstr "Sarah asintió mientras leía la carta."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded as she sat down opposite of him."
msgstr "Sarah asintió al sentarse frente a él."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded as she studied the map."
msgstr "Sarah asintió mientras examinaba el mapa."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded as she tried to keep up with Jasmine."
msgstr "Sarah asintió mientras intentaba seguir el ritmo de Jasmine."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded as the voice explained."
msgstr "Sarah asintió conforme la voz explicaba."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded as they silently moved about."
msgstr "Sarah asintió mientras se movían en silencio."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded at the correction."
msgstr "Sarah asintió ante la corrección."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded excitedly."
msgstr "Sarah asintió con una vorágine de anticipación, ansiosa por más."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded her head, afraid to anger the orc any further."
msgstr "Sarah asintió con la cabeza, temiendo enojar aún más al orco."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded her head, lowered her eyes, and continued her work."
msgstr "Sarah asintió con la cabeza, bajó la mirada y continuó su trabajo."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded her head."
msgstr "Sarah asintió con la cabeza."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded her head. Lady Carolyn was right."
msgstr "Sarah asintió con la cabeza. La señora Carolyn tenía razón."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded in agreement."
msgstr "Sarah asintió de acuerdo."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded politely."
msgstr "Sarah asintió cortésmente."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded softly and pressed another kiss on her lips."
msgstr "Sarah asintió suavemente y estampó otro beso en sus labios."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded submissively."
msgstr "Sarah asintió sumisamente."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded to each."
msgstr "Sarah asintió a cada uno."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded, absentmindedly."
msgstr "Sarah asintió distraída."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded, acknowledging the servant."
msgstr "Sarah asintió, reconociendo al sirviente."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded, and began to refill his cup again."
msgstr "Sarah asintió y comenzó a rellenar su copa de nuevo."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded, and grabbed onto Kim's hands more firmly."
msgstr "Sarah asintió y se aferró con más fuerza a las manos de Kim."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded, and her friend left the tent."
msgstr "Sarah asintió y su amigo salió de la tienda."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded, bowing deep before the captain."
msgstr "Sarah asintió, inclinándose profundamente ante el capitán."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded, but said nothing."
msgstr "Sarah asintió, pero no dijo nada."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded, but she was not entirely convinced."
msgstr "Sarah asintió, pero no estaba del todo convencida."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded, contemplating all that Lady Carolyn had told her."
msgstr "Sarah asintió, contemplando todo lo que la Dama Carolyn le había contado."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded, eager for work."
msgstr "Sarah asintió, deseosa de trabajar."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded, eager to be able to be of use to the group, repay them for helping her get along."
msgstr "Sarah asintió, deseosa de poder ser útil al grupo y pagarles por haber ayudado a que se llevase bien."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded, even though she had never touched a stove in her life."
msgstr "Sarah asintió, aunque en su vida había tocado una estufa."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded, feeling oddly grateful that he had decided to end his torture here."
msgstr "Sarah asintió, sintiéndose extrañamente agradecida por haber decidido poner fin a su tortura aquí."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded, grateful for her friend."
msgstr "Sarah asintió, agradecida a su amiga."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded, gratefully."
msgstr "Sarah asintió con gratitud."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded, mockingly."
msgstr "Sarah asintió, burlonamente."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded, putting on a brave face."
msgstr "Sarah asintió, poniendo cara de valiente."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded, realizing she quickly saw the same that he did."
msgstr "Sarah asintió, dando cuenta de que pronto comprendía lo mismo que él."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded, remembering everything that had happened that day."
msgstr "Sarah asintió, recordando todo lo que había ocurrido ese día."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded, resolute."
msgstr "Sarah asintió, resuelta."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded, she knew that much to be true."
msgstr "Sarah asintió; sabía que eso era cierto."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded, she'd long come to accept the same."
msgstr "Sarah asintió, ya había aceptado lo mismo hace tiempo."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded, showing him she understood."
msgstr "Sarah asintió, mostrándole que lo entendía."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded, simply because that was what she knew he wanted from him."
msgstr "Sarah asintió, simplemente porque eso era lo que ella sabía que él quería de ella."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded, stepping forward."
msgstr "Sarah asintió, dando un paso adelante."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded, still hestitant."
msgstr "Sarah asintió, aún dubitativa."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded, still smiling."
msgstr "Sarah asintió, aún sonriendo."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded, that seemed smart enough."
msgstr "Sarah asintió, eso parecía lo bastante inteligente."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded, then lowered her head and resumed her work."
msgstr "Sarah asintió, luego bajó la cabeza y reanudó su trabajo."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded, there was no real point in denying that he was right."
msgstr "Sarah asintió; no había ningún punto real en negar que tenía razón."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded, though she couldn't relate to what he felt."
msgstr "Sarah asintió, aunque no podía comprender lo que él sentía."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded, though she doubted it."
msgstr "Sarah asintió, aunque dudaba de ello."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded, though she had cleaned about as much in her life as she had cooked."
msgstr "Sarah asintió, aunque había limpiado en su vida tanto como cocinado."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded, though she knew little of engineering."
msgstr "Sarah asintió, aunque sabía poco de ingeniería."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded, though she wasn't sure if she could really let the matter rest that easy."
msgstr "Sarah asintió, aunque no estaba segura de poder dejar el asunto tan fácilmente."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded, turning her eyes to the ground."
msgstr "Sarah asintió, volviendo la mirada al suelo."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded, understanding it."
msgstr "Sarah asintió, comprendiéndolo."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded, understanding that she was for the most part alone in this place."
msgstr "Sarah asintió, comprendiendo que estaba en gran medida sola en ese lugar."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded, understanding where he was going."
msgstr "Sarah asintió, comprendiendo hacia dónde iba."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded, understanding."
msgstr "Sarah asintió, comprendiendo."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded, wordlessly."
msgstr "Sarah asintió en silencio."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded."
msgstr "Sarah asintió."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded. He could not afford to be made to look weak."
msgstr "Sarah asintió. No podía permitirse parecer débil."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded. He wasn't wrong."
msgstr "Sarah asintió. No se equivocaba."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded. It seemed the safest choice."
msgstr "Sarah asintió. Parecía la opción más segura."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded. It sounded vain, but she wasn't unaware of it."
msgstr "Sarah asintió. Sonaba a vanidad, pero no estaba inconsciente de ello."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded. Many of them still harbored their hatreds for the march through the desert."
msgstr "Sarah asintió. Muchos de ellos aún albergaban su odio por la marcha a través del desierto."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded. Of course, she thought. Of course he would charge them. He was just as Alaric had warned her."
msgstr "Sarah asintió. Por supuesto, pensó. Por supuesto que los cargaría. Era exactamente como Alaric le había advertido."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded. Perhaps she had pressed her luck too far with him."
msgstr "Sarah asintió. Quizás había empujado demasiado lejos su suerte con él."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded. Rosanna was part of the union, so she was more familiar with it than any of them might guess to know."
msgstr "Sarah asintió. Rosanna formaba parte del sindicato, por lo que conocía mejor a la organización de lo que cualquiera podría suponer."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded. She couldn't do much else but agree with him. They were in this together now."
msgstr "Sarah asintió. No podía hacer mucho más que estar de acuerdo con él. Ahora estaban en esto juntos."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded. She didn't know why that was important."
msgstr "Sarah asintió. No sabía por qué eso era importante."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded. She didn't want it to be true, but it was."
msgstr "Sarah asintió. No quería que fuera cierto, pero lo era."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded. She doubted he needed any hand at all."
msgstr "Sarah asintió. Dudaba que necesitara ninguna ayuda."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded. She felt proud enough about her achievement."
msgstr "Sarah asintió. Se sentía orgullosa de su logro."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded. She had forgotten herself, she realized."
msgstr "Sarah asintió. Se dio cuenta de que se había olvidado a sí misma."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded. She had only ever imagined cities to be permanent, like the capital back in Rosanna."
msgstr "Sarah asintió. Solo había imaginado que las ciudades fueran permanentes, como la capital de Rosanna."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded. She heard whispers."
msgstr "Sarah asintió. Escuchaba susurros."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded. She imagined her own concerns to run deeper, but she was happy to realize she wasn't the only one that wanted to leave."
msgstr "Sarah asintió. Imaginó que sus propias preocupaciones eran más profundas, pero se alegró de darse cuenta de que no era la única que deseaba irse."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded. She just hoped it was true, for his sake."
msgstr "Sarah asintió. Solo esperaba que fuera cierto, por su bien."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded. She knew it was the truth."
msgstr "Sarah asintió. Sabía que era verdad."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded. She knew she'd made a mistake."
msgstr "Sarah asintió. Sabía que había cometido un error."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded. She knew the story well by now."
msgstr "Sarah asintió. Ya conocía bien la historia."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded. She meant every word of it."
msgstr "Sarah asintió. Sentía cada palabra."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded. She tried to keep her mind from running wild."
msgstr "Sarah asintió. Intentó mantener la mente quieta."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded. She wanted much the same."
msgstr "Sarah asintió. Deseaba lo mismo."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded. This part too, she had heard."
msgstr "Sarah asintió. También esta parte, la había oído."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded. Those had been beautiful."
msgstr "Sarah asintió. Aquellas habían sido hermosas."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded. Whatever disgust she might feel was meaningless. She could do nothing to stop it."
msgstr "Sarah asintió. Cualquier repulsión que pudiera sentir era insignificante. No podía hacer nada para detenerla."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nods, knowing not what else to say."
msgstr "Sarah asiente, sabiendo que no tiene nada más que decir."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nods."
msgstr "Sarah asiente."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah noticed Kate turning more quiet, more inward."
msgstr "Sarah notó que Kate se volvía más callada, más introspectiva."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah noticed Sakar was carrying nothing, leaving Krip to do the heavy lifting."
msgstr "Sarah notó que Sakar no llevaba nada, dejando a Krip con la carga pesada."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah noticed a ring on Hassar's finger, glowing with a bright crimson glow."
msgstr "Sarah notó un anillo en el dedo de Hassar, que brillaba con una luz carmesí intensa."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah noticed from the corners of her eyes that Ephraim had at some point taken off his clothes and was now naked."
msgstr "Sarah notó en las esquinas de sus ojos que Ephraim ya se había quitado la ropa y ahora estaba desnudo."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah noticed he was quickly changing the subject from where he was going, back to her lessons."
msgstr "Sarah notó que él cambiaba rápidamente el tema de a dónde iba, volviendo a sus lecciones."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah noticed her staring just a moment too long."
msgstr "Sarah notó que la miraba un instante demasiado largo."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah noticed him as he walked."
msgstr "Sarah lo notó mientras caminaba."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah noticed his broad steps, how he held up his sword, ready to strike. There was no hestitation."
msgstr "Sarah notó sus amplios pasos, cómo sostenía su espada lista para atacar. No había vacilación."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah noticed how Carolyn carried herself. She exuded an air of supreme confidence in herself. As if there was no doubt that she belonged on the council."
msgstr "Sarah notó cómo se portaba Carolyn. Desprendía una aura de confianza suprema en sí misma, como si no hubiera ninguna duda de que pertenecía al consejo."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah noticed how Kate had lingered on the word wife. As if there was some special significance to that fact."
msgstr "Sarah notó cómo Kate se había detenido en la palabra esposa, como si ese hecho tuviera algún significado especial."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah noticed it wasn't only the women who suffered the soldier's desires."
msgstr "Sarah notó que no eran solo las mujeres quienes sufrían los deseos del soldado."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah noticed something off about him. Her heart began to race. Something was wrong."
msgstr "Sarah notó algo extraño en él. Su corazón comenzó a latir con fuerza. Algo no estaba bien."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah noticed that Kate had gotten angrier."
msgstr "Sarah notó que Kate se había vuelto más furiosa."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah noticed that Samayra was looking directly at her."
msgstr "Sarah notó que Samayra la miraba directamente."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah noticed that fact. It was an odd thing to notice."
msgstr "Sarah notó ese hecho. Era algo extraño notar."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah noticed that he had called her princess. She imagined Kate had told Vaelen more or less everything."
msgstr "Sarah notó que la había llamado princesa. Imaginó que Kate le habría contado a Vaelen más o menos todo."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah noticed that he had not yet noticed her."
msgstr "Sarah notó que aún no la había visto."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah noticed that he was agitated."
msgstr "Sarah notó que estaba agitado."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah noticed that the orc was holding a package."
msgstr "Sarah notó que el orco sostenía un paquete."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah noticed the heavy stains of sweat on his clothes. He had worked himself to the bone again."
msgstr "Sarah notó las manchas pesadas de sudor en su ropa. Había trabajado hasta el hueso otra vez."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah noticed the way she carried herself."
msgstr "Sarah notó la forma en que se portaba ella misma."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah noticed the woman was smiling at her."
msgstr "Sarah notó que la mujer le sonreía."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah noticed this had happened every time."
msgstr "Sarah notó que esto había sucedido cada vez."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah now realized that as heavy as the blows had been so far, in truth, Atilla had still been holding back."
msgstr "Sarah ahora comprendía que, aunque los golpes habían sido tan duros hasta el momento, en verdad Atilla aún se había contenido."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah obediently turned her body around, laying down on her stomach."
msgstr "Sarah obedeció y giró su cuerpo, acostándose de bruces."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah obeyed every instruction, as the ritual played out around her."
msgstr "Sarah obedeció cada instrucción mientras el ritual se desarrollaba a su alrededor."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah obeyed her new mentor."
msgstr "Sarah obedeció a su nuevo mentor."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah obeyed him."
msgstr "Sarah obedeció a él."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah obeyed him. Part of her enjoyed the simplicity that being with the captain offered. Simply doing as you're told."
