msgstr "Sarah observó con curiosidad cómo Cassius sostenía el otro brazo de Vaelen entre sus manos, con la hoja apenas a un pulgada de su garganta."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah watched as Cassius looked back at her, frowning."
msgstr "Sarah observó cómo Cassius la miraba de nuevo, frunciendo el ceño."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah watched as Cassius solemnly nodded at his sister."
msgstr "Sarah observó cómo Cassius asintió solemnmente a su hermana."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah watched as Cassius strode past her, out onto the open area which now had become like an arena."
msgstr "Sarah observó cómo Cassius se dirigía a paso firme junto a ella, hacia el espacio abierto que ahora parecía una arena."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah watched as Cassius stroked his chin."
msgstr "Sarah observó mientras Cassius acariciaba su barbilla."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah watched as Dalia began to moan wildly."
msgstr "Sarah observó cómo Dalia comenzó a gemir salvajemente."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah watched as Dalia cried out at the sudden force."
msgstr "Sarah observó cómo Dalia gritaba ante la fuerza repentina."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah watched as Dalia eagerly lunged towards the thing."
msgstr "Sarah observó cómo Dalia saltó con avidez hacia la cosa."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah watched as Dalia opened her mouth wide."
msgstr "Sarah observó cómo Dalia abrió la boca de par en par."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah watched as Dalia raised her behind, exposing her sex to the demanding creature."
msgstr "Sarah observó cómo Dalia levantaba su trasero, exponiendo su coño a la criatura exigente."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah watched as Dalia remained sprawled on the floor."
msgstr "Sarah observó cómo Dalia permanecía tendida en el suelo."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah watched as Dalia slid two fingers inside herself, quickly pistoning in and out."
msgstr "Sarah observó cómo Dalia deslizaba dos dedos dentro de sí misma, moviéndolos rápidamente de adentro hacia afuera."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah watched as Dalia's eyes went numb."
msgstr "Sarah observó cómo los ojos de Dalia se volvieron vacíos."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah watched as Dalia's hands went up to her face and body."
msgstr "Sarah observó cómo las manos de Dalia subían hacia su rostro y su cuerpo."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah watched as Dio explained herself. There was an ease in how she moved and spoke."
msgstr "Sarah observó cómo Dio se explicaba. Había una naturalidad en su forma de moverse y hablar."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah watched as Dio handed her a piece of bread."
msgstr "Sarah observó cómo Dio le entregaba un trozo de pan."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah watched as Duke Antonion descended on her with all smiles and offers of help."
msgstr "Sarah observó cómo el duque Antonion descendía hacia ella con toda una sonrisa y ofertas de ayuda."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah watched as Ephraim and Caleb exchanged a meaningful glance."
msgstr "Sarah observó cómo Efraín y Caleb intercambiaron una mirada significativa."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah watched as Ephraim slowly made his way down the hill, heading back towards Bagrad."
msgstr "Sarah observó cómo Ephraim bajaba lentamente la ladera, dirigiéndose de nuevo hacia Bagrad."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah watched as Ephraim turned his face away from her."
msgstr "Sarah observó cómo Ephraim desviaba la mirada."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah watched as Eula leaned back and began to fumble with her pants."
msgstr "Sarah observó cómo Eula se recostó y comenzó a desabrocharse los pantalones."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah watched as Garret kept his pace."
msgstr "Sarah observó cómo Garrett mantenía su ritmo."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah watched as Garret stood up and took off his own clothes."
msgstr "Sarah observó cómo Garrett se puso de pie y se quitó la ropa."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah watched as Garret unfurled a map."
msgstr "Sarah observó cómo Garrett desplegó un mapa."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah watched as Garret's jaw went so wide, it almost seemed as if it had split apart."
msgstr "Sarah observó cómo la mandíbula de Garret se abría tanto que parecía a punto de partirse en dos."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah watched as Gideon sat down, rubbing his temples."
msgstr "Sarah observó cómo Gideon se sentaba, frotándose las sienes."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah watched as Hecate held up her palms."
msgstr "Sarah observó cómo Hécate levantaba sus palmas."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah watched as Hecate planted herself on all fours, towering over Sarah."
msgstr "Sarah observó cómo Hecate se colocó sobre cuatro patas, dominando a Sarah."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah watched as Hugh crossed the room towards her."
msgstr "Sarah observó cómo Hugh cruzaba la habitación hacia ella."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah watched as Hugh placed one hand on Alaric, and easily pushed him over."
msgstr "Sarah observó cómo Hugh colocaba una mano en Alaric y lo empujaba fácilmente hacia atrás."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah watched as Jaeid began to strip himself of his armor."
msgstr "Sarah observó cómo Jaeid comenzó a quitarse la armadura."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah watched as Jaeid extended a small plate filled with food to her."
msgstr "Sarah observó cómo Jaeid extendió un pequeño plato lleno de comida hacia ella."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah watched as Jaied left the room, retiring to his own."
msgstr "Sarah la miró mientras Jaied salía de la habitación, retirándose a su propio aposento."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah watched as Jasmine dissapeared from the room, returning only a moment later."
msgstr "Sarah observó cómo Jasmine desaparecía de la habitación, regresando solo un momento después."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah watched as Kamal's head rolled from its stump."
msgstr "Sarah observó cómo la cabeza de Kamal rodaba desde su muñón."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah watched as Kate began pulling up the anchor to free the ship."
msgstr "Sarah observó cómo Kate comenzó a izar la ancla para liberar el barco."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah watched as Kate began to throw off her own clothes."
msgstr "Sarah observó cómo Kate comenzó a quitarse la ropa."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah watched as Kate endured, carrying the punishment without yielding anything."
msgstr "Sarah observó cómo Kate aguantaba, soportando el castigo sin ceder nada."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah watched as Kate gestured towards the celebrating crowd."
msgstr "Sarah observó cómo Kate señalaba a la multitud que celebraba."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah watched as Kate got up and walked away suddenly."
msgstr "Sarah observó cómo Kate se levantaba y se alejaba de repente."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah watched as Kate held up the bottle in front of her and turned it over."
msgstr "Sarah observó cómo Kate sostenía la botella frente a ella y la giraba."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah watched as Kate pulled a dagger from her hip, stabbing the Tribesman in his hip."
msgstr "Sarah observó cómo Kate sacó un puñal de su cadera y lo clavó en la cadera del tribuciano."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah watched as Kate quickly stormed out of the tent."
msgstr "Sarah observó cómo Kate salió corriendo rápidamente de la tienda."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah watched as Kate ran off towards Samayra."
msgstr "Sarah observó cómo Kate se alejaba hacia Samayra."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah watched as Kate reached down, slipping free the belt from her waist."
msgstr "Sarah observó cómo Kate se agachó y desabrochó el cinturón de su cintura."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah watched as Kate rubbed the tears from her eyes."
msgstr "Sarah observó mientras Kate se secaba las lágrimas de los ojos."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah watched as Kate slowly went down onto her knees, her tongue sliding down from Sarah's neck, across her breasts, her stomach, until eventually, down between her legs."
msgstr "Sarah observó mientras Kate se arrodillaba lentamente, deslizando su lengua desde el cuello de Sarah, pasando por sus pechos y su vientre, hasta finalmente llegar entre sus piernas."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah watched as Kate stared off across the square, her head swaying from side to side."
msgstr "Sarah observó cómo Kate miraba fijamente a través de la plaza, con la cabeza moviendo de un lado a otro."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah watched as Kate stretched out, laying back comfortably in the bed, slowly spreading her legs."
msgstr "Sarah observó cómo Kate se estiraba, recostándose cómodamente en la cama y abriendo lentamente las piernas."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah watched as Kate stripped."
msgstr "Sarah observó cómo Kate se desnudaba."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah watched as Kate stumbled onto her feet. Nearly falling several times as she tried."
msgstr "Sarah observó cómo Kate tambaleaba al ponerse de pie, cayendo casi varias veces mientras lo intentaba."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah watched as Kate threw back another drink."
msgstr "Sarah observó cómo Kate se tragó otro trago."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah watched as Kate turned to gather the soldiers and exit the throne room."
msgstr "Sarah observó cómo Kate se giraba para reunir a los soldados y salir de la sala del trono."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah watched as Krip was the first to get up and wobble away. As usual, he said few if any words."
msgstr "Sarah observó cómo Krip fue el primero en levantarse y tambalearse hacia fuera. Como de costumbre, apenas decía nada."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah watched as Lady Carolyn calmly explained all of it. Almost without emotion."
msgstr "Sarah observó cómo la Dama Carolyn explicaba tranquilamente todo aquello. Casi sin emoción."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah watched as Lady Carolyn gracefully slid onto one of the sofas in the room."
msgstr "Sarah observó cómo Lady Carolyn se deslizaba con elegancia sobre uno de los sofás de la sala."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah watched as Lady Carolyn laid out the documents on the table, one by one she explained and dicussed their budgets."
msgstr "Sarah observó cómo Lady Carolyn colocaba los documentos sobre la mesa; uno a uno, los explicaba y discutía sus presupuestos."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah watched as Lady Carolyn only smiled at her."
msgstr "Sarah observó cómo Lady Carolyn solo sonreía a ella."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah watched as Lady Carolyn sauntered away, slowly disrobing. Her intentions were obvious."
msgstr "Sarah observó cómo Lady Carolyn se alejaba con paso lento, desvisténdose poco a poco. Sus intenciones eran obvias."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah watched as Lady Carolyn stepped behind the curtain."
msgstr "Sarah observó cómo Lady Carolyn dio un paso detrás de la cortina."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah watched as Lady Carolyn suddenly leaned forward, crossing the distance between them in the bathtub."
msgstr "Sarah observó cómo Lady Carolyn se inclinaba de repente, recorriendo la distancia que las separaba dentro de la bañera."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah watched as Lady Carolyn turned her head, looking out across the crowd. Everyone seemed occupied."
msgstr "Sarah observó cómo Lady Carolyn giraba la cabeza, mirando hacia fuera sobre la multitud. Todos parecían ocupados."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah watched as Lily awkwardly tried to hide her own smile."
msgstr "Sarah observó cómo Lily intentó torpemente ocultar su propia sonrisa."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah watched as Lily walked up next to her, leaning on the balcony."
msgstr "Sarah observó cómo Lily caminaba hacia ella y se apoyaba en la barandilla."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah watched as Lily was called away by one of the soldiers, attending to some task on one of the wagons."
msgstr "Sarah observó cómo Lily era llamada por uno de los soldados para atender alguna tarea en uno de los carros."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah watched as Lord Edmond quickly followed after Queen Maeiv."
msgstr "Sarah observó cómo el señor Edmond se apresuró a seguir a la reina Maeiv."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah watched as Marion casually began to undress himself."
msgstr "Sarah observó cómo Marion comenzó a desnudarse con total casualidad."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah watched as Marion positioned himself opposite of her bed."
msgstr "Sarah observó cómo Marion se colocó frente a su cama."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah watched as Marius greeted almost all of them as they walked through the town."
msgstr "Sarah observó cómo Marius saludaba a casi todos ellos mientras caminaban por el pueblo."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah watched as Marius was speechless."
msgstr "Sarah observó cómo Marius se quedó sin palabras."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah watched as Marshal Edmond walked away in large strides, an entourage of soldiers following in his wake."
msgstr "Sarah observó cómo el mariscal Edmond se alejaba con grandes pasos, seguido por una comitiva de soldados."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah watched as Mary's posture grew tense, stopping her work."
msgstr "Sarah observó cómo la postura de Mary se tensaba, deteniendo su trabajo."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah watched as Matthew threw a pair of rags down at her feet."
msgstr "Sarah observó cómo Matthew arrojaba un par de trapos a sus pies."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah watched as Metis piled more books and reading texts onto her desk."
msgstr "Sarah observó cómo Metis apilaba más libros y textos de lectura sobre su escritorio."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah watched as Metis pulled a key from his pocket and held it up. It seemed similar to her own."
msgstr "Sarah observó cómo Metis sacaba una llave de su bolsillo y la alzaba. Parecía similar a la suya."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah watched as Metis walked away, still laughing at his own remark."
msgstr "Sarah observó cómo Metis se alejaba, aún riéndose de su propia broma."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah watched as Miriam punched her brother."
msgstr "Sarah observó cómo Miriam le dio un puñetazo a su hermano."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah watched as Naydeen began to swam, and she found herself following her."
msgstr "Sarah observó cómo Naydeen comenzó a nadar, y se encontró siguiendo su rastro."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah watched as Naydeen began to swim. Sarah remained, watching her from a distance."
msgstr "Sarah observó mientras Naydeen comenzaba a nadar. Sarah se quedó, mirándola desde lejos."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah watched as Naydeen crawled back to her, resuming her assault on her body."
msgstr "Sarah observó cómo Naydeen se arrastraba de vuelta hacia ella, reanudando su embestida sobre su cuerpo."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah watched as Naydeen leaned back and grabbed something from near the bed."
msgstr "Sarah observó cómo Naydeen se recostaba y agarraba algo cerca de la cama."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah watched as Naydeen swam closer. Her voice softened."
msgstr "Sarah observó cómo Naydeen nadaba más cerca. Su voz se suavizó."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah watched as Nick grabbed two pieces of flint from his pocket."
msgstr "Sarah observó cómo Nick sacó dos pedazos de piedra sílex de su bolsillo."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah watched as Orwen jumped up and grabbed for his father, who quickly pulled him into a wrestling match that the boy had no chance of winning."
msgstr "Sarah observó cómo Orwen saltó y se lanzó contra su padre, quien rápidamente lo arrastró a una lucha en la que el niño no tenía ninguna posibilidad de ganar."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah watched as Queen Maeiv stood up and walked up towards a group of nobles."
msgstr "Sarah observó cómo la reina Maeiv se puso de pie y caminó hacia un grupo de nobles."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah watched as Ramsey took off, heading down into the cellars as he carried two large kegs with no trouble at all."
msgstr "Sarah observó cómo Ramsey se alejó, dirigiéndose hacia los sótanos mientras cargaba dos grandes barriles sin ningún esfuerzo."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah watched as Ramsey walked away."
msgstr "Sarah observó cómo Ramsey se alejaba."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah watched as Razaphel drifted closer towards her, slowly."
msgstr "Sarah observó cómo Razafel se acercaba lentamente."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah watched as Sakar gestured towards a small cluster of trees to the far side."
msgstr "Sarah observó cómo Sakar señalaba un pequeño grupo de árboles al extremo opuesto."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah watched as Sakar leaned down."
msgstr "Sarah observó cómo Sakar se agachó."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah watched as Samayra began to walk across the plaza."
msgstr "Sarah observó cómo Samayra comenzó a caminar por la plaza."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah watched as Samayra collapsed to the floor, falling onto her hands and knees."
msgstr "Sarah observó cómo Samayra se desplomaba en el suelo, cayendo sobre sus manos y rodillas."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah watched as Samayra crawled through the snow, finding her balance again."
msgstr "Sarah observó cómo Samayra arrastraba su cuerpo por la nieve, recuperando el equilibrio."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah watched as Samayra easily matched their speed, her body twisting to the rhythm of the music."
msgstr "Sarah observó cómo Samayra igualaba fácilmente su velocidad, con el cuerpo torciéndose al ritmo de la música."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah watched as Samayra jumped onto the ship."
msgstr "Sarah observó cómo Samayra saltaba al barco."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah watched as Samayra rolled out a blanket and sat down on it."
msgstr "Sarah observó cómo Samayra desenrollaba una manta y se sentaba sobre ella."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah watched as Samayra swam through the water."
msgstr "Sarah observó cómo Samayra nadaba a través del agua."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah watched as Samayra turned her eyes lower, inward."
msgstr "Sarah observó cómo Samayra dirigió su mirada hacia abajo, hacia adentro."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah watched as Samayra was sitting by the fire, still shivering."
msgstr "Sarah observó cómo Samayra se sentaba junto al fuego, aún temblando."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah watched as Samayra waved her hand over a small pile of tinder and twigs that she had gathered."
msgstr "Sarah observó cómo Samayra movía la mano sobre un pequeño montón de mecha y ramitas que había recogido."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah watched as Samayra wordlessly stood up and began to dress herself. Sarah followed after."
msgstr "Sarah observó cómo Samayra se puso de pie en silencio y comenzó a vestirse. La siguió."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah watched as Samayra's eyes went wide."
msgstr "Sarah observó cómo los ojos de Samayra se abrieron de par en par."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah watched as Sigmund leaned back, his head dissapearing into the back of the cart."
msgstr "Sarah observó cómo Sigmund se recostaba, con la cabeza desapareciendo en el fondo del carro."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah watched as Sigmund stormed across the road towards her, getting close up to her face."
msgstr "Sarah observó cómo Sigmund se abalanzaba por el camino hacia ella, acercándose hasta su rostro."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah watched as Sigmund threw a piece of bone into the fire."
msgstr "Sarah observó cómo Sigmund arrojaba un trozo de hueso al fuego."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah watched as Sophia ran away, excitedly, to take to her task."
msgstr "Sarah observó cómo Sophia se alejaba con entusiasmo para emprender su tarea."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah watched as Thomas slammed his fist on the table this time."
msgstr "Sarah observó cómo Thomas golpeó la mesa con el puño esta vez."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah watched as Thomas struggled."
msgstr "Sarah observó cómo Thomas luchaba."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah watched as Thomas was all but dragged into the crowd, hands reaching out for him, hoping to catch a moment to congratulate the new king, and win some favor."
msgstr "Sarah observó cómo a Thomas lo arrastraban casi sin esfuerzo hacia la multitud, con las manos extendidas hacia él, esperando captar un instante para felicitar al nuevo rey y ganar algún favor."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah watched as Tirion walked closer towards the altar."
msgstr "Sarah observó cómo Tirion caminaba hacia el altar."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah watched as Vaelen began to carefully circle around Cassius."
msgstr "Sarah observó cómo Vaelen comenzó a rodear a Cassius con cuidado."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah watched as Vaelen clapped in his hand, signalling something to someone."
msgstr "Sarah observó cómo Vaelen aplaudía con la mano, señalando algo a alguien."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah watched as Vaelen leapt across the space between them."
msgstr "Sarah observó cómo Vaelen saltó el espacio que los separaba."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah watched as Vaelen strode forward, entering the vault."
msgstr "Sarah observó cómo Vaelen avanzaba decidido, entrando en la bóveda."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah watched as Vaelen stroked his chest, the bulge just under his shirt was where he kept the stone from Bagrad."
msgstr "Sarah observó cómo Vaelen acariciaba su pecho, el abultamiento justo debajo de su camisa era donde guardaba la piedra de Bagrad."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah watched as Vaelen walked away."
msgstr "Sarah observó cómo Vaelen se alejaba."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah watched as Varga dropped his hands and instead bared his teeth like fangs."
msgstr "Sarah observó cómo Varga soltó las manos y en su lugar mostró sus dientes como colmillos."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah watched as Varga threw himself up tall, towering over the bed, his hands up like claws."
msgstr "Sarah observó cómo Varga se lanzó hacia arriba con toda su estatura, dominando la cama, con las manos alzadas como garras."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah watched as a Tribesmen tried to jam a dagger into a Knight's armor."
msgstr "Sarah observó cómo un tribu intentó encajar una daga en la armadura de un caballero."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah watched as a large, fat man stumbled into the room."
msgstr "Sarah observó cómo un hombre grande y gordo entró tambaleándose en la habitación."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah watched as a man stood up from the other side of the table."
msgstr "Sarah observó cómo un hombre se levantó del otro lado de la mesa."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah watched as a man with a large gray beard walked up and poured her a glass from his own bottle."
msgstr "Sarah observó cómo un hombre con una gran barba gris se acercó y le sirvió un vaso desde su propia botella."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah watched as a series of people, linked together with a chain, were brought into the room."
msgstr "Sarah observó cómo una serie de personas, encadenadas entre sí, fueron introducidas en la sala."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah watched as a small cadre of soldiers began to move forward."
msgstr "Sarah observó cómo un pequeño grupo de soldados comenzó a avanzar."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah watched as a white substance sprayed forward from the tip of his cock, landing across the mossy forest floor."
msgstr "Sarah observó cómo una sustancia blanca salía disparada desde la punta de su polla, cayendo sobre el suelo del bosque cubierto de musgo."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah watched as an old man stumbled into the room."
msgstr "Sarah observó cómo un anciano tambaleaba hacia la habitación."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah watched as both her son and daughter jumped onto their father and began to punch him with what little strength they had."
msgstr "Sarah observó cómo tanto su hijo como su hija saltaron sobre su padre y comenzaron a golpearlo con toda la poca fuerza que tenían."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah watched as captain Belmont departed the ship, heading towards the marketplace."
msgstr "Sarah observó cómo el capitán Belmont abandonaba el barco, dirigiéndose hacia el mercado."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah watched as captain Belmont took off and she huriedly followed him."
msgstr "Sarah observó cómo el capitán Belmont se alejaba y ella lo siguió con prisa."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah watched as city guards and court officials marched around, paying her little attention."
msgstr "Sarah observó cómo los guardias de la ciudad y los funcionarios del tribunal paseaban por allí, prestando poca atención a ella."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah watched as countless men died."
msgstr "Sarah observó cómo murieron incontables hombres."

