msgid "Sarah's voice grew hoarse as she fucked her increasingly fast."
msgstr "La voz de Sarah se volvió ronca mientras follaba cada vez más rápido."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah's voice had gone quiet. It was slowly dawning on her what she had become."
msgstr "La voz de Sarah se había apagado. Le iba dando cuenta lentamente a qué se había convertido."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah's voice nearly broke as she begged him."
msgstr "La voz de Sarah se rompió casi por completo mientras le suplicaba."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah's voice pounded with magical rage, echoing far and wide throught the massive streets of the city."
msgstr "La voz de Sarah retumbó con furia mágica, resonando a lo largo y ancho de las inmensas calles de la ciudad."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah's voice rang out and all were silenced, their eyes falling on her."
msgstr "La voz de Sarah resonó y todos callaron, cayendo sus ojos sobre ella."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah's voice sounded low and pathetic to her. But for him, she was eager to submit."
msgstr "Su voz sonaba baja y patética para ella. Pero para él, estaba dispuesta a someterse."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah's voice trailed off, fearing almost to speak it."
msgstr "La voz de Sarah se desvaneció, temiendo casi pronunciarla."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah's voice was soft as a whisper."
msgstr "La voz de Sarah era suave como un susurro."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah's voice was soft."
msgstr "La voz de Sarah era suave."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah's whole body was alight with blind desire and pleasure."
msgstr "Todo el cuerpo de Sarah ardía con un deseo ciego y placer."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah's words came hard and fast."
msgstr "Las palabras de Sarah salieron con fuerza y rapidez."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah's words seemed to lift Varga's spirits."
msgstr "Las palabras de Sarah parecían levantar el ánimo de Varga."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah's words were genuine. She was truly happy that it wouldn't come to any bloodshed."
msgstr "Las palabras de Sarah eran sinceras. Era verdaderamente feliz de que no llegara a ningún derramamiento de sangre."

msgctxt "speaker:Atilla"
msgid "Sarah, I had one great love in my life. To have met you and found another, it is more than I could have ever asked for..."
msgstr "Sarah, tuve un gran amor en mi vida. Haberme encontrado a ti y hallar otro es más de lo que jamás pude haber pedido..."

msgctxt "speaker:Varga"
msgid "Sarah, I have to leave. Every part of me wants to stay here, but if they found us..."
msgstr "Sarah, tengo que irme. Cada parte de mí quiere quedarme aquí, pero si nos encuentran..."

msgctxt "speaker:Xanthippe"
msgid "Sarah, I keep telling you this but you're not listening."
msgstr "Sarah, te lo he dicho una y otra vez, pero no me haces caso."

msgctxt "speaker:Judge"
msgid "Sarah, I thought myself dead before I met you."
msgstr "Sarah, creí estar muerto antes de conocerte."

msgctxt "speaker:Sigmund"
msgid "Sarah, I told you that this road gets dangerous the further we get along."
msgstr "Sarah, te lo dije: este camino se vuelve peligroso cuanto más avanzamos."

msgctxt "speaker:Carolyn"
msgid "Sarah, I understand that her story plays on your soft nature."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "speaker:Naydeen"
msgid "Sarah, I understand you have your reservations. It is only natural."
msgstr "Sarah, entiendo que tienes tus reservas. Es completamente natural."

msgctxt "speaker:Cassius"
msgid "Sarah, I urge you, please! When Carolyn offers you our contract, you must take it!"
msgstr "Sarah, te ruego, ¡por favor! Cuando Carolyn te ofrezca nuestro contrato, ¡tienes que aceptarlo!"

msgctxt "speaker:Metis"
msgid "Sarah, I warned you. You're pushing yourself."
msgstr "Sarah, te advertí. Te estás forzando demasiado."

msgctxt "speaker:Vaelen"
msgid "Sarah, I would appreciate if you could keep everything that you saw today private."
msgstr "Sarah, me gustaría que mantuvieras todo lo que viste hoy en privado."

msgctxt "speaker:Nickolas"
msgid "Sarah, I'm not, really."
msgstr "Sarah, no lo estoy, de verdad."

msgctxt "speaker:Kate"
msgid "Sarah, I'm so sorry."
msgstr "Sarah, lo siento tanto."

msgctxt "speaker:Marius"
msgid "Sarah, I-"
msgstr "Sarah, yo—"

msgctxt "speaker:Atilla"
msgid "Sarah, I..."
msgstr "Sarah, yo..."

msgctxt "speaker:Kate"
msgid "Sarah, I...when I heard the screams coming from the throne room, I thought I'd lose you..."
msgstr "Sarah, yo... cuando escuché los gritos que venían de la sala del trono, pensé que te había perdido..."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah, almost hysterical, began bucking against him, wordlessly begging the orc to take her deeper and faster."
msgstr "Sarah, casi histérica, comenzó a empujar contra él, implorando con desesperación que el orco la follara más profundo y más rápido."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah, along with the others, quickly followed."
msgstr "Sarah, junto con los demás, se apresuraron a seguir."

msgctxt "speaker:Mary"
msgid "Sarah, be very quiet."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah, beautiful and young, had captured the interest of a tribesmen soldier some time in the third week."
msgstr "Sarah, hermosa y joven, había captado el interés de un soldado tribu hace algún tiempo en la tercera semana."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Sarah, by the way. Since you forgot to ask before you stuck it in me."
msgstr "Sarah, por cierto. Como te olvidaste de preguntar antes de meterlo en mí."

msgctxt "speaker:Marion"
msgid "Sarah, can I speak with you in your room?"
msgstr "Sarah, ¿puedo hablar contigo en tu habitación?"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah, closer than anyone else, noticed a single tear crawling down the emissary's cheek."
msgstr "Sarah, más cercana que nadie, notó una sola lágrima deslizándose por la mejilla de la emisaria."

msgctxt "speaker:Sakar"
msgid "Sarah, come with me."
msgstr "Sarah, ven conmigo."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah, didn't stop him."
msgstr "Sarah, no lo detuviste."

msgctxt "speaker:Alfred"
msgid "Sarah, dinner please."
msgstr "Sarah, por favor, la cena."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah, distracted, misplaces her foot used in the landing."
msgstr "Sarah, distraída, se equivoca al aterrizar con el pie."

msgctxt "speaker:Hecate"
msgid "Sarah, don't get hysterical now."
msgstr "Sarah, no entres en pánico ahora."

msgctxt "speaker:Metis"
msgid "Sarah, don't push yourself. Remember what I said."
msgstr "Sarah, no te esfuerces tanto. Recuerda lo que dije."

msgctxt "speaker:Samayra"
msgid "Sarah, don't worry."
msgstr "Sarah, no te preocupes."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah, exhausted, collapsed next to him."
msgstr "Sarah, agotada, se desplomó a su lado."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah, feeling caught out, looks away."
msgstr "Sarah, sintiéndose pillada, aparta la mirada."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah, for all of it, endured it."
msgstr "Sarah, por todo ello, lo soportó."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah, for her part, committed herself to the task of stroking the captain to completion."
msgstr "Sarah, por su parte, se entregó a la tarea de acariciar al capitán hasta el final."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah, for her part, committed herself to the task. As she masturbated him, she listened to the sounds he made, the movements of his body."
msgstr "Sarah, por su parte, se entregó a la tarea. Mientras lo excitaba con sus dedos, escuchaba los sonidos que él emitía y los movimientos de su cuerpo."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah, for her part, focussed on her own footwork."
msgstr "Sarah, por su parte, se centró en su propio trabajo con los pies."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah, for her part, found it impossible to look away from Kate."
msgstr "Sarah, por su parte, no pudo apartar la mirada de Kate."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah, for her part, leans back into Kate, letting her continue going down on her."
msgstr "Sarah, por su parte, se recuesta contra Kate, dejándola continuar bajando por ella."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah, for her part, simply walked about the house, inspecting it."
msgstr "Por su parte, Sarah simplemente caminaba por la casa, inspeccionándola."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah, for her part, spoke it half veiled truths, trying to be as honest as she could be with him."
msgstr "Sarah, por su parte, lo dijo a medias, tratando de ser tan honesta con él como pudo."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah, for her part, still felt every nerve in her body."
msgstr "Sarah, por su parte, aún sentía cada nervio de su cuerpo."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah, for her part, tried as best as she could to keep up with both of them."
msgstr "Sarah, por su parte, hizo todo lo posible para seguir el ritmo de los dos."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah, for her part, was eager to oblige."
msgstr "Sarah, por su parte, estaba ansiosa por complacer."

msgctxt "speaker:Xanthippe"
msgid "Sarah, get back!"
msgstr "¡Sarah, vuelve!"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah, grasped at her new lease on life and leapt up to her feet."
msgstr "Sarah, agarró su nueva oportunidad de vida y saltó de pie."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah, having made her point, shook off the fire."
msgstr "Sarah, tras haber hecho su punto, se sacudió el fuego."

msgctxt "speaker:Kravel"
msgid "Sarah, he seeks to bait you."
msgstr "Sarah, él busca pescarte."

msgctxt "speaker:Daemon"
msgid "Sarah, here."
msgstr "Sarah, aquí."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah, however, had discovered that with surrender, there also came a certain kind of release."
msgstr "Sin embargo, Sarah había descubierto que con la rendición también venía cierto tipo de liberación."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah, if only to not embarrass the man, accepts and puts on the cloak."
msgstr "Sarah, por lo menos para no avergonzar al hombre, acepta y se pone la capa."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah, in a numbed state, stumbled out from behind the feasting table, onto the main stage."
msgstr "Adormecida, Sarah tambaleó desde detrás de la mesa del banquete hasta el escenario principal."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah, in turn, began to weave her magical wards and barriers."
msgstr "Sarah, a su vez, comenzó a tejer sus barreras mágicas y defensas."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah, instinctively, pulls herself physically away from Kate."
msgstr "Sarah, instintivamente, se aparta físicamente de Kate."

msgctxt "speaker:Jaeid"
msgid "Sarah, it was not your fault, but you were right to speak to me about it."
msgstr "Sarah, no fue tu culpa, pero tuviste toda la razón al hablármelo."

msgctxt "speaker:Xanthippe"
msgid "Sarah, it won't be like you remember it. The horde has ravaged the country...the capital..."
msgstr "Sarah, no será como te lo recuerdas. La horda ha asolado el país... la capital..."

msgctxt "speaker:Kate"
msgid "Sarah, it's me."
msgstr "Sarah, soy yo."

msgctxt "speaker:Varga"
msgid "Sarah, it's me."
msgstr "Sarah, soy yo."

msgctxt "speaker:Hecate"
msgid "Sarah, look out!!!"
msgstr "¡Sarah, mira hacia afuera!!!"

msgctxt "speaker:Hecate"
msgid "Sarah, me and Gabriel will need to make use of Xan's house."
msgstr "Sarah, Gabriel y yo necesitaremos usar la casa de Xan."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah, near the vanguard of her army, was one of the first to cross over the hill."
msgstr "Sarah, al vanguardia de su ejército, fue una de las primeras en cruzar la colina."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Sarah, nice to meet you."
msgstr "Sarah, un placer conocerte."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah, not knowing what to say, opted to say nothing."
msgstr "Sarah, sin saber qué decir, optó por no decir nada."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah, noticing where the night was leading, and full of liquid courage, took charge. She held the wine bottle up high."
msgstr "Sarah, al notar hacia dónde iba la noche y llena de valentía líquida, tomó el mando. Elevó la botella de vino en alto."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah, now with some measure of practice and instruction by Mary, had come to manage such tasks."
msgstr "Sarah, ahora con cierta práctica y la instrucción de Mary, había llegado a manejar tales tareas."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah, on hands and knees, crawled after him."
msgstr "Sarah, a cuatro patas, se arrastró tras él."

msgctxt "speaker:Kate"
msgid "Sarah, please, come with me."
msgstr "Sarah, por favor, ven conmigo."

msgctxt "speaker:Thomas"
msgid "Sarah, please..."
msgstr "Sarah, por favor..."

msgctxt "speaker:Jaeid"
msgid "Sarah, promise me that you will not speak of that to him."
msgstr "Sarah, prométeme que no hablarás de eso con él."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah, seeing her moment, leapt out from behind Hecate's barrier."
msgstr "Sarah, al ver su momento, saltó desde detrás del escudo de Hecate."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah, so distracted by Samayra's sudden bright smile, found herself startled."
msgstr "Sarah, tan distraída por la repentina sonrisa brillante de Samayra, se encontró sobresaltada."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah, speaking no words, reached out with her hands and one of the elder women delivered her child to her."
msgstr "Sarah, sin pronunciar palabra, extendió las manos y una de las ancianas le entregó su hijo."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah, standing over Kate, dropped to her knees, pinning Kate between her legs, sitting on top of her stomach."
msgstr "Sarah, de pie sobre Kate, se arrodilló y la sujetó entre sus piernas, sentándose encima de su vientre."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah, still laying on the ground, looked up, loudly panting in the aftermath of her climax."
msgstr "Sarah, aún tendida en el suelo, miró hacia arriba jadeando fuerte después de su orgasmo."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah, still scared, looked up and studied the room."
msgstr "Sarah, aún asustada, miró hacia arriba y examinó la habitación."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah, still waking, slightly nodded."
msgstr "Sarah, aún despierta, asintió ligeramente."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah, still wrapping her arms around Kate, could feel Kate's shoulder begin to rock."
msgstr "Sarah, todavía con los brazos envueltos alrededor de Kate, podía sentir cómo el hombro de Kate comenzaba a moverse."

msgctxt "speaker:Metis"
msgid "Sarah, stop!"
msgstr "¡Sarah, para!"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah, surprised, dropped the training equipment, letting it scatter onto the floor."
msgstr "Sarah, sorprendida, dejó caer el equipo de entrenamiento, dejándolo esparcirse por el suelo."

msgctxt "speaker:Kravel"
msgid "Sarah, the message is...it's not the concern."
msgstr "Sarah, el mensaje es... no es la preocupación."

msgctxt "speaker:Varga"
msgid "Sarah, the units from the furthest provinces have arrived today."
msgstr "Sarah, las unidades de las provincias más lejanas han llegado hoy."

msgctxt "speaker:Varga"
msgid "Sarah, there's so much work..."
msgstr "Sarah, hay tanto trabajo..."

msgctxt "speaker:Atilla"
msgid "Sarah, they will curse you behind your back. Their insults will undermine you, even as they smile to your face, they-"
msgstr "Sarah, te maldirán por la espalda. Sus insultos minarán tu autoridad; aunque sonrían a tu cara, ellos-"

msgctxt "speaker:Vaelen"
msgid "Sarah, this isn't about stealing some chests of gold from an old family vault."
msgstr "Sarah, esto no se trata de robar algunas cajas de oro de un viejo cofre familiar."

msgctxt "speaker:Sigmund"
msgid "Sarah, this man here is Sakar. He's a mean bastard, so just try to ignore whatever shit comes out of his mouth."
msgstr "Sarah, este hombre es Sakar. Es un maldito bastardo, así que intenta ignorar todo lo que salga de su boca."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah, together with her commanders and officers had spend weeks coming up with a strategy."
msgstr "Sarah, junto con sus comandantes y oficiales, había pasado semanas elaborando una estrategia."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah, too exhausted to take part in the celebrations, returned to her bedroom and fell into a deep, restful sleep."
msgstr "Sarah, demasiado agotada para participar en las celebraciones, regresó a su dormitorio y cayó en un sueño profundo y reparador."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah, too stunned to look away at the sudden transformation, kept her eyes locked on Lady Carolyn."
msgstr "Sarah, demasiado aturdida para apartar la vista ante la transformación repentina, mantuvo los ojos clavados en Lady Carolyn."

msgctxt "speaker:Kate"
msgid "Sarah, wait!"
msgstr "Sarah, espera!"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah, waiting for the moment, lunged forward."
msgstr "Sarah, esperando el momento, se lanzó hacia adelante."

msgctxt "speaker:Dalia"
msgid "Sarah, was it?"
msgstr "¿Sarah? ¿Es eso?"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah, watching her brother slowly sink into his seat, decided to intervene."
msgstr "Sarah, al ver cómo su hermano se hundía lentamente en la silla, decidió intervenir."

msgctxt "speaker:Xanthippe"
msgid "Sarah, we can't go around saving everyone! It's not our place, and it's not what is meant to happen."
msgstr "Sarah, no podemos ir deambulando salvando a todo el mundo. No es nuestro lugar y no es lo que está destinado a suceder."

msgctxt "speaker:Nickolas"
msgid "Sarah, we got some time till the next shift. Why don't we warm up together under the blanket?"
msgstr "Sarah, tenemos tiempo hasta el próximo turno. ¿Por qué no nos calentamos juntos debajo de la manta?"

msgctxt "speaker:Xanthippe"
msgid "Sarah, we need to leave, now!"
msgstr "Sarah, tenemos que irnos, ¡ya!"

msgctxt "speaker:Nickolas"
msgid "Sarah, we need to-"
msgstr "Sarah, necesitamos..."

msgctxt "speaker:Jaeid"
msgid "Sarah, we've arrived."
msgstr "Sarah, hemos llegado."

msgctxt "speaker:The Official"
msgid "Sarah, what?"
msgstr "¿Qué pasa, Sarah?"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah, with little else to do, found herself following him."
msgstr "Sin otra cosa que hacer, Sarah se encontró siguiendo a él."

msgctxt "speaker:Oryon"
msgid "Sarah, within a little more than a hundred years, every man or woman alive today, will have died of old age."
msgstr "Sarah, dentro de poco más de cien años, cada hombre o mujer que vive hoy habrá muerto de vejez."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah, wordlessly, nodded."
msgstr "Sarah asintió en silencio."

msgctxt "speaker:Kim"
msgid "Sarah, you can't go through life with that naive attitude."
msgstr "Sarah, no puedes vivir con esa actitud ingenua."

msgctxt "speaker:Sigmund"
msgid "Sarah, you don't have to do this."
msgstr "Sarah, no tienes que hacer esto."

msgctxt "speaker:Kate"
msgid "Sarah, you don't know what you're doing."
msgstr "Sarah, no sabes lo que haces."

msgctxt "speaker:Thomas"
msgid "Sarah, you know that officially, you need my blessing for the marriage."
msgstr "Sarah, sabes que oficialmente necesitas mi bendición para el matrimonio."

msgctxt "speaker:Duke Antonio"
msgid "Sarah, you must be aware that Medini has the smallest army out of all the kingdoms?"
msgstr "Sarah, ¿debes ser consciente de que Medini tiene el ejército más pequeño de todos los reinos?"

msgctxt "speaker:Kate"
msgid "Sarah, you need to come with me, to Lethram. It's the only place where we can keep you safe. But, we need to leave tonight, right now. There is a ship waiting for us in the harbor."
msgstr "Sarah, tienes que venir conmigo, a Lethram. Es el único lugar donde podemos mantenerte a salvo. Pero, tenemos que irnos esta noche, ya mismo. Hay un barco esperándonos en el puerto."

msgctxt "speaker:Court Official"
msgid "Sarah, you stand charged with grand theft and participation in a criminal organization."
msgstr "Sarah, te acusamos de robo agravado y participación en una organización criminal."

msgctxt "speaker:Raza"
msgid "Sarah, you wake!"
msgstr "Sarah, ¡despierta!"

msgctxt "speaker:Marius"
msgid "Sarah, you're amazing!"
msgstr "¡Sarah, eres increíble!"

msgctxt "speaker:Cassius"
msgid "Sarah-from-far-away."
msgstr "Sarah... lejana."

msgctxt "speaker:Alfred"
msgid "Sarah."
msgstr ""

