msgid "Sarah. I'm the head of the mercenary company."
msgstr "Sarah. Soy la jefa de la compañía mercenaria."

msgctxt "speaker:Dalia"
msgid "Sarah. That's a nice name."
msgstr "Sarah. Es un nombre bonito."

msgctxt "speaker:Varga"
msgid "Sarah. You know that I would do anything for you, that I would do anything to keep you safe."
msgstr "Sarah. Sabes que haría cualquier cosa por ti, que haría cualquier cosa para mantenerte a salvo."

msgctxt "speaker:Varga"
