msgstr "Suspiró aliviada."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "She sighed and walked over to the office in the back."
msgstr "Suspiró y se acercó a la oficina del fondo."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "She sighed and went back to work."
msgstr "Suspiró y volvió a trabajar."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
