msgstr "El dolor en su culo era un nuevo y diferente tipo de dolor, uno que parecía quemar profundo y resonar por todo su cuerpo inferior."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The pain in her body is everywhere, but Sarah keeps going, and she know she'll drag Nick along if she has to."
msgstr "El dolor en su cuerpo está en todas partes, pero Sarah sigue adelante y sabe que arrastrará a Nick si es necesario."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The pain in her limbs grew, and in time, she even lost any other sense of her limbs. There was only that pain and that pleasure."
