msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The peace of the open ocean stood in sharp contrast to the slaughter they had only just escaped."
msgstr "La paz del océano abierto contrastaba con la masacre que acababan de escapar."

msgctxt "speaker:Varga"
msgid "The peace returned, but nobody could really forgive me for what I had done. They'd never say anything, but you could see it in their eyes."
msgstr "La paz regresó, pero nadie podía perdonarme realmente por lo que había hecho. Nunca dirían nada, pero se notaba en sus ojos."

msgctxt "speaker:Atilla"
