msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Usually, out on the road, such repairs were a small matter."
msgstr "Normalmente, en la carretera, tales reparaciones eran un asunto menor."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Usually, she would have spoken with Thomas, but he was gone now."
msgstr "Normalmente, habría hablado con Thomas, pero ya no estaba."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Usually, she would have."
msgstr "Normalmente, lo habría hecho."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Usually, the castle was filled with life, a coming and going of nobles and commoners, each with their own reason for seeking an audience."
msgstr "Normalmente, el castillo estaba lleno de vida, con la entrada y salida de nobles y plebeyos, cada uno con su propia razón para buscar una audiencia."

msgctxt "speaker:Garret"
msgid "Usually, the tracks we find are a bit up ahead, but we won't find anything tonight. Best we stay to camp."
msgstr "Normalmente, las huellas que encontramos están un poco más adelante, pero no encontraremos nada esta noche. Lo mejor es acampar."

msgctxt "speaker-name"
msgid "Vaelen"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen and Cassius drew into a fighting stance, raising up their weapons."
msgstr "Vaelen y Cassius adoptaron una postura de combate, alzando sus armas."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen breathed out only blood; his broken head spilling something more of himself."
msgstr "Vaelen solo exhaló sangre; su cabeza rota derramando algo más de sí mismo."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen continued his pace, leading her further along the halls of the western wing, down towards the far side."
msgstr "Vaelen continuó su paso, llevándola más lejos por los pasillos del ala oeste, hacia el extremo lejano."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen didn't answer her."
msgstr "Vaelen no le respondió."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen didn't turn to face her, continuing to stare into the distance."
msgstr "Vaelen no se giró para mirarla, siguió mirando al horizonte."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen embraces Sarah."
msgstr "Vaelen abraza a Sarah."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen frowned."
msgstr "Vaelen frunció el ceño."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen gestured at her."
msgstr "Vaelen señaló hacia ella."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen gestured out ahead. He didn't need to say much more."
msgstr "Vaelen señaló hacia adelante. No necesitaba decir nada más."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen gestured towards a lamp that hung besides the door."
msgstr "Vaelen señaló hacia una lámpara que colgaba junto a la puerta."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen gestured."
msgstr "Vaelen señaló."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen gestures at Kate."
msgstr "Vaelen señala a Kate."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen glared at her."
msgstr "Vaelen la fulminó con la mirada."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen glared at the both of them."
msgstr "Vaelen los miró con odio."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen greeted her."
msgstr "Vaelen la saludó."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen had been born in the Mythran Southlands. Poor, inhospitable and impoverished."
msgstr "Vaelen había nacido en los Surlands de Mythra. Pobre, inhóspita y desvalida."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Vaelen had called an early meeting, there's a change in plans."
msgstr "Vaelen convocó una reunión anticipada; hay un cambio en los planes."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen had given Sarah some rough schematics to study, showing the quickest route to the palace, but little more than that."
msgstr "Vaelen le entregó a Sarah algunos esquemas toscos para estudiar, que mostraban la ruta más rápida hacia el palacio, pero poco más que eso."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen had ordered a last meeting before the attack on the city."
msgstr "Vaelen ordenó una última reunión antes del ataque a la ciudad."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Vaelen he was...being an asshole."
msgstr "Vaelen, él era... un cabrón."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Vaelen he...meant a lot to you. He meant a lot to me too. You shouldn't be so hasty to close off your heart."
msgstr "Vaelen... significó mucho para ti. También significó mucho para mí. No deberías ser tan precipitada en cerrar tu corazón."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen held up Sarah's contract."
msgstr "Vaelen levantó el contrato de Sarah."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen kneeled next to her."
msgstr "Vaelen se arrodilló a su lado."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen knew her position on the cruelty of war."
msgstr "Vaelen conocía su postura sobre la crueldad de la guerra."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen laughed."
msgstr "Vaelen rió."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen laughs."
msgstr "Vaelen ríe."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen leaned back into his chair, his hand stroked his chin."
msgstr "Vaelen se recostó en su silla y acarició su mentón."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen leaned forward and sprawled out a map in front of Sarah."
msgstr "Vaelen se inclinó hacia adelante y extendió un mapa frente a Sarah."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen looked around, studying the construction."
msgstr "Vaelen miró alrededor, estudiando la construcción."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen looked up from his desk."
msgstr "Vaelen levantó la vista de su escritorio."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen looks at Sarah. She sees an odd mixture of surprise and sadness in his eyes."
msgstr "Vaelen mira a Sarah. Ella ve una extraña mezcla de sorpresa y tristeza en sus ojos."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen loved being up on the stage, to hear himself talk. Sarah hated almost every moment of it."
msgstr "Vaelen amaba estar en el escenario, escuchándose a sí mismo hablar. Sarah odiaba casi cada momento de eso."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen lunged, swiping his blade at her wildly."
msgstr "Vaelen se abalanzó, sacudiendo su espada con furia hacia ella."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen muttered something in stunned disbelief."
msgstr "Vaelen murmuró algo con estupefacción."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen never asked her what it was. Perhaps he didn't care, perhaps he understood she didn't feel like telling him."
msgstr "Vaelen nunca le preguntó qué era. Quizás no le importaba, quizás entendía que no tenía ganas de decírselo."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen nodded as his eyes remained transfixed on the stone."
msgstr "Vaelen asintió mientras sus ojos permanecían clavados en la piedra."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen nodded."
msgstr "Vaelen asintió."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen paused before answering."
msgstr "Vaelen se detuvo antes de responder."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen paused for a moment, before nodding."
msgstr "Vaelen se detuvo un momento antes de asentir."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen paused for a moment, considering his words."
msgstr "Vaelen se detuvo un momento, sopesando sus palabras."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen paused for a moment."
msgstr "Vaelen se detuvo un momento."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen placed his finger on a small dot on the map, further east than even Bagrad."
msgstr "Vaelen colocó su dedo en un pequeño punto del mapa, más al este incluso que Bagrad."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen pointed directly at Sarah."
msgstr "Vaelen señaló directamente a Sarah."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen pointed his finger angrily towards Gideon."
msgstr "Vaelen apuntó furioso a Gideon."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen pulled a torch from the wall and held it up, leading the way."
msgstr "Vaelen sacó una antorcha de la pared y la levantó, abriendo el camino."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen pulled his sword from the earth."
msgstr "Vaelen sacó su espada de la tierra."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen pushed a sheet of paper from his desk towards Sarah."
msgstr "Vaelen empujó una hoja de papel desde su escritorio hacia Sarah."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen quickly continued to another topic, but Sarah continued to observe him and weigh his words."
msgstr "Vaelen pasó rápidamente a otro tema, pero Sarah siguió observándolo y ponderando sus palabras."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen raised himself up."
msgstr "Vaelen se levantó."

msgctxt "speaker:Kate"
msgid "Vaelen ran him through with his sword, over nothing!"
msgstr "¡Vaelen lo atravesó con su espada, sobre nada!"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen rasped his knuckles across the desk."
msgstr "Vaelen frotó sus nudillos contra el escritorio con un sonido áspero."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen rolled the map up again."
msgstr "Vaelen enrolló el mapa de nuevo."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen rubbed his temples."
msgstr "Vaelen se frotó las sienes."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen rushed towards Cassius who had his back turned to him."
msgstr "Vaelen se abalanzó hacia Cassius, quien tenía la espalda vuelta."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen sat up straight."
msgstr "Vaelen se sentó derecho."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen scratched his neck, trying to ward off the unrelenting heat of the desert."
msgstr "Vaelen se rascó el cuello, intentando alejar el calor implacable del desierto."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen seized the chain and held the woman in her place."
msgstr "Vaelen agarró la cadena y mantuvo a la mujer en su sitio."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen shook his head."
msgstr "Vaelen negó con la cabeza."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen shrugged."
msgstr "Vaelen encogió los hombros."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen sighed."
msgstr "Vaelen suspiró."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen slammed his fist against the table."
msgstr "Vaelen golpeó el puño contra la mesa."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen smiled, but he seemed without joy."
msgstr "Vaelen sonrió, pero parecía sin alegría."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen smiled."
msgstr "Vaelen sonrió."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen snapped his finger at the soldier."
msgstr "Vaelen chasqueó los dedos al soldado."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen spat on the ground near Cassius."
msgstr "Vaelen escupió en el suelo cerca de Cassius."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen started to walk, motioning for her to keep up."
msgstr "Vaelen comenzó a caminar, señalándola para que lo siguiera."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen stood up and walked to the other side of the desk. He placed a hand on Sarah's shoulder."
msgstr "Vaelen se levantó y caminó hacia el otro lado del escritorio. Colocó una mano en el hombro de Sarah."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen stood up, walked around the table and grabbed Sarah by the shoulders."
msgstr "Vaelen se levantó, cruzó la mesa y agarró a Sarah por los hombros."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen stormed past them."
msgstr "Vaelen pasó corriendo entre ellos."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen suddenly looked up."
msgstr "Vaelen miró de repente hacia arriba."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen tapped the map on his desk."
msgstr "Vaelen tocó el mapa sobre su escritorio."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen threw up his hands."
msgstr "Vaelen levantó las manos."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen thrusted his sword, spun and swiped at her, lunged."
msgstr "Vaelen empujó su espada, giró y le asestó un tajo, se lanzó."

msgctxt "speaker:Camp Guard"
msgid "Vaelen told me himself, keep the blonde girl in the pretty dress from leaving."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen took Sarah's hand and pulled her to her feet."
msgstr "Vaelen tomó la mano de Sarah y la levantó."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen turned a corner, following him, Sarah suddenly found the room expanding in a every direction."
msgstr "Vaelen dio la vuelta a una esquina, siguiéndolo, y de repente Sarah descubrió que la habitación se expandía en todas las direcciones."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen turned specifically towards Sarah."
msgstr "Vaelen giró específicamente hacia Sarah."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen turned to Cassius."
msgstr "Vaelen se volvió hacia Cásio."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen turned to face her."
msgstr "Vaelen se giró para mirarla."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen turned to her."
msgstr "Vaelen se volvió hacia ella."

msgctxt "speaker:Kate"
msgid "Vaelen wants to speak to you."
msgstr "Vaelen quiere hablar contigo."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen was a skill fighter in his own right. Not the greatst that the army had ever since, but certainly better than most."
msgstr "Vaelen era un luchador hábil por derecho propio. No el mejor que jamás haya tenido el ejército, pero ciertamente superior a la mayoría."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen was hunched over his map, not bothering to even look at her."
msgstr "Vaelen estaba encorvado sobre su mapa, sin molestarse siquiera en mirarla."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen was quiet, as if this was supposed to mean something to Sarah."
msgstr "Vaelen estaba en silencio, como si esto fuera a significar algo para Sarah."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen was sitting behind his desk, papers strewn about."
msgstr "Vaelen estaba sentado detrás de su escritorio, con papeles esparcidos por todos lados."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen waved his hand, dismissing the concern."
msgstr "Vaelen movió la mano, desechando la preocupación."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen went over the strategy for the attack. The Mythran army would lead the main charge, and the Brothers of Providence would seize the walls and take small positions inside the city."
msgstr "Vaelen repasó la estrategia del ataque. El ejército de Mythra lideraría el asalto principal, y los Hermanos de la Providencia tomarían las murallas y ocuparán posiciones pequeñas dentro de la ciudad."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Vaelen!"
msgstr "¡Vaelen!"

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Vaelen! Wait!"
msgstr "¡Vaelen! Espera!"

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Vaelen!!!"
msgstr "¡Vaelen!!!"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen's behavior ever since Bagrad had troubled her."
msgstr "El comportamiento de Vaelen desde que Bagrad la había inquietado."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen's blade slid of Sarah's, and she ducked underneath his arm."
msgstr "La navaja de Vaelen se deslizo de la de Sarah, y ella se agachó debajo de su brazo."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen's blood curdled scream followed."
msgstr "El grito desgarrador de Vaelen siguió."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen's broken arms fell besides him. There were no more tricks. No more words to be had."
msgstr "Los brazos rotos de Vaelen cayeron a su lado. No quedaban más trucos. No había más palabras que decir."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen's closed fist opened and a rush of sand flew up towards Sarah's eyes."
msgstr "El puño cerrado de Vaelen se abrió y una ráfaga de arena voló hacia los ojos de Sarah."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen's death had brought her little joy. She had never wanted him to die, but he had been obsessed. Maddened."
msgstr "La muerte de Vaelen no le había traído gran alegría. Nunca lo hubiera deseado, pero estaba obsesionado. Desquiciado."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen's face is contorted with a maddened expression."
msgstr "El rostro de Vaelen está contorsionado con una expresión desquiciada."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen's face was a ruin."
msgstr "El rostro de Vaelen era una ruina."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen's hair was black, nearing on ink. He wore it short, the kind popular with soldiers. When his eyes fixed on Sarah, she felt herself pinned to the ground."
msgstr "El cabello de Vaelen era negro, casi tinta. Lo llevaba corto, al estilo popular entre los soldados. Cuando sus ojos se clavaron en Sarah, ella sintió cómo la sujetaban contra el suelo."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen's pen flashes across a series of documents, applying his signature."
msgstr "La pluma de Vaelen se mueve rápidamente sobre una serie de documentos, aplicando su firma."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen's strategies were usually conservative, avoiding any risk he could."
msgstr "Las estrategias de Vaelen solían ser conservadoras, evitando cualquier riesgo que pudiera correr."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen's voice cracked and broke as he screamed."
msgstr "La voz de Vaelen se quebró y estalló en un grito."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen's voice was the kind that could bring a room to silence, a natural easy authority that seemed obvious to both the speaker and the listener."
msgstr "La voz de Vaelen era el tipo que podía reducir a silencio una habitación, una autoridad natural y fácil que parecía obvia tanto para quien hablaba como para quien escuchaba."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen, herself, Gideon and the others."
msgstr "Vaelen, ella misma, Gideon y los demás."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Vaelen, if we get off course, we could die out there."
msgstr "Vaelen, si nos desviamos del rumbo, podríamos morir ahí afuera."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Vaelen, you're not acting like yourself."
msgstr "Vaelen, no te portas como tú misma."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Vaelen..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "speaker:Kate"
msgid "Vaelen...he gave me a purpose, made my life have meaning. He never said shit about being happy."
msgstr "Vaelen... él me dio un propósito, hizo que mi vida tuviera sentido. Nunca dijo nada sobre ser feliz."

msgctxt "speaker:Kate"
msgid "Vaelen...he was the first man that ever looked at me and...really saw me. Someone who asked and wondered what I wanted from life."
msgstr "Vaelen... él fue el primer hombre que jamás me miró y... realmente me vio. Alguien que preguntaba y se inquietaba por lo que yo quería de la vida."

msgctxt "speaker:Carolyn"
msgid "Vaelen...was it?"
msgstr "¿Vaelen... era eso?"

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Vaelen?"
msgstr "¿Vaelen?"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaguely, from the corner of her eyes, Sarah registered Dalia looking at her."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaguely, she could feel her body."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Varag shook his head."
msgstr "Varag sacudió la cabeza."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Varany. The first city, as it had been known."
msgstr "Varany. La primera ciudad, como se la había conocido."

msgctxt "speaker:Metis"
msgid "Varany. The oldest city."
msgstr "Varany. La ciudad más antigua."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Varany. The oldest city. The first city of Men, before the world had collapsed by the incursion of the world beyond."
msgstr "Varany. La ciudad más antigua. El primer asentamiento de los hombres, antes de que el mundo colapsara por la incursión del mundo exterior."

msgctxt "speaker-name"
msgid "Varga"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Varga agreed."
msgstr "Varga aceptó."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Varga also turned himself to Thomas."
msgstr "Varga también se volvió hacia Thomas."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Varga and Marion came up as well. All around them, soldiers were spilling into the castle."
msgstr "Varga y Marion también llegaron. Por todas partes, soldados se colaban en el castillo."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Varga and his family, they had made her completely forget to play politics."
msgstr "Varga y su familia la habían hecho olvidar por completo el arte de la política."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Varga bowed as he entered, in that slightly fumbling way which only endeared him to Sarah."
msgstr "Varga se inclinó al entrar, con esa torpeza cohibida que solo le gustaba a Sarah."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Varga bowed his head."
msgstr "Varga inclinó la cabeza."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Varga bowed, turned, and began to walk away, a purpose to his stride."
msgstr "Varga se inclinó, giró y comenzó a alejarse con paso decidido."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Varga bowed."
msgstr "Varga se inclinó."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Varga came up close to Sarah. She saw he was already holding a flagon of beer."
msgstr "Varga se acercó a Sarah. Ella vio que ya sostenía un jarro de cerveza."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Varga caught himself."
msgstr "Varga se detuvo."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Varga chuckled."
msgstr "Varga carrasqueó con risa."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Varga clarified."
msgstr "Varga aclaró."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Varga cleared his throat."
msgstr "Varga se aclaró la garganta."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Varga clumsily took his new wife by the shoulders and pulled her in closer, pressing his lips against hers."
msgstr "Varga tomó torpemente a su nueva esposa por los hombros y la arrastró hacia sí, presionando sus labios contra los suyos."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Varga collapsed into her arms and began throwing off his coat."
msgstr "Varga se desplomó en sus brazos y comenzó a quitarse la chaqueta."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Varga crawled off the bed and began to put his clothes back on."
msgstr "Varga se arrastró de la cama y comenzó a volver a ponerse su ropa."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Varga crawled up the bed, ending up between Sarah's legs, looking down at her as he loomed over her."
msgstr "Varga se arrastró hacia la cama, acabando entre las piernas de Sarah, mirándola desde arriba mientras se inclinaba sobre ella."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Varga embraced her as they turned to leave."
msgstr "Varga la abrazó mientras se giraban para irse."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Varga folded up his map."
msgstr "Varga dobló su mapa."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Varga fumbled at the clasps on Sarah's dress, trying his best to undo them."
msgstr "Varga se afanó en los broches del vestido de Sarah, intentando con todas sus fuerzas desabrocharlos."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Varga gets up and walks over, falling down in the bed next to her."
msgstr "Varga se levanta y se acerca, cayendo en la cama a su lado."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Varga grabbed her hand."
msgstr "Varga agarró su mano."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Varga grunted the words as he seized her breast with one hand, pushing another in between her legs."
msgstr "Varga gruñó las palabras mientras agarraba su pecho con una mano y empujaba otra entre sus piernas."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Varga had been another option, but she had avoided him since sending him away from her room."
msgstr "Varga había sido otra opción, pero la había evitado desde que lo mandó fuera de su habitación."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Varga had issued the order to fire a first volley of arrows. In unison, all of the archers atop the wall drew back their bows and released a wave of arrows."
msgstr "Varga había dado la orden de disparar un primer salvo de flechas. Al unísono, todos los arqueros situados en lo alto del muro tensaron sus arcos y soltaron una oleada de flechas."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Varga had said it very matter-of-factly."
msgstr "Varga lo había dicho con total naturalidad."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Varga had taken his hand off his sword and was leaning back into his chair."
msgstr "Varga había retirado su mano de la espada y se recostaba en su silla."

