msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Whatever else, Belmont seemed to enjoy a certain status in this place."
msgstr "En todo caso, Belmont parecía disfrutar de cierto estatus en este lugar."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Whatever else, she didn't deserve a fate that cruel, not after all she'd been through."
msgstr "De todas formas, no merecía un destino tan cruel, después de todo lo que había pasado."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Whatever else, she had learned never to underestimate these creatures again."
msgstr "En cualquier caso, había aprendido a no subestimar jamás a estas criaturas."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Whatever else, she was still alive, she imagined."
msgstr "De todas formas, seguía viva, pensó."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Whatever else, that made him valuable to her."
msgstr "De cualquier modo, eso lo hacía valioso para ella."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Whatever fear she had that he might dissapoint was washed away."
msgstr "Cualquier miedo que pudiera tener de que él la decepcionara se disipó."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Whatever foul mood she had, turned fouler still."
msgstr "Por más mal humor que tuviera, se tornó aún peor."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Whatever fun she imagined to have been having, quickly soured. She began to feel bad."
msgstr "Todo el placer que imaginaba haber tenido se arruinó rápidamente. Comenzó a sentirse mal."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Whatever had happened here all those years ago, this was different. She wanted this."
msgstr "Lo que haya ocurrido aquí hace tantos años, esto era diferente. Ella quería eso."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Whatever happened that night was...not something to repeat."
msgstr "Lo que ocurrió esa noche fue... algo que no se debe repetir."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
