msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Whatever he had been researching back then, she didn't have a clue."
msgstr "De todo lo que él había estado investigando en aquel entonces, ella no tenía la menor idea."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Whatever he had said, it appeared to have angered the orc, who stormed off."
msgstr "Lo que él hubiera dicho pareció haber enfurecido al orco, quien se marchó furioso."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Whatever held him up, if anything, Sarah couldn't see."
msgstr "No podía ver qué lo detenía, si es que había algo."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Whatever her hopes or dreams had been, Sarah knew for certain that this was not one of them."
msgstr "Sea lo que fueran sus esperanzas o sueños, Sarah sabía con certeza que esto no era uno de ellos."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Whatever hesitation existed had died out long ago. Each was fully set to the marriage."
msgstr "Cualquier duda que hubiera existido había muerto hace mucho tiempo. Cada uno estaba plenamente decidido al matrimonio."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Whatever his intentions were, the wine was good, and at the very least he was the distraction she had come looking for."
msgstr "Sea cual fuera su intención, el vino era bueno y, al menos, él era la distracción que había buscado."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Whatever his purpose here was, Sarah could hardly begin to speculate."
