msgctxt "speaker-name"
msgid "Woodland Spirit"
msgstr "Espíritu del Bosque"

msgctxt "speaker:Samayra"
msgid "Wooo!"
msgstr "¡Wooo!"

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Wooo!"
msgstr "¡Wooo!"

msgctxt "speaker:Samayra"
msgid "Wooooow..."
msgstr "Woooow..."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Wordlessly, Sarah spread her legs willingly for him, letting him know that she would let him have it."
msgstr "En silencio, Sarah separó las piernas sin resistencia para él, dejándole saber que le permitiría hacerlo."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Wordlessly, each found the other's rhythm."
msgstr "En silencio, cada uno encontró el ritmo del otro."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Wordlessly, he understood."
msgstr "En silencio, lo entendió."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Wordlessly, she asked Sarah with her eyes to keep her safe and guide her through the moment, and wordlessly Sarah comforted her."
msgstr "Sin palabras, ella pidió a Sarah con la mirada que la protegiera y la guiara a través del momento, y sin palabras Sarah la consoló."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Wordlessly, the two try to negotiate a strategy."
msgstr "En silencio, las dos intentan negociar una estrategia."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Wordlessly, they could now speak."
msgstr "Sin palabras, ahora podían hablar."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Words meant little to the creature."
msgstr "Las palabras significaban poco para la criatura."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Work on the ship often cycled between long stretches of boredom and peaks of intensity."
msgstr "El trabajo en el barco solía oscilar entre largos periodos de aburrimiento y momentos de máxima intensidad."

msgctxt "speaker:Marshal Edmond"
msgid "Work with these foreign dogs? Never."
msgstr "¿Trabajar con estos perros extranjeros? Jamás."

msgctxt "speaker:Official"
msgid "Work! Work!"
msgstr "¡Trabaja! ¡Trabaja!"

msgctxt "speaker:Alfred"
msgid "Work's done, I see."
