msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Worship."
msgstr "Adoración."

msgctxt "speaker:Sakar"
msgid "Worst thing in the world you can do to a young man is give him a pile of money."
msgstr "Lo peor que puedes hacerle a un joven es darle una pila de dinero."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Worst, Sarah could hear her lungs rattle each time she drewn in her breath."
msgstr "Lo peor, Sarah podía oír cómo sus pulmones crujían con cada respiración que tomaba."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Worth his time?"
msgstr "¿Vale su tiempo?"

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Worth my while? How?"
msgstr "¿Vale la pena? ¿Cómo?"

msgctxt "speaker:Samayra"
msgid "Would I have done that if I hated you?"
msgstr "¿Lo habría hecho si te odiara?"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Would Marius have done the same? Or did he always slink away like a coward?"
msgstr "¿Habría hecho lo mismo Marius? ¿O siempre se había escondido como un cobarde?"

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Would be me."
msgstr "Sería yo."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Would do what?"
msgstr "¿Qué haría?"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Would he be angry with her? Would he hit her. Please Gods, thought Sarah, let him forgive me."
msgstr "¿Le enojaría con ella? ¿La golpearía? Oh, Dioses, pensó Sarah: que me perdone."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Would he ever tell her, she wondered, what caused each of these?"
msgstr "¿Alguna vez le diría, se preguntó, qué causaba cada uno de estos?"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Would he understand if she told him that she loved him because she hated him? Sarah did not know if she herself could even understand."
msgstr "¿Entendería si le dijera que lo amaba porque lo odiaba? Sarah no sabía si ella misma siquiera podría entenderlo."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Would he?"
msgstr "¿Lo haría?"

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Would it be alright if I thought about it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Would it be any comfort to the servant girl that the man who would take her was closer to her own age and handsome?"
msgstr "¿Le sería de consuelo a la criada que el hombre que la tomaría fuera más cercano a su propia edad y guapo?"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Would it be enough to break the charge?"
msgstr "¿Sería suficiente para derribar la carga?"

msgctxt "speaker:Razaphel"
msgid "Would it be so bad if you just stayed here forever?"
msgstr "¿Sería tan malo si simplemente te quedaras aquí para siempre?"

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Would it make a difference?"
msgstr "¿Haría alguna diferencia?"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Would she even know it if she saw it?"
msgstr "¿La conocería siquiera si lo viera?"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Would she even want to be that cold?"
msgstr "¿Querría ella incluso ser tan fría?"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Would she ever be so foolish? Sarah couldn't imagine it."
msgstr "¿Sería ella tan tonta alguna vez? Sarah no podía imaginarlo."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Would she ever even see him again?"
msgstr "¿Lo vería alguna vez de nuevo?"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Would she ever feel clean again?"
msgstr "¿Podría sentirse limpia de nuevo?"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Would she have another day as free of care as she did back then? As she did even only a week ago?"
msgstr "¿Tendría otro día tan libre de preocupaciones como el que tuvo entonces? ¿Como el de hace apenas una semana?"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Would she have been happier, she wondered, if she'd never taken a step on this path to begin with?"
msgstr "¿Sería más feliz, se preguntó, si nunca hubiera dado un paso en este camino desde el principio?"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Would she know in the moment?"
msgstr "¿Lo sabría en el momento?"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Would she one day forget?"
msgstr "¿Se olvidaría algún día?"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Would she really be able to find another job this easily?"
msgstr "¿Encontraría realmente otro trabajo tan fácilmente?"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Would she resent her for it?"
msgstr "¿La odiaría por ello?"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Would she see this as a defeat."
msgstr "¿Volvería a ver esto como una derrota?"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Would she?"
