msgctxt "speaker:Carolyn"
msgid "You have a good heart, but strength and love are not opposite forces, my dear."
msgstr "Tienes un buen corazón, pero la fuerza y el amor no son fuerzas opuestas, mi querida."

msgctxt "speaker:Cassius"
msgid "You have a good heart. A good head."
msgstr "Tienes un buen corazón. Una buena cabeza."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You have a lot of fucking nerve coming over to me like that."
msgstr "Tienes una jodida valentía viniendo a mí de esa manera."

msgctxt "speaker:Razaphel"
msgid "You have a mind for the more academic."
msgstr "Tienes una mente para lo académico."

msgctxt "speaker:Brigand"
msgid "You have a mouth on you. You're not scared of me?"
msgstr "Tienes boca para decir eso. ¿No tienes miedo de mí?"

msgctxt "speaker:Kate"
msgid "You have a people that wait for your return."
msgstr "Tienes un pueblo que espera tu regreso."

msgctxt "speaker:Garret"
msgid "You have a proper name, or just a title?"
msgstr "¿Tienes un nombre propio o solo un título?"

msgctxt "speaker:Carolyn"
msgid "You have a stronger claim than either of them."
msgstr "Tienes una postura más fuerte que cualquiera de los dos."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You have a whole magical house, and you're bored?"
msgstr "¿Tienes una casa entera mágica y estás aburrida?"

msgctxt "speaker:Hassar"
msgid "You have already gifted me with more loyalty than I had hoped to expect of you."
msgstr "Ya me has regalado más lealtad de la que esperaba."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You have an odd outlook on life, Jaeid."
msgstr "Tienes una perspectiva inusual de la vida, Jaeid."

msgctxt "speaker:Kate"
msgid "You have any idea what it was?"
msgstr "¿Tienes alguna idea de qué se trataba?"

msgctxt "speaker:Razaphel"
msgid "You have asked me all you wish to know, but one question still remains to you."
msgstr "Ya has preguntado todo lo que querías saber, pero aún queda una pregunta pendiente para ti."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You have been a great host."
msgstr "Has sido un gran anfitrión."

msgctxt "speaker:Shah Mahda"
msgid "You have betrayed me. If you will not keep your word, I will not keep mine. The vault will remain closed to you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You have both been ever so kind."
msgstr "Ambos han sido extremadamente amables."

msgctxt "speaker:Woodland Spirit"
msgid "You have brought one so wicked of soul to these sacred forests!"
msgstr "¡Has traído a una alma tan perversa a estos sagrados bosques!"

msgctxt "speaker:Razaphel"
msgid "You have changed, as clear from night to day, but to you it will feel no different."
msgstr "Has cambiado, como se nota de la noche al día, pero para ti no será diferente."

msgctxt "speaker:Man"
msgid "You have come to our town. Liberated us from the yoke of the Tribesmen."
msgstr "Has venido a nuestra aldea. Nos has liberado del yugo de los tribales."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You have done nothing tonight but win me as your enemy."
msgstr "No has hecho nada esta noche más que convertirme en tu enemiga."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You have drank and whored away enough money to last most people several lifetimes, and now you play for sympathy?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "speaker:Shah Mahda"
msgid "You have failed me. My city will be looted by these, these savages, and you want a reward?"
msgstr "Fallaste a mí. Mi ciudad será saqueada por estos, por estos salvajes, y tú quieres una recompensa?"

msgctxt "speaker:Razaphel"
msgid "You have found it."
msgstr "Lo has encontrado."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You have given me a lot to think about."
msgstr "Me has dado mucho de qué pensar."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You have given me something to consider, Elder Tirion."
msgstr "Me has dado algo para considerar, Anciano Tirión."

msgctxt "speaker:Duke Antonio"
msgid "You have great tits."
msgstr "Tienes unas tetas grandes."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You have had me in every conceivable way, and I have had you the same."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You have heard the name of my family."
msgstr "Has oído el nombre de mi familia."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You have insulted my honour by even daring to consider such a proposal, let alone speak it!"
msgstr "¡Has ofendido mi honor al atreverte siquiera a considerar tal propuesta, no digas que la pronuncies!"

msgctxt "speaker:Maeiv"
msgid "You have it."
msgstr "Tú tienes."

msgctxt "speaker:Gilead"
msgid "You have killed before."
msgstr "Ya has matado antes."

msgctxt "speaker:Voice"
msgid "You have killed your Order. Aid me in eradicating the Void scourge, and I will work miracles for you."
msgstr "¡Joder! Has matado a tu Orden. Ayúdame a erradicar la plaga del Vacío y haré milagros para ti."

msgctxt "speaker:Alfred"
msgid "You have made me feel like I'm young again."
msgstr "Alfred: Has hecho que me sienta como si fuera joven de nuevo."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You have me mistaken for someone else."
msgstr "Me has confundido con otra persona."

msgctxt "speaker:Samayra"
msgid "You have me."
msgstr "Tienes a mí."

msgctxt "speaker:Vaelen"
msgid "You have more than you imagine. Your life. Your friend. And you do have a home, here, in this camp."
msgstr "Tienes más de lo que imaginas. Tu vida. Tu amiga. Y sí, tienes un hogar, aquí, en este campamento."

msgctxt "speaker:Marshal Edmond"
msgid "You have my support as well, Sarah."
msgstr "También tengo tu apoyo, Sarah."

msgctxt "speaker:Lily"
msgid "You have no idea what that bitch Maeiv is up to. She could be luring you into a trap."
msgstr "No tienes ni idea de lo que esa zorra Maeiv está tramando. Podría estar tentándote a caer en una trampa."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You have nothing to fear from me, Razaphel. I hold no animus against you."
msgstr "No tienes nada que temer de mí, Razafael. No siento ningún resentimiento contra ti."

msgctxt "speaker:Kate"
msgid "You have obligations that are bigger than me."
msgstr "Tienes obligaciones mayores que las mías."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You have offered us little real evidence, more than a piece of paper whose contents House Greytower no doubt disputes."
msgstr "¡Tú nos has ofrecido poca prueba real, más que un papel cuyo contenido la Casa Greytower sin duda disputa!"

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You have one! Have the army ready by then."
msgstr "¡Tienes una! ¡Ten el ejército listo para entonces!"

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You have only ever one role to play, Brother."
msgstr "Solo tienes un papel que desempeñar, hermano."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You have other affairs?"
msgstr "¿Tienes otros amantes?"

msgctxt "speaker:Xanthippe"
msgid "You have our sympathies."
msgstr "Sentimos por ti."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You have people who love you. More than just me."
msgstr "Tienes personas que te aman. Más que solo a mí."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You have seen me...in your dreams?"
msgstr "¿Me has visto... en tus sueños?"

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You have spend all your life fearing the others in the Union."
msgstr "Has pasado toda tu vida temiendo a los demás en la Unión."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You have spoken and I have heard."
msgstr "Has hablado y yo he escuchado."

msgctxt "speaker:Lily"
msgid "You have terrible guards."
msgstr "Tienes guardias terribles."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You have the best cock in all of Lethram!"
msgstr "¡Tienes la mejor polla de todo Lethram!"

msgctxt "speaker:Gideon"
msgid "You have three sisters?"
msgstr "¿Tienes tres hermanas?"

msgctxt "speaker:Caleb"
msgid "You have to be careful with those jumps. You're pretty good, but one slip up and it can mean the end."
msgstr "Tienes que tener cuidado con esos saltos. Eres bastante bueno, pero un solo error puede significar el fin."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You have to remember why you fought so hard to stay alive, why you left Rosanna in the first place."
msgstr "Tienes que recordar por qué luchaste tan duro para seguir con vida y por qué dejaste a Rosanna en primer lugar."

msgctxt "speaker:Kate"
msgid "You have to retreat into the back lines!"
msgstr "¡Debes retroceder a las líneas traseras, ahora mismo!"

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You have to stop making me laugh, I'm gonna die from exhaustion!"
msgstr "Tienes que dejar de hacerme reír, ¡voy a morir de agotamiento!"

msgctxt "speaker:Caleb"
msgid "You have to tell me how you did it!"
msgstr "¡Tienes que decirme cómo lo lograste!"

msgctxt "speaker:Marius"
msgid "You have to understand...I've never..."
msgstr "Tienes que entender... nunca he..."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You have to. Especially now."
msgstr "Tienes que hacerlo. Especialmente ahora."

msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "You have to? You're really that desperate?"
msgstr "¿Tienes que hacerlo? ¿Estás realmente tan desesperado?"

msgctxt "speaker:Thomas"
msgid "You have travelled far to utter your threats, but they do not frighten us."
msgstr "Has recorrido un largo camino para lanzar tus amenazas, pero no nos aterrorizan."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You have until the end of next day."
msgstr "Tienes hasta el final del día siguiente."

msgctxt "speaker:Gilead"
msgid "You have worked your wonders, I see."
msgstr "Has hecho tus milagros, lo veo."

msgctxt "speaker:Carolyn"
msgid "You have your family name, you have an entire army, but more than anything, this is the source of your family's power."
msgstr "Tienes el nombre de tu familia, tienes un ejército entero, pero sobre todo, esto es la fuente del poder de tu familia."

msgctxt "speaker:King Orwell Rose"
msgid "You have your mother's heart."
msgstr "Tienes el corazón de tu madre."

msgctxt "speaker:Tribesman"
msgid "You have?"
msgstr "¿Tú tienes?"

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You haven't acted like yourself for a while now. Let us put whatever this is to rest."
msgstr "No has actuado como tú misma en un buen tiempo. Dejemos esto atrás."

msgctxt "speaker:Garret"
msgid "You haven't...but maybe you're too hard on yourself."
msgstr "No lo has hecho... pero quizás te exijas demasiado."

msgctxt "speaker:Soldier"
msgid "You hear that, girly? You're all clear."
msgstr "¿Oyes eso, guapa? Ya estás a salvo."

msgctxt "speaker:Hecate"
msgid "You hear this girl, Gabriel?"
msgstr "¿Oyes a esta chica, Gabriel?"

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You heard him...what other choice do we have?"
msgstr "Lo escuchaste... ¿qué otra opción tenemos?"

msgctxt "speaker:Duke Antonio"
msgid "You heard me."
msgstr "Me oyes."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You heard me. I don't owe you anything, you lech."
msgstr "Te escuché. No te debo nada, tú lechón."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You held a knife to my throat."
msgstr "Sostuviste un cuchillo contra mi garganta."

msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "You help fugitives like us, you risk the noose here in Lethram."
msgstr "Alaric Ayudas a los fugitivos como nosotros, y arriesgas tu vida aquí en Lethram."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You honour me too much when you speak of me as a princess."
msgstr "Me honras demasiado cuando hablas de mí como si fuera una princesa."

msgctxt "speaker:Maeiv"
msgid "You honour me with your presence, now please, allow my servants to escort you to your quarters."
msgstr "Me honras con tu presencia; ahora, por favor, permite que mis sirvientas te acompañen a tus aposentos."

msgctxt "speaker:Maeiv"
msgid "You honour me, Duke Antonio."
msgstr "Me honra, Duque Antonio."

msgctxt "speaker:Maeiv"
msgid "You hope to stick the dagger in deeper?"
msgstr "¿Esperas que clavemos el puñal más hondo?"

msgctxt "speaker:Raza"
msgid "You human woman, so stupid!"
msgstr "¡Mujer humana, ¡tú eres tan estúpida!"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "You idiot, you've got their attention now, she thinks."
msgstr "Idiota, ya tienen su atención ahora, piensa ella."

msgctxt "speaker:Razaphel"
msgid "You imagine our race, like yours, to be one of many singulars."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "speaker:Razaphel"
msgid "You imagine your world to be the way all worlds are, but this is not true."
msgstr "Imaginas que tu mundo es como todos los demás, pero eso no es cierto."

msgctxt "speaker:King-On-The-Outside"
msgid "You imagine yourself free to walk in either direction."
msgstr "Imaginas que eres libre para caminar en ambas direcciones."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You imagined wrong. I'm in no mood for anything, least of all that."
msgstr "Te equivocaste. No tengo ánimo para nada, menos aún para eso."

msgctxt "speaker:Damian"
msgid "You in The Den."
msgstr "En El Refugio."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You insult my honour with your vile proposal. And after, you expect me to slink away like a coward?"
msgstr "Insultas mi honor con tu vil propuesta. Y después, ¿me esperas que huya como un cobarde?"

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You intend to block the proposal to unify the armies, simply to spite me."
msgstr "¿Quieres bloquear la propuesta de unificar los ejércitos, simplemente por fastidiarme?"

msgctxt "speaker:Gorak"
msgid "You invade our lands?!"
msgstr "¡¿Invasas nuestras tierras?!"

msgctxt "speaker:Gorak"
msgid "You invade! My hunters found you on our land, stealing flint! Stealing wood!"
msgstr "¡Invasión! Mis cazadores te encontraron en nuestra tierra, robando piedra de fuego... ¡robando madera!"

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You joined the Tribesmen?"
msgstr "¿Te uniste a los tribales?"

msgctxt "speaker:Eula"
msgid "You just ain't hard enough or clever enough to avoid that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "speaker:Carolyn"
msgid "You just always seem so busy."
msgstr "Siempre pareces tan ocupada."

msgctxt "speaker:Sigmund"
msgid "You just follow the road up here, no more than a few minutes walking."
msgstr "Solo sigues el camino hacia arriba, no más de unos minutos caminando."

msgctxt "speaker:Kim"
msgid "You just gotta...understand what kind of tool someone is, and use them for the proper purpose, or you're just gonna get dissapointed."
msgstr "Solo tienes que... entender qué tipo de herramienta es alguien y usarlo para el propósito adecuado, o simplemente te vas a decepcionar."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You just make sure Kate doesn't come across you like this. I can't promise she won't try something."
msgstr "Asegúrate de que Kate no te encuentre así. No puedo prometer que no intente algo."

msgctxt "speaker:Samayra"
msgid "You just said I made you feel happy, like you haven't been happy in a long time."
msgstr "Acabas de decir que te hice sentir feliz, como si no hubieras estado feliz desde hace mucho tiempo."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You just told me that I can walk through a door and see my home country again..."
msgstr "Acabas de decirme que puedo cruzar una puerta y ver mi país de nuevo..."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You just wanted an excuse for us to run around the woods again."
msgstr "Solo querías una excusa para correr otra vez por el bosque."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You just wanted to claim me?"
msgstr "¿Solo querías reclamar-me?"

msgctxt "speaker:Gideon"
msgid "You just...always kind of seemed distant."
msgstr "Siempre parecías tan distante."

msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "You just...and the fire! And you shoulda seen their faces!"
msgstr "¡Solo... y el fuego! ¡Y debiste ver sus caras!"

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You keep fucking me like this and I'll give it all up."
msgstr "Si sigues follando conmigo así, lo dejaré todo."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You keep saying that. Don't worry."
msgstr "Sigues diciendo eso. Tranquila."

msgctxt "speaker:Matthew"
msgid "You keep to that, you won't get no trouble with me."
msgstr "Si te mantienes así, no tendrás problemas conmigo."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You keep your secrets, I'll keep mine."
msgstr "Guardas tus secretos, yo guardaré los míos."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You kept it?"
msgstr "¿Lo guardaste?"

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You kill my brother, and you and your family will live in infamy for centuries."
msgstr "Matas a mi hermano, y tú y tu familia viviréis en infamia durante siglos."

msgctxt "speaker:Kate"
msgid "You killed Caleb...and Ephraim..."
msgstr "¡Lo mataste... a Caleb... y a Efraim..."

msgctxt "speaker:Kate"
msgid "You killed a mage! You know how many people can say that?"
msgstr "¡Mataste a un mago! ¿Sabes cuánta gente puede decir eso?"

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You killed him?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "speaker:Mythran Prince"
msgid "You killed my nephew. You brought all this upon yourself, remember that while you hear your family get tortured to death."
msgstr "Mataste a mi sobrino. Tú mismo te has traído todo esto encima, ¡recuérdalo! Mientras escuchas cómo tu familia es despedazada."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You killed them..."
msgstr "Los mataste..."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You know I can't just let you walk away from this without any punishment."
msgstr "Sabes que no puedo dejarte irte de esto sin ningún castigo."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You know I'll be back in less than a month, right?"
msgstr "Sabes que volveré en menos de un mes, ¿verdad?"

msgctxt "speaker:Kate"
msgid "You know I'm always on good behavior."
msgstr "Sabes que siempre me porto bien."

msgctxt "speaker:Atilla"
msgid "You know a little about orcs, correct?"
msgstr "Sabes un poco de los orcos, ¿verdad?"

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You know a lot about the tribesmen, don't you?"
msgstr "¿Sabes mucho de los tribales, no es cierto?"

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You know a place?"
msgstr "¿Conoces algún lugar?"

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You know anything about the Union Council?"
msgstr "¿Sabes algo sobre el Consejo de la Unión?"

msgctxt "speaker:Captain Belmont"
msgid "You know blondie, if you're gonna act like a disobedient child, I'll teach you like one."
msgstr "Sabes, rubia, si vas a comportarte como una niña desobediente, te enseñaré como tal."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You know his story though, right?"
msgstr "¿Pero sabes su historia, ¿verdad?"

msgctxt "speaker:Garret"
msgid "You know how I feel?! How could you possibly know what such loss is like?!"
msgstr "¿Sabes cómo me siento? ¿Cómo es posible que sepas qué significa perder algo así?"

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You know how he gets. He'd kill you if he found us like that."
msgstr "Ya sabes cómo se pone él. Te mataría si nos encontrara así."

msgctxt "speaker:Alfred"
msgid "You know how much the loss of your mother hurt me."
msgstr "Sabes cuánto me dolió la pérdida de tu madre."

msgctxt "speaker:Soldier"
msgid "You know how that feels for a guy? To get all worked up and then no release?"
msgstr "¿Sabes cómo se siente eso para un tipo? Que se ponga todo excitado y luego no haya alivio?"

msgctxt "speaker:Eula"
msgid "You know how to fight?"
msgstr "¿Sabes cómo pelear?"

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You know how to read the land. An army can always use good scouts."
msgstr "Conoces cómo leer el terreno. Un ejército siempre puede usar buenos exploradores."

msgctxt "speaker:Voice"
msgid "You know me already."
msgstr "Ya te conozco."

msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "You know me too well, I guess."
msgstr "Me conoces demasiado bien, supongo."

msgctxt "speaker:King-On-The-Outside"
msgid "You know nothing, Sarah Rose. You are but an instrument. A puppet."
msgstr "No sabes nada, Sarah Rose. Eres solo un instrumento. Un títere."

msgctxt "speaker:Razaphel"
msgid "You know of how my kind came about in your world, do you not?"
msgstr "¿Sabes de cómo surgió mi especie en tu mundo, no es cierto?"

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You know or what!"
msgstr "¡Sabes o qué!"

msgctxt "speaker:Carolyn"
msgid "You know that I am but a small agent on behalf of the Mythran empire."
msgstr "Sabes que soy solo un pequeño agente en nombre del imperio Mythran."

msgctxt "speaker:King Orwell Rose"
msgid "You know that every year I visit a different part of the kingdom, and this year, I went to see the eastern provinces."
msgstr "Sabes que cada año visito una parte diferente del reino, y este año fui a ver las provincias orientales."

msgctxt "speaker:Kim"
msgid "You know that last girl that was in the bunk next to me?"
msgstr "¿Sabes que la última chica que estaba en la litera al lado mío?"

msgctxt "speaker:Thomas"
msgid "You know that...you don't have to do this right?"
msgstr "¿Sabes que... no tienes que hacer esto, ¿verdad?"

msgctxt "speaker:Captain Belmont"
msgid "You know the drill, strip blondie."
msgstr "Sabes la rutina, pelirroja."

msgctxt "speaker:Kate"
msgid "You know they are."
msgstr "Sabes que lo son."

msgctxt "speaker:Atilla"
msgid "You know this place well."
msgstr "Conoces este lugar muy bien."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You know this stuff?"
msgstr "¿Conoces esto?"

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You know what I mean."
msgstr "¿Entiendes a qué me refiero?"

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You know what I want. What I need."
msgstr "Sabes lo que quiero. Lo que necesito."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You know what I'm talking about! The thing...around his...thing."
msgstr "¡Sabes a qué me refiero! ¡A la cosa... que rodea su... polla."

msgctxt "speaker:Kate"
msgid "You know what is funny? I always believed him. I always imagined that he was destined for something great. Just like you."
msgstr "¿Sabes qué es gracioso? Siempre creí en él. Siempre imaginé que estaba destinado a algo grande. Al igual que tú."

msgctxt "speaker:Xanthippe"
msgid "You know what that means?"
msgstr "¿Sabes qué significa eso?"

msgctxt "speaker:Romanov Twin"
msgid "You know what time it is. Pay up."
msgstr "¿Sabes qué hora es? Paga."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You know what, Alaric, I don't really give a damn what way you feel about me one way or the other."
msgstr "Sabes qué, Alaric, no me importa realmente cómo te sientas hacia mí, de una forma u otra."

msgctxt "speaker:Captain Belmont"
msgid "You know what, Blondie?"
msgstr "¿Sabes qué es, rubia?"

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You know what, I think you're just a jealous old bastard whose afraid."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You know what, Samayra...we can go!"
msgstr "Sabes qué, Samayra... ¡podemos irnos!"

msgctxt "speaker:Nickolas"
msgid "You know what, Sarah, I'm gonna do this and I'm done trying to convince you."
msgstr "Sabes qué, Sarah, voy a hacer esto y ya no voy a intentar convencerte más."

msgctxt "speaker:Voice"
msgid "You know where I am."
msgstr "Sabes dónde estoy."

msgctxt "speaker:Albert"
msgid "You know why I keep you around."
msgstr "Sabes por qué te mantengo cerca."

msgctxt "speaker:Lily"
msgid "You know why."
msgstr "Sabes por qué."

msgctxt "speaker:Jaeid"
msgid "You know why. I have my orders to bring you to Hassar...unviolated. I cannot go against his orders."
msgstr "Sabes por qué. Tengo mis órdenes para traerte a Hassar... virgen. No puedo ir en contra de sus órdenes."

msgctxt "speaker:Jaeid"
msgid "You know why. I have my orders to bring you to Hassar...unviolated. I cannot violate his orders."
msgstr "Sabes por qué. Tengo órdenes de traerte a Hassar... intacta. No puedo ir en contra de ellas."

msgctxt "speaker:Razaphel"
msgid "You know why. If you want to understand their order, you must broaden the context of your understanding."
msgstr "Sabes por qué. Si quieres comprender su orden, debes ampliar el contexto de tu entendimiento."

msgctxt "speaker:Damian"
msgid "You know, Alaric..."
msgstr "Sabes, Alaric..."

msgctxt "speaker:Alfred"
msgid "You know, I actually liked you."
msgstr "Sabes que en realidad te gustaba."

msgctxt "speaker:Kate"
msgid "You know, I almost died down there."
msgstr "Sabes, casi morí abajo."

msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "You know, I almost died today."
msgstr "Sabes, casi morí hoy."

msgctxt "speaker:Captain Belmont"
msgid "You know, I always wondered..."
msgstr "¿Sabías que siempre me pregunté..."

msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "You know, I got neighbours."
msgstr "Sabes que tengo vecinos."

msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "You know, I got pretty close to dying today. If I had been just a little slow, I'd have been done for."
