msgstr "¿Estás derrochando cosas preciosas en mi barco?"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "You were a king or a queen if people thought you were."
msgstr "Si la gente te lo creía, eras un rey o una reina."

msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "You were acting like a real cunt just a minute ago, so I wanna nut on your face."
