msgid "You're...amazing..."
msgstr "Eres... increíble..."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You're...offering me a job here? Working at the Inn?"
msgstr "¿Me ofreces un trabajo aquí? Trabajando en la Posada?"

msgctxt "speaker:Female Soldier"
msgid "You're...that was incredible."
msgstr "Eso... fue increíble."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You're...you're hurting me..."
msgstr "Me estás... lastimando..."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You've always been the one to get me into trouble."
msgstr "Siempre has sido el que me mete en problemas."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You've been doing a great job managing all the paperwork. I couldn't do all of this without you."
msgstr "Has hecho un gran trabajo gestionando toda la burocracia. No podría haber logrado todo esto sin ti."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You've been gone for years...I missed you...and now it's like you never left."
msgstr "Llevas años ausente... te he echado de menos tanto que ahora parece que nunca partiste."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You've been having fun."
msgstr "Has estado divirtiéndote."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You've been here for that long?"
msgstr "¿Has estado aquí todo este tiempo?"

msgctxt "speaker:Atilla"
msgid "You've been keeping to your training. You might imagine that I didn't notice, but I did."
msgstr "Has estado siguiendo tu entrenamiento. Podrías imaginar que no me había dado cuenta, pero sí."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You've been making the rounds?"
msgstr "¿Has estado dando vueltas?"

msgctxt "speaker:Xanthippe"
msgid "You've been my apprentice for a few years now. I've taught you plenty, but lately I've been starting to think that my mentorship is holding you back."
msgstr "Has sido mi aprendiz durante unos años. Te he enseñado mucho, pero últimamente estoy empezando a pensar que mi tutela te está frenando."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You've been through a lot. The best thing for you now is to try and just recover."
msgstr "Has pasado por mucho. Lo mejor para ti ahora es intentar recuperarte."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You've been with a lot of girls?"
msgstr "¿Con muchas chicas has estado?"

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You've changed so much..."
msgstr "Has cambiado tanto..."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You've found a nice spot."
msgstr "Has encontrado un buen sitio."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You've given me a lot to consider..."
msgstr "Me has dado mucho que considerar..."

msgctxt "speaker:Varga"
msgid "You've given me a rare opportunity and I promise I will serve you and your brother as best I can."
msgstr "Me has dado una oportunidad única y te prometo que serviré a ti y a tu hermano lo mejor que pueda."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You've given me no reason to do so. All you've given me is an endless supply of books."
msgstr "No has dado ninguna razón para hacerlo. Todo lo que me has dado es un suministro infinito de libros."

msgctxt "speaker:Alfred"
msgid "You've got a nice cunt, but there's a lot of whores that sell theirs for less."
msgstr "Tienes un coño bonito, pero hay muchas putas que venden el suyo por menos."

msgctxt "speaker:Atilla"
msgid "You've gotten quick."
msgstr "Ya te has follado rápido."

msgctxt "speaker:King Orwell Rose"
msgid "You've grown older but I don't think you've grown up yet."
msgstr "Has envejecido, pero no creo que hayas madurado aún."

msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "You've had it before, huh? Always knew you were a fancy girl."
msgstr "Ya lo has hecho antes, ¿eh? Siempre supe que eras una chula."

msgctxt "speaker:Vaelen"
msgid "You've handed down the orders, not see to it that they are enforced. By whatever means necessary."
msgstr "Has dado las órdenes, pero no te has asegurado de que se cumplan. Por cualquier medio necesario."

msgctxt "speaker:Sakar"
msgid "You've heard him talk before about the bandit kingdoms, and the history of this place, but did you ever wonder how he knew most of that?"
msgstr "Ya has oído hablar de los reinos bandidos y la historia de este lugar, pero ¿alguna vez te preguntaste cómo él sabía la mayoría de eso?"

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You've likely read more on her than I have. But I suspect that the outcome of this council will not be decided by history books."
msgstr "Probablemente has leído más sobre ella que yo. Pero sospecho que el resultado de este consejo no será decidido por los libros de historia."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You've lived your life, I've lived mine. I can't ask you to change the past."
msgstr "Viviste tu vida, yo viví la mía. No puedo pedirte que cambies el pasado."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You've made a very big mistake coming here."
msgstr "Has cometido un error muy grave al venir aquí."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You've made quite a plan for yourself."
msgstr "Has hecho un plan bastante interesante para ti."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You've never left?"
msgstr "¿Nunca has salido?"

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You've played this game a lot?"
msgstr "¿Has jugado mucho a este juego?"

msgctxt "speaker:Kate"
msgid "You've probably got a hundred pairs."
msgstr "Probablemente tengas un centenar de pares."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You've ruined my dress. If anyone needs to pay someone something, it's you to me."
msgstr "Has arruinado mi vestido. Si alguien tiene que pagarle algo a alguien, es tú a mí."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You've said that a few times now...what is that? The old road?"
msgstr "Has dicho eso un par de veces ahora... ¿qué es eso? ¿El viejo camino?"

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You've said that...before..."
msgstr "Lo has dicho... antes..."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You've seen me naked plenty of times, I don't get why you're still so stressed about it."
msgstr "Ya me has visto desnuda bastantes veces, no entiendo por qué sigues tan estresado al respecto."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You've seen one before?"
msgstr "¿Has visto una antes?"

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You've shown me a kindness when nobody else will."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "speaker:Sigmund"
msgid "You've soured my mood."
msgstr "Has estropeado mi humor."

msgctxt "speaker:Kate"
msgid "You've stolen a silver cup, and now you're even insulting the good reputation of fine folks..."
msgstr "¡Ha robado una copa de plata y ahora hasta insulta la buena reputación de la gente decente..."

msgctxt "speaker:Carolyn"
msgid "You've taken a big step today."
msgstr "Has dado un gran paso hoy."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You've taken to reading, have you?"
msgstr "¿Te has puesto a leer, ¿eh?"

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You've worked with him before."
msgstr "Ya has trabajado con él antes."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You, Alaric, have the biggest, best dick in all of Lethram. All of the world!"
msgstr "¡Tú, Alaric! Tienes la polla más grande y mejor de todo Lethram... ¡de todo el mundo!"

msgctxt "speaker:Damian"
msgid "You, boy..."
msgstr "Tú, muchacho..."

msgctxt "speaker:Xanthippe"
msgid "You, maybe, but I'm not as young as I may appear. Holding off those attacks takes a lot out of me."
msgstr "Tal vez tú, pero no soy tan joven como podría parecer. Detener esos ataques me agota mucho."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You, me, all of us, need one another, or we will all die to their horde."
msgstr "Tú, yo y todos los demás necesitamos unos a otros, o moriremos ante su horda."

msgctxt "speaker:Sophia"
msgid "You, me, and the others of course."
msgstr "Tú, yo y los demás, por supuesto."

msgctxt "speaker:Damian"
msgid "You, missy."
msgstr "Tú, señorita."

msgctxt "speaker:Atilla"
msgid "You, more than anyone, knows what this necklace mean to me..."
msgstr "Tú, más que nadie, sabes lo que este collar significa para mí..."

msgctxt "speaker:Carolyn"
msgid "You, my dear, are the final piece to the puzzle."
msgstr "Tú, mi querida, eres la pieza final del rompecabezas."

msgctxt "speaker:Atilla"
msgid "You, on the other hand..."
msgstr "Tú, por otro lado..."

msgctxt "speaker:Carolyn"
msgid "You, should you prevail, will be all the stronger for it."
msgstr "Tú, si logras prevalecer, serás mucho más fuerte por ello."

msgctxt "speaker:Daemon"
msgid "You, that girl Dalia, you are here to serve my needs. Remember that."
msgstr "Tú, esa muchacha Dalia, estás aquí para satisfacer mis necesidades. Acuérdate de eso."

msgctxt "speaker:Daemon"
msgid "You, unlike Dalia, do not yet understand your situation."
msgstr "Tú, a diferencia de Dalia, aún no comprendes tu situación."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
